#: docs/reference/api/components.md:8
msgid "Optional common components"
msgstr "可选通用组件"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:10
msgid ""
"These declarations come from public header files. Selection, lifecycle, "
"supported execution modes and physical authorization remain bounded by the "
"corresponding design and support records."
msgstr "这些声明来自公共头文件。选择、生命周期、支持的执行模式和物理资源授权范围仍以对应设计及支持记录为准。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:12
msgid "Explicit peripheral and protocol components"
msgstr "显式外设与协议组件"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:14
msgid ""
"These optional C11 targets consume already selected public I/O faces. The "
"caller owns static storage, serialized progress, finite deadlines, outer "
"resource lifetimes and recovery. They add no implicit worker, allocator, "
"calibration or product policy. The linked bilingual component contract is "
"authoritative; this table is an API navigation aid."
msgstr ""
"这些可选 C11 目标使用已选择的公共 I/O "
"接口。调用方负责静态存储、串行推进、有限截止时间、外层资源生命周期和恢复。组件不隐式创建工作线程、分配器、校准或产品策略。详细约定以链接中的双语组件合同为准；本表仅用于查找"
" API。"

