#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612 docs/reference/api/components.md:620
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41 docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Exact caller-owned instance, fresh zero before first init."
msgstr "调用者拥有精确实例，首次 init 前须清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:41
msgid ""
"Task-only, one serialized executor and exclusive endpoint current-address "
"pointer. No concurrent or reentrant calls. The immutable endpoint, ops, "
"opaque contexts and clock remain live and disjoint from device and payload "
"storage. Fields are implementation state, not reclaim permission."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由一个执行者串行推进，并独占端点的当前地址指针。禁止并发或重入调用。不可变端点、ops、不透明上下文和时钟必须持续有效，且与器件状态及载荷存储互不重叠。字段属于实现状态，不能据此认定可以回收存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:47
msgid "software_i2c.h"
msgstr "software_i2c.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Bounded open-drain GPIO I2C with explicit bus withdrawal."
msgstr "有界开漏 GPIO I2C，显式撤出总线。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Bind strict I2C and observe released idle under a budget."
msgstr "绑定严格 I2C，并在预算内观察已释放的空闲状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"Invalid input or expired preflight touches no pin. Once a pin write is "
"attempted, failure retains the same binding for explicit recovery/stop. Init "
"is not physical bus proof."
msgstr ""
"输入无效或预检已过期时不触碰任何引脚。一旦尝试写引脚，失败就会保留相同绑定，以供显式 recovery/stop。Init 不证明物理总线状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped disjoint owner"
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化或已停止的所有者，存储互不重叠"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Immutable wiring, alive through successful stop"
msgstr "[in] 不可变接线配置，持续有效直至成功停止"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Finite absolute time in config clock domain"
msgstr "[in] config 时钟域内的有限绝对时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, TIMEOUT or GPIO/clock error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、TIMEOUT 或 GPIO/时钟错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Project the synchronous strict-I2C face for one child."
msgstr "为一个子端点投影同步严格 I2C 接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"No discovery, allocation or hardware start. Face, child, owner, config and "
"contexts outlive all calls. Transactions use 1..8 messages of 1..256 bytes, "
"repeated START between messages and one final STOP. transferred counts "
"completed payload bytes, excluding address phases; partial reads may remain "
"on error. All spans release even when STOP fails, while the physical bus "
"owner remains faulted and retained. Async submit/start are unsupported, never"
" a stack fallback."
msgstr ""
"不发现、不分配内存，也不启动硬件。接口、子端点、所有者、配置和上下文的生命周期须覆盖所有调用。事务包含 1..8 条消息，每条 1..256 "
"字节；消息间使用重复 START，最后发送一次 STOP。transferred 计数已完成的载荷字节，不含地址阶段；出错时可能保留部分读取结果。即使 "
"STOP 失败，对所有缓冲区范围的借用也会结束，但物理总线所有者仍保持故障并保留。不支持异步 submit/start，绝不回退使用栈缓冲区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Immutable child, exact 7-bit address 08h..77h"
msgstr "[in] 不可变子端点，精确 7 位地址范围为 08h..77h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Shared-method value face, or zero for invalid/SCCB child"
msgstr "共享方法的值类型接口；子端点无效或为 SCCB 时返回零"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Project exact controller identity and nonwaiting stop."
msgstr "投影精确控制器身份及不等待的 stop。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"Port recover has no deadline and is UNSUPPORTED. Its stop only "
"releases/observes an already proved idle bus; otherwise BUSY retains "
"ownership. Use the direct budgeted APIs below."
msgstr ""
"Port recover 不带截止时间，返回 UNSUPPORTED。其 stop 仅释放/观察已证明空闲的总线；否则返回 BUSY "
"并保留所有权。请使用下方直接提供的带预算 API。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Stable physical owner"
msgstr "[inout] 稳定的物理所有者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Shared-method controller face; no hardware access"
msgstr "共享方法的控制器接口；不访问硬件"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Explicitly attempt one protocol STOP under a new budget."
msgstr "在新预算内显式尝试一次协议 STOP。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"Caller first reestablishes exclusive bus ownership, including after "
"arbitration, and joins foreign writers/controllers. This is one explicit "
"STOP, never nine-clock bus clear, reset, transaction replay or clock-domain "
"replacement."
msgstr ""
"调用方须先重新建立总线独占所有权，包括仲裁后，并汇合其他写入者/控制器。本操作仅显式发送一次 "
"STOP，绝不进行九时钟总线清除、复位、事务重放或时钟域替换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Same retained binding, with no active call"
msgstr "[inout] 相同的保留绑定，当前无活动调用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup time in the same live clock domain"
msgstr "[in] 同一有效时钟域内的有限清理时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after STOP/idle observation; other errors retain the fault, "
"immutable binding and external pin-owner duty"
msgstr "仅观察到 STOP/空闲后返回 SUCCESS；其他错误保留故障、不可变绑定及外部引脚所有者责任"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Finish one explicit STOP and drop only a proved binding."
msgstr "完成一次显式 STOP，仅解除已证明可解除的绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"Same exclusive-bus precondition as recover. No outer GPIO lease or Board "
"modes are released here. Clock discontinuity cannot be repaired by a new "
"numerical deadline."
msgstr "总线独占前提与 recover 相同。此处不释放外层 GPIO 租约或 Board 模式。新的数值截止时间不能修复时钟不连续。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Same serialized wire owner"
msgstr "[inout] 同一个串行使用的总线所有者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup budget, not an expired transfer one"
msgstr "[in] 有限清理预算，不能使用已过期的传输预算"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY or retained cleanup failure"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY，或保留的清理失败"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Observe a retained bus fault without touching pins."
msgstr "观察保留的总线故障，不触碰引脚。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Stable owner or NULL"
msgstr "[in] 稳定的所有者或 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "True only for a non-NULL faulted owner"
msgstr "仅当所有者非 NULL 且处于故障状态时返回 True"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Observe cleanup independently of the primary transfer error."
msgstr "独立于主传输错误观察清理结果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "[in] Stable owner"
msgstr "[in] 稳定的所有者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"Last cleanup outcome, STATE when arbitration forbade STOP, or INVALID for "
"NULL"
msgstr "最后一次清理结果；仲裁禁止 STOP 时为 STATE，NULL 时为 INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Exactly one authorized open-drain bit with actual input readback."
msgstr "恰好一个获授权的开漏位，须读回实际输入。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Immutable single-controller two-wire electrical facts."
msgstr "不可变的单控制器双线电气事实。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"Both pins must already be open-drain outputs with external pull-ups and "
"actual IDR readback. Writing one releases a line; it never drives a push-pull"
" high. Caller owns mode, wiring, voltage and GPIO lifetime. half_period_us is"
" a minimum 5..1000000 us phase, not measured bus frequency. poll_limit is "
"1..1000000 observations per timed wait. No concurrent foreign controller, IRQ"
" writer or clock/pin reconfiguration is permitted. Arbitration detection "
"avoids forcing STOP after a collision; multi-controller operation and bus-"
"clear pulses are not provided."
msgstr ""
"两个引脚必须已配置为开漏输出，配有外部上拉，并能读回实际 IDR。写一表示释放线路，绝不以推挽方式驱动高电平。调用方负责模式、接线、电压和 GPIO "
"生命周期。half_period_us 表示最短 5..1000000 us 的相位时间，不是实测总线频率。poll_limit 为每次定时等待最多 "
"1..1000000 次观察。不允许并发的其他控制器、IRQ 写入者或时钟/引脚重配置。仲裁检测避免碰撞后强制发送 "
"STOP；不提供多控制器运行或总线清除脉冲。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Caller-owned physical wire owner, zero before first init."
msgstr "调用方拥有的物理线路所有者，首次 init 前须清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid ""
"One serialized task executor, no concurrent/reentrant call. No descriptors or"
" payloads survive a synchronous return. An unproved STOP retains config, "
"fault and pin ownership; no buffer loan is invented. Fields are "
"implementation state. SCCB uses this same wire storage with an explicit "
"distinct personality; it is never exposed as an I2C endpoint."
msgstr ""
"单个串行任务执行者，不允许并发/重入调用。同步返回后不保留对描述符或载荷的引用。未获证明的 STOP "
"会保留配置、故障和引脚所有权；不会凭空建立缓冲区借用。字段属于实现状态。SCCB 以显式独立的协议类型使用同一线路存储，绝不暴露为 I2C 端点。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:49
msgid "Immutable exact addressed child; not another bus owner."
msgstr "精确且不可变的寻址子端点；不是另一个总线所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:55
msgid "software_sccb.h"
msgstr "software_sccb.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "Explicit two-wire SCCB register protocol, separate from I2C."
msgstr "显式双线 SCCB 寄存器协议，与 I2C 分离。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "Select the separate SCCB two-wire personality."
msgstr "选择独立的 SCCB 双线协议类型。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid ""
"Two-wire, one target, register8/data8 only. No SCCB_E, push-pull conflict "
"mode or multi-target discovery. The ninth master-byte bit is released and "
"ignored as Don't-Care. A completed waveform does not prove target ACK or "
"presence."
msgstr ""
"仅支持双线、单目标和 register8/data8。不支持 SCCB_E、推挽冲突模式或多目标发现。主机发送字节的第九位释放，并按 Don't-Care"
" 忽略。波形执行结束不证明目标已 ACK 或实际存在。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped physical wire storage"
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化或已停止的物理总线存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Same stable open-drain/pull-up wire contract"
msgstr "[in] 相同且稳定的开漏／上拉连线合同"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Finite absolute initialization budget"
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对初始化预算"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "Same binding/idle errors as strict I2C initialization"
msgstr "绑定/空闲错误与严格 I2C 初始化相同"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "Emit one three-phase SCCB register write."
msgstr "发送一次三阶段 SCCB 寄存器写入。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid ""
"Device meaning, identity/readback and side effects are external. SCCB "
"Don't-Care never weakens a strict I2C face."
msgstr "器件语义、身份/读回和副作用由外部负责。SCCB Don't-Care 绝不削弱严格 I2C 接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Immutable child of an initialized SCCB owner"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化 SCCB 所有者的不可变子端点"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Exact eight-bit sub-address"
msgstr "[in] 精确的 8 位子地址"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Exact eight-bit register value"
msgstr "[in] 精确的 8 位寄存器值"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] One finite budget through final STOP"
msgstr "[in] 一个覆盖至最终 STOP 的有限预算"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "SUCCESS for settled waveform, or exact wire/clock failure"
msgstr "波形完全结束时返回 SUCCESS，或返回确切线路/时钟错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "Pointer write then STOP-separated two-phase SCCB read."
msgstr "先写指针，再执行由 STOP 分隔的两阶段 SCCB 读取。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid ""
"Master emits logical-one NA after the read byte. There is no repeated-START "
"substitution or ignored-I2C-NACK fallback. Recover/stop use the shared "
"physical-owner budgeted APIs."
msgstr ""
"主机在读字节后发送逻辑一 NA。不替换为重复 START，也不通过忽略 I2C NACK 回退。Recover/stop 使用共享物理所有者的带预算 "
"API。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Immutable exact child on the same live wire owner"
msgstr "[in] 同一个有效总线所有者上的精确不可变子端点"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] Eight-bit sub-address"
msgstr "[in] 8 位子地址"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[out] Separate byte, unchanged on every error"
msgstr "[out] 独立字节，任一错误时均保持不变"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "[in] One finite budget for both cycles and final STOP"
msgstr "[in] 两个周期及最终 STOP 共用一个有限预算"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "SUCCESS only after a complete read and STOP; exact error"
msgstr "仅完整读取并完成 STOP 后返回 SUCCESS；否则返回确切错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid "Immutable reviewed SCCB child, not an I2C address face."
msgstr "不可变且经审阅的 SCCB 子端点，不是 I2C 地址接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:57
msgid ""
"write_id is an even 8-bit device ID; OV2640 uses 60h, with 61h for reading. "
"No identity discovery or address fallback."
msgstr "write_id 是偶数的 8 位器件 ID；OV2640 使用 60h，读取时使用 61h。不进行身份发现或地址回退。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:63
msgid "software_spi.h"
msgstr "software_spi.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Caller-owned bounded GPIO mode-zero SPI endpoint."
msgstr "调用方拥有的有界 GPIO 模式零 SPI 端点。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Validate exact pins and establish inactive CS/clock/MOSI."
msgstr "校验精确引脚，并将 CS、时钟和 MOSI 置于非活动状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid ""
"Validation failure writes no pin. Once a pin write is attempted, failure "
"retains the config and a faulted owner; retry recovery/stop before rebinding."
" No clock/IRQ/OS setup or physical electrical proof is inferred."
msgstr ""
"校验失败时不写入任何引脚。一旦尝试写引脚，失败后仍须保留 config "
"和处于故障状态的所有者；重新绑定前先重试恢复或停止。不由此推断已完成时钟／IRQ／OS 设置，也不构成物理电气验证。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero or successfully stopped owner"
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化所有者，或已成功停止的所有者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "[in] Stable disjoint configuration; no copied pin state"
msgstr "[in] 稳定且互不重叠的配置，不复制引脚状态"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, or the exact GPIO error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY，或确切 GPIO 错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Project the existing synchronous SPI endpoint face."
msgstr "投影既有同步 SPI 端点接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid ""
"Lookup allocates nothing and starts no hardware. The only supported endpoint "
"method is polling transfer. Length is 1..max_bytes (at most 256); deadline "
"must be finite. Exact in-place TX/RX is allowed, partial overlap is rejected."
" Output buffers can contain completed bytes on failure; transferred reports "
"only complete bytes. Any active error latches a fault even when idle-pin "
"cleanup succeeds."
msgstr ""
"查找不分配任何内存，也不启动硬件。端点仅支持轮询 transfer 方法。长度为 1..max_bytes（最多 256），deadline "
"必须有限。允许 TX/RX 完全原地重叠，拒绝部分重叠。失败时输出缓冲区可能含有已完成字节；transferred "
"仅报告完整字节。任何活动期间错误都会锁存故障，即使空闲引脚清理成功。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "[inout] Owner storage that outlives the returned face"
msgstr "[inout] 生命周期长于返回接口的所有者存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "A value face with shared immutable methods"
msgstr "共享不可变方法的值类型接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Project existing SPI owner recovery and stop methods."
msgstr "投影既有 SPI 所有者的 recovery 和 stop 方法。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid ""
"Recover/stop reject callback reentry, retry inactive CS, SCK-low and MOSI-low"
" without replaying a byte, and preserve the original config on failure. Stop "
"clears the binding only after all three writes succeed. Neither operation "
"restores Board pad modes or ends an external GPIO lease."
msgstr ""
"Recover/stop 拒绝回调重入，重试将 CS 置为非选中态、SCK 置低、MOSI "
"置低，不重放任何字节；失败时保留原配置。仅当三次写入全部成功，stop 才清除绑定。这两种操作都不恢复 Board 引脚模式，也不结束外部 GPIO "
"租约。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "[inout] Stable owner storage, never an endpoint substitute"
msgstr "[inout] 稳定的所有者存储，绝不可用它代替端点"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Observe retained bus recovery responsibility."
msgstr "观察保留的总线恢复责任。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "[in] Stable single-task owner, or NULL"
msgstr "[in] 稳定的单任务所有者或 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "True only when a non-NULL owner has a latched fault"
msgstr "仅当所有者非 NULL 且已锁存故障时返回 True"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "One stable initialized GPIO face and exactly one authorized bit."
msgstr "单个稳定且已初始化的 GPIO 接口，以及恰好一个获授权的位。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Immutable mode-zero, MSB-first, active-low-CS wiring."
msgstr "不可变的模式零、MSB 优先、CS 低有效接线。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid ""
"Caller owns pads, pull configuration and clock lifetime. Clock/MOSI/CS are "
"outputs and MISO is an input. Known pin identities must be disjoint; aliases "
"hidden behind different contexts remain the caller's responsibility. Delays "
"are minimum microseconds, never a measured frequency or WCET. Each wait has "
"at most poll_limit clock reads; a stalled clock fails rather than spinning "
"indefinitely. All fields, faces and contexts stay alive and immutable through"
" stop."
msgstr ""
"调用方负责引脚、上下拉配置和时钟生命周期。Clock/MOSI/CS 为输出，MISO "
"为输入。已知引脚身份必须互不重叠；不同上下文隐藏的别名仍由调用方负责。延迟表示最短微秒数，绝非实测频率或 WCET。每次等待最多读取 poll_limit"
" 次时钟；时钟停滞时失败，不会无限自旋。所有字段、接口和上下文必须保持存活且不可变，直至 stop 完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid "Exact zero-initialized single-task owner, without a worker."
msgstr "精确零初始化的单任务所有者，不包含工作线程。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:65
msgid ""
"Fields are implementation state. No transfer retains a payload pointer after "
"return. Failed GPIO withdrawal keeps the same pin owner faulted until "
"recovery or stop succeeds. No concurrent, IRQ or reentrant calls are "
"supported; a callback reentry is rejected BUSY before another pin write."
msgstr ""
"字段属于实现状态。传输返回后不保留载荷指针。GPIO 撤出失败会使同一引脚所有者保持故障，直至恢复或 stop 成功。不支持并发、IRQ "
"或重入调用；回调重入会在再次写引脚前以 BUSY 拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:71
msgid "w25.h"
msgstr "w25.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Bounded W25Q128JV commands and retained busy ownership."
msgstr "有界 W25Q128JV 命令及忙状态期间保留的所有权。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73 docs/reference/api/components.md:81
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113 docs/reference/api/components.md:350
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369 docs/reference/api/components.md:377
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506 docs/reference/api/components.md:538
