#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604 docs/reference/api/components.md:612
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "An explicit reviewed model; JEDEC identity alone is not suffix proof."
msgstr "显式指定已审阅的型号；仅有 JEDEC 身份不能证明型号后缀。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73 docs/reference/api/components.md:81
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113 docs/reference/api/components.md:350
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369 docs/reference/api/components.md:377
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506 docs/reference/api/components.md:538
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546 docs/reference/api/components.md:588
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604 docs/reference/api/components.md:612
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Last requested array operation, independent of its final outcome."
msgstr "最后请求的阵列操作，与其最终结果无关。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Probe one explicitly selected awake W25Q128JV through a polling face."
msgstr "通过轮询接口探测一个显式选择且已唤醒的 W25Q128JV。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"Task-only serialized calls; no worker, heap, lock, discovery fallback, reset "
"or status/QE/protection writes. JEDEC is necessary, not unique model/revision"
" proof. The caller excludes foreign flash, pin, power, clock and bus owners. "
"Endpoint, ops, context and clock outlive the component and stay disjoint from"
" state and writable payloads."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文中的串行化调用；不创建工作线程、堆、锁，不进行发现回退、复位或状态/QE/保护写入。JEDEC "
"是必要条件，不是型号/修订的唯一证明。调用方须排除其他 "
"Flash、引脚、电源、时钟和总线所有者。端点、ops、上下文和时钟的生命周期须长于组件，且与状态和可写载荷互不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[inout] Disjoint caller state, live through successful stop."
msgstr "[inout] 互不重叠的调用方状态，持续有效直至成功停止。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Stable mode 0/3, single-line, at most 50 MHz SPI binding."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的 mode 0/3、单线且最高 50 MHz 的 SPI 绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Ready monotonic microseconds, stable through pending duty."
msgstr "[in] 已就绪的单调微秒时钟，在待处理责任存续期间保持稳定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Explicit region/model/power/clock facts, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 显式区域／型号／供电／时钟事实，成功时复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in that same live clock epoch."
msgstr "[in] 同一个有效时钟纪元内的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after EF4018 and idle/non-suspended/WEL0 observation; BUSY before "
"ready_at or while the chip is busy/armed/suspended. Unknown models reject. "
"Rejection issues no mutating command."
msgstr ""
"观察到 EF4018 及空闲/未挂起/WEL0 后返回 SUCCESS；ready_at 前，或芯片忙/已置写使能/已挂起时返回 "
"BUSY。未知型号拒绝。拒绝不发出改变状态的命令。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Read one 1..252-byte region-relative chunk through command 03h."
msgstr "通过命令 03h 读取一个相对于区域的 1..252 字节块。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Every return ends CPU access to data. No asynchronous payload borrow."
msgstr "每次返回均终止 CPU 对数据的访问。不进行异步载荷借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[inout] Initialized, idle single owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、空闲的单一所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Offset inside the configured region."
msgstr "[in] 所配置区域内的偏移。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[out] Disjoint output, unchanged on any failed transaction."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的输出，任一事务失败时均保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Positive bounded byte count inside the region."
msgstr "[in] 区域内为正且有界的字节数。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline covering complete CS withdrawal."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖 CS 完整撤出的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "SUCCESS or a checked range/state/transport/time error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或经检查的范围/状态/传输/时间错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Issue one bounded 02h page program without crossing its 256-byte page."
msgstr "发出一次有界 02h 页编程，不跨越其 256 字节页。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"Only pre-existing unprotected WPS0/CMP0/BP0 array mode is admitted. "
"Protection is never unlocked. No caller payload pointer is retained. This "
"does not verify bytes or promise atomic/durable replacement."
msgstr "仅接纳原已处于未保护 WPS0/CMP0/BP0 的阵列模式。绝不解锁保护。不保留调用方载荷指针。不验证字节，也不承诺原子/持久替换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle owner; retained while pending."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的空闲所有者；待处理期间持续保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Region-relative offset inside one physical page."
msgstr "[in] 相对区域起点的偏移，位于一个物理页内。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] 1..252 source bytes, no longer accessed after return."
msgstr "[in] 1..252 个源字节，返回后不再访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Positive bounded span; target obeys NOR 1-to-0 semantics."
msgstr "[in] 非空且有界的存储区间；目标遵循 NOR 的 1-to-0 语义。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline including later device busy time."
msgstr "[in] 包括后续器件忙碌时间的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means the command was issued, not completed. Validation rejection has"
" no I/O. A transport/time failure after write-enable may leave "
"pending/uncertain device duty; inspect status and service."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示命令已发出，不代表完成。校验拒绝不进行 I/O。写使能后的传输/时间失败可能留下待完成/不确定的器件责任；须检查 status 和 "
"service。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Issue 20h erase for one 4 KiB-aligned sector in the declared region."
msgstr "对声明区域内一个按 4 KiB 对齐的扇区发出 20h 擦除。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "No whole-chip erase, erase suspend, implicit retry or product policy."
msgstr "不执行整片擦除、擦除挂起、隐式重试或产品策略。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle owner retained through final service."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的空闲所有者，保留至最后一次 service 完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Region-relative, 4 KiB-aligned sector start."
msgstr "[in] 相对区域起点且按 4 KiB 对齐的扇区起始位置。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Finite operation deadline; cannot preempt a flash pulse."
msgstr "[in] 有限操作截止时间；无法抢占 Flash 脉冲。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Same command-issued and uncertainty contract as program_start."
msgstr "命令已发出及不确定状态合同与 program_start 相同。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Perform bounded status progress using a separate cleanup deadline."
msgstr "使用单独的清理截止时间进行有界状态推进。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"At most four short SPI transactions; no waiting loop. WRDI may clear an "
"observed idle WEL, then is checked. No reset, resume, unlock or replay. Lost "
"clock epochs retain pending duty. A quiescent device does not prove old data,"
" erase contents or power-loss outcome; read back under product policy. Shared"
" SPI recovery is the outer bus owner's duty."
msgstr ""
"最多执行四次短 SPI 事务，不进行等待循环。WRDI 可清除已观察到的空闲 "
"WEL，随后须进行检查。不复位、恢复、解锁或重放。时钟纪元丢失时仍保留待完成责任。器件静止不证明旧数据、擦除内容或掉电结果；须按产品策略读回。共享 SPI"
" 的恢复由外层总线所有者负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[inout] Same binding, storage and live clock retained."
msgstr "[inout] 保留相同绑定、存储和有效时钟。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Fresh finite budget, never extends operation time."
msgstr "[in] 新的有限预算，绝不延长操作时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"BUSY while WIP remains set. SUS never establishes completion. After WIP0/SUS0"
" and observed WEL0, pending duty ends and the original operation outcome is "
"returned, including a latched TIMEOUT/IO."
msgstr ""
"WIP 仍置位时返回 BUSY。SUS 从不证明完成。在 WIP0/SUS0 且观察到 WEL0 后，待完成责任结束，并返回原操作结果，包括已锁存的 "
"TIMEOUT/IO。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Observe component state and the last requested operation result."
msgstr "观察组件状态及最后请求的操作结果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[in] Stable serialized state, no in-progress callback."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且串行使用的状态，无正在执行的回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[out] Disjoint caller output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的调用方输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/BUSY; no physical I/O or qualification inference."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/BUSY；不进行物理 I/O，也不推导资格。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Forget a known-quiescent component binding after callers join."
msgstr "调用方完成汇合后，解除已知静止的组件绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"No I/O, bus stop, pin release, power-off or erasure of SPI owner faults."
msgstr "不进行 I/O、停止总线、释放引脚、断电或清除 SPI 所有者故障。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "[inout] State with no pending or uncertain array operation."
msgstr "[inout] 无待处理或不确定的阵列操作的状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after unbinding; BUSY preserves state until service proves "
"settlement. Clock loss during a pending operation requires external system "
"recovery; a timeout never revokes that responsibility."
msgstr ""
"解除绑定后返回 SUCCESS；在 service 证明完全完成前，BUSY 保留状态。待完成操作期间时钟丢失需要外部系统恢复；超时绝不撤销该责任。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Explicit product region and stable power/clock identity declarations."
msgstr "显式产品区域及稳定的电源/时钟身份声明。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid ""
"Region offset/size are 4 KiB aligned, nonempty and inside the reviewed 16 MiB"
" array. Public offsets are relative to this caller-selected region. ready_at "
"is the absolute time after the actual rail has satisfied the datasheet power-"
"up/write delay; the caller must establish that fact. Domain/epoch labels are "
"declarations, not runtime clock attestation."
msgstr ""
"区域偏移/大小须按 4 KiB 对齐、非空，且位于已审阅的 16 MiB 阵列内。公共偏移相对于此调用方选定区域。ready_at "
"是实际电源轨已满足数据手册上电/写入延迟后的绝对时间；调用方须建立该事实。时钟域/纪元标签是声明，不是运行时时钟认证。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Caller-owned state, zero-initialized before its first initialization."
msgstr "调用方拥有的状态，首次初始化前须零初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Private fields are exposed for static allocation, not caller mutation."
msgstr "公开私有字段仅为静态分配，不供调用方修改。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:73
msgid "Serialized observation; SUCCESS never implies power-loss durability."
msgstr "串行化观察；SUCCESS 绝不意味着掉电持久性。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:79
msgid "ili9341.h"
msgstr "ili9341.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Caller-owned ILI9341 RGB565 parallel-display controller."
msgstr "调用方拥有的 ILI9341 RGB565 并行显示控制器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Explicit cooperative initialization and uncertainty states."
msgstr "显式协作式初始化与不确定状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Verify ID 9341h and begin software-reset initialization."
msgstr "校验 ID 为 9341h，并开始软件复位初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"ID4 reads four low bytes: dummy, manufacturer, 93h, 41h. External NRST is "
"never driven. Call service after at least 120 ms reset recovery and 120 ms "
"sleep-out recovery. These are elapsed clock intervals, never loop-count "
"delays."
msgstr ""
"ID4 读取四个低字节：dummy、manufacturer、93h、41h。绝不驱动外部 NRST。复位恢复至少 120 ms、退出休眠恢复至少 120"
" ms 后调用 service。这些是实际经过的时钟间隔，绝非循环计数延迟。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[inout] Zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain state."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化／已停止状态，或相同绑定的不确定状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Stable immutable endpoint, clock and orientation."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不可变的端点、时钟及方向。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline covering all phases."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖全部阶段的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after SWRESET, BUSY for a live instance or exact validation/transport"
" failure. Malformed inputs and a budget shorter than 240 ms cause no bus "
"access. Once command D3h is attempted, failure retains UNCERTAIN binding."
msgstr ""
"SWRESET 后返回 SUCCESS；实例已存活时返回 BUSY；或返回确切校验/传输错误。输入格式错误或预算不足 240 ms "
"时不访问总线。一旦尝试命令 D3h，失败便保留 UNCERTAIN 绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Progress at most one timed initialization transition."
msgstr "最多推进一次带时限的初始化状态转换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "No sleeping, spinning, scheduler, reset or backlight action."
msgstr "不休眠、不自旋、不运行调度器、不复位，也不操作背光。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[inout] Same serialized live instance and clock epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 同一个串行使用的有效实例及其时钟纪元。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"BUSY before the required interval or after sleep-out; SUCCESS after "
"RGB565/orientation/display-on programming, or exact failure retaining "
"UNCERTAIN binding."
msgstr ""
"规定间隔届满前或退出休眠后返回 BUSY；完成 RGB565/方向/显示开启编程后返回 SUCCESS；或返回确切错误并保留 UNCERTAIN 绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Write one complete in-bounds packed RGB565 rectangle."
msgstr "写入一个完整、未越界且紧凑排列的 RGB565 矩形。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"No clipping, rotation copy, heap or framebuffer is hidden. Interruption can "
"leave a partially updated physical panel."
msgstr "不隐藏裁剪、旋转复制、堆或帧缓冲区。中断操作可能使物理面板仅部分更新。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[inout] READY single-owner instance."
msgstr "[inout] 处于 READY 状态的单所有者实例。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Logical left coordinate."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑左坐标。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Logical top coordinate."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑上坐标。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Nonzero rectangle width."
msgstr "[in] 非零矩形宽度。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Nonzero rectangle height."
msgstr "[in] 非零矩形高度。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Stable packed native-halfword RGB565 span."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、紧凑排列且使用本机半字格式的 RGB565 存储区间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Exactly width times height, no implicit stride."
msgstr "[in] 恰好为宽度乘以高度，不隐含行步长。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"[out] Distinct completed pixel prefix, set to zero after admission and "
"updated even on a pixel-data failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立的已完成像素前缀计数，接纳后置零，即使像素数据传输失败也会更新。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline for all bus operations."
msgstr "[in] 全部总线操作共用的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only for all pixels, INVALID for malformed bounds, aliases or span, "
"or exact transport/time error. Rejection before bus access leaves written "
"unchanged. Post-command errors retain UNCERTAIN; no caller span survives "
"return."
msgstr ""
"仅全部像素写入后返回 SUCCESS；边界、别名或缓冲区范围无效时返回 INVALID；或返回确切传输/时间错误。总线访问前拒绝时 written "
"保持不变。命令之后的错误保留 UNCERTAIN；返回后不保留对调用方缓冲区的引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Send display-off and release the settled software binding."
msgstr "发送显示关闭命令，并解除同步操作及其借用均已结束的软件绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"Does not power down the module, pulse shared NRST, withdraw the bus or set "
"backlight. The caller stops all components before releasing their transport "
"and platform resources."
msgstr "不会使模块断电、脉冲驱动共享 NRST、撤出总线或设置背光。调用方须先停止所有组件，再释放其传输和平台资源。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[inout] Stopped or same-owner live/uncertain instance."
msgstr "[inout] 已停止的实例，或同一所有者的有效／不确定实例。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "[in] Finite current deadline, independent of old init."
msgstr "[in] 当前的有限截止时间，独立于先前初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after all port access finishes, BUSY during reset or sleep-out quiet "
"time, or exact failure retaining the binding. An attempted command failure "
"keeps UNCERTAIN for explicit retry; validation never clears existing effects."
msgstr ""
"所有端口访问结束后返回 SUCCESS；复位或退出休眠的静默期返回 BUSY；或返回确切错误并保留绑定。已尝试命令失败会保持 "
"UNCERTAIN，以供显式重试；校验绝不清除已有副作用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Explicit native orientation and RGB/BGR selection."
msgstr "显式原生方向及 RGB/BGR 选择。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"madctl permits MY/MX/MV and BGR only (mask E8h). Native addressing is 240 by "
"320; MV exchanges logical dimensions. No module-specific gamma, power, scan "
"or voltage settings are guessed. Panel-specific additions require a reviewed "
"separate configuration; this is the controller reset profile with 16-bit "
"RGB565 DBI and display-on. Configuration, endpoint, operations and clock "
"context remain immutable and alive until successful stop. Reinitialization of"
" UNCERTAIN state requires the same exact configuration object."
msgstr ""
"madctl 仅允许 MY/MX/MV 和 BGR（掩码 E8h）。原生寻址尺寸为 240 × 320；MV 交换逻辑尺寸。不猜测模块专用的 "
"gamma、供电、扫描或电压设置。面板专用扩展必须使用单独审阅的配置；此处为控制器复位配置，使用 16 位 RGB565 DBI "
"并开启显示。配置、端点、操作表和时钟上下文必须保持不可变且有效，直至成功停止。重新初始化 UNCERTAIN 状态时，必须使用完全相同的配置对象。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid "Exact caller-owned state, zero before first initialize."
msgstr "调用方拥有的精确状态，首次 initialize 前须清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:81
msgid ""
"One nonreentrant task owner; no concurrent calls. The configuration reference"
" survives initialization and uncertainty until successful stop. Operations "
"borrow spans only during the call. Errors after the first command retain "
"binding as UNCERTAIN until stop succeeds or the same exact binding is "
"reinitialized. Fields are implementation state, not permission to bypass "
"lifecycle checks. Software READY establishes completed commands, not optical "
"readiness or physical timing qualification. Caller spans are disjoint from "
"all transport and clock owner storage. Checks exclude known readonly objects "
"and context anchors; opaque owner extents remain the caller's responsibility."
msgstr ""
"单个不可重入的任务所有者；不允许并发调用。配置引用在初始化和不确定状态期间持续有效，直至 stop "
"成功。操作仅在调用期间借用缓冲区范围。首个命令之后的错误将绑定保留为 UNCERTAIN，直至 stop "
"成功或以完全相同的绑定重新初始化。字段属于实现状态，不代表可绕过生命周期检查。软件 READY "
"证明命令已完成，不代表光学就绪或物理时序资格。调用方缓冲区范围须与所有传输和时钟所有者存储互不重叠。检查会拒绝与已知只读对象或上下文锚点的重叠；不透明所有者的完整存储范围仍由调用方负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:87
msgid "xpt2046.h"
msgstr "xpt2046.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Explicit XPT2046 raw differential touch sampling."
msgstr "显式 XPT2046 原始差分触摸采样。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Send one complete PD=00 conversion to establish PENIRQ mode."
msgstr "发送一次完整 PD=00 转换以建立 PENIRQ 模式。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"The chip has no identity read used here. Init does not establish physical "
"module fitting. A failed/short transfer may have changed converter power "
"state and retains recovery responsibility. Rebinding an uncertain device is "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"此处不读取该芯片的身份标识。初始化不证明模块已实际安装。失败或短传输可能已经改变转换器的电源状态，因此仍须保留恢复责任。禁止重新绑定处于不确定状态的器件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain state"
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化／已停止状态，或相同绑定的不确定状态"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[in] Stable disjoint exact binding, no chip-ID fallback"
msgstr "[in] 稳定、互不重叠的精确绑定，不回退到其他芯片 ID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline, including the exchange"
msgstr "[in] 包括本次交换的有限绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "SUCCESS or exact validation/transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或确切校验/传输错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Read complete differential X/Y and optional Z1/Z2 samples."
msgstr "读取完整差分 X/Y 及可选 Z1/Z2 样本。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"Each conversion has its own complete 24-clock CS interval, differential "
"12-bit mode and PD=00. Any transfer error closes sampling until same-binding "
"init. IRQs are hints; the selected live pen predicate is checked before/after"
" I/O. Nonzero null/trailing bits reject the exact 12-bit wire format; this is"
" not a chip identity or fitting test. Output must also be disjoint from "
"opaque SPI/pen/clock context storage; only known spans are checked here."
msgstr ""
"每次转换均有独立完整的 24 时钟 CS 区间，使用差分 12 位模式和 PD=00。任一传输错误都会关闭采样，直至以相同绑定重新 init。IRQ "
"只是提示；I/O 前后均检查选定的实时触笔谓词。空位/尾随位非零时，拒绝该不符合精确 12 位线路格式的数据；这不是芯片身份或实装测试。输出还必须与不透明"
" SPI/触笔/时钟上下文存储互不重叠；此处仅检查已知存储范围。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[inout] Live exclusive initialized instance"
msgstr "[inout] 有效、独占且已初始化的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on every error"
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出，任一错误时均保持不变"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[in] One finite deadline for the complete sequence"
msgstr "[in] 完整序列共用一个有限截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY for pen-up, or exact validation/I/O error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；触笔抬起时为 EMPTY；或返回确切校验/I/O 错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Restore converter PD=00 before releasing this device binding."
msgstr "恢复转换器 PD=00 后再释放此器件绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"Does not stop the shared SPI owner, change pad modes or join external "
"GPIO/IRQ observers; those remain caller duties."
msgstr "不会停止共享 SPI 所有者、改变引脚模式或汇合外部 GPIO/IRQ 观察者；这些仍由调用方负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[inout] Initialized or uncertain exclusive instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化或处于不确定状态的独占实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "[in] Separate finite cleanup deadline when necessary"
msgstr "[in] 必要时提供独立的有限清理截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after complete cleanup conversion; failure preserves the binding"
" and recovery responsibility"
msgstr "仅完整清理转换完成后返回 SUCCESS；失败保留绑定及恢复责任"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Exact immutable touch binding and explicit clock identity."
msgstr "精确且不可变的触摸绑定及显式时钟身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"SPI mode zero/MSB-first and actual settling/rate are owned by the selected "
"endpoint. Select exactly one GPIO pen face with one-bit mask, or an EXTI pen "
"face with mask zero. EXTI must provide the optional live electrical-level "
"method; buffered edges never substitute for that predicate. Pen is active-"
"low, not an interrupt count. GPIO/pull, endpoint, faces, opaque contexts and "
"clock live through successful device stop. The deadline clock must be the "
"same domain as the endpoint. Nonzero domain/epoch change on reset or "
"discontinuity. Every 24-clock exchange, including init/stop PD=00, must "
"finish before the earlier of the caller deadline and checked exchange start "
"plus 1600 us. This conservative full-exchange bound is postchecked even after"
" SPI SUCCESS; it is not a measured waveform or generic SPI edge limit."
msgstr ""
"SPI 模式零/MSB 优先及实际稳定时间/速率由选定端点负责。须精确选择一个具有仅含一位掩码的 GPIO 触笔接口，或一个掩码为零的 EXTI "
"触笔接口。EXTI "
"必须提供可选的实时电平方法；缓冲边沿绝不能代替该谓词。触笔低电平有效，不是中断计数。GPIO/上下拉、端点、接口、不透明上下文和时钟须存活至器件成功 "
"stop。截止时间时钟必须与端点处于同一时钟域。非零 domain/epoch 在复位或不连续时须改变。每次 24 时钟交换，包括 init/stop 的"
" PD=00，均须在调用方截止时间与经检查的交换起始时刻加 1600 us 两者中较早者之前完成。即使 SPI 返回 "
"SUCCESS，仍在返回后检查此保守的完整交换上限；它不是实测波形或通用 SPI 边沿限制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Copied 12-bit converter values, without display calibration."
msgstr "复制的 12 位转换器数值，未经显示校准。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"x/y are channels 101/001; z1/z2 are 011/100 when requested. Axis rotation, "
"pressure resistance, filtering and gesture policy are external. Pen was low "
"before and after the sequence, which does not prove simultaneous conversions "
"or a stable physical contact. observed is software completion time with "
"unknown uncertainty, never conversion timestamp."
msgstr ""
"x/y 使用通道 101/001；请求压力值时，z1/z2 使用 "
"011/100。轴旋转、压力电阻、滤波和手势策略由外部提供。序列前后触笔均为低电平，不证明转换同时发生，也不证明物理接触稳定。observed "
"是不确定度未知的软件完成时间，绝不是转换时间戳。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid "Zero-initialized caller-owned serialized touch state."
msgstr "由调用方所有、零初始化并串行使用的触摸状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:89
msgid ""
"No payload pointer survives a call. Failed I/O retains the binding as "
"uncertain; recover the SPI owner first when needed, then retry same-binding "
"init or stop. No polling worker, debounce, IRQ owner or allocation is "
"introduced."
msgstr ""
"调用返回后不保留载荷指针。I/O 失败会将绑定保留为不确定状态；需要时先恢复 SPI 所有者，再以相同绑定重试 init 或 "
"stop。不引入轮询工作线程、消抖、IRQ 所有者或内存分配。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:95
msgid "onewire.h"
msgstr "onewire.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Bounded standard-speed open-drain one-wire transactions."
msgstr "有界标准速率开漏单总线事务。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Bind exact wiring and observe a released idle line under a budget."
msgstr "绑定精确接线，并在预算内观察已释放的空闲线路。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid ""
"Input/expired preflight is effect-free. After a pin write, failed withdrawal "
"retains the binding for stop/recovery; no CPU buffer loan."
msgstr "输入/已过期预算的预检无副作用。写引脚后，撤出失败会保留绑定以供 stop/recovery；不借出 CPU 缓冲区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[inout] Stable zero/stopped disjoint state."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定的零初始化／已停止状态，存储互不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Immutable wiring, preconfigured externally."
msgstr "[in] 不可变接线配置，已在外部预先配置。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Finite absolute monotonic deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对单调截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, TIMEOUT or GPIO/clock failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、TIMEOUT 或 GPIO/时钟失败。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Reset/presence, send LSB-first bytes, then receive bounded bits."
msgstr "复位/存在检测，发送 LSB 优先字节，再接收有界位数。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid ""
"No buffers survive return; partial receive bytes may change on error. Failure"
" releases the open-drain line and records cleanup separately. Failure to "
"prove release retains physical ownership. No ROM discovery, parasite supply, "
"strong pull-up, overdrive or multichannel registry."
msgstr ""
"返回后不保留对缓冲区的引用；出错时部分接收字节可能已改变。失败时释放开漏线路并单独记录清理结果。无法证明释放时仍保留物理所有权。不提供 ROM "
"发现、寄生供电、强上拉、超速模式或多通道注册表。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized wire owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化并串行使用的总线所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Separate readable1..16 bytes, unchanged throughout call."
msgstr "[in] 独立的 1..16 个可读字节，在整个调用期间保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Exact transmitted length."
msgstr "[in] 精确的发送长度。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[out] Separate writable ceil(rx_bits/8) bytes, or NULL if zero."
msgstr "[out] 独立且可写的 ceil(rx_bits/8) 字节；数量为零时可为 NULL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Zero to128 bits; unused high bits are zero."
msgstr "[in] 0 至 128 位；未使用的高位为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Finite absolute time, not a relative timeout."
msgstr "[in] 有限绝对时间，不是相对超时。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "SUCCESS or bounded timing/context/state/GPIO error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或有界时序/上下文/状态/GPIO 错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Observe the same finite monotonic epoch without touching the wire."
msgstr "观察同一有限单调时钟纪元，不触碰线路。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[inout] Stable initialized state, no overlapping executor."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定的已初始化状态，无重叠执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写输出，失败时保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "SUCCESS or STATE/INVALID/IO; backward/NEVER readings fault epoch."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 STATE/INVALID/IO；时钟倒退/NEVER 读数使当前纪元故障。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Release/observe the line and close admission without a protocol reset."
msgstr "释放/观察线路并关闭操作接纳，不进行协议复位。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid ""
"No descriptors survive; a stopped sensor may continue autonomous work. "
"Faulted withdrawal additionally holds the wire through 500us after physical "
"high observation, then rechecks high and deadline. A short deadline or "
"insufficient poll count retains the binding for recovery."
msgstr ""
"不保留描述符；已停止的传感器仍可能继续自主工作。故障撤出还须在观察到物理高电平后的 500us "
"期间保留线路所有权，随后再次检查高电平与截止时间。截止时间过短或轮询次数不足会保留绑定以供恢复。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[inout] Same state, no active or reentrant caller."
msgstr "[inout] 同一状态，无活动或重入调用方。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Finite new withdrawal budget in the same live epoch."
msgstr "[in] 同一有效纪元内新的有限撤出预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "SUCCESS when released; failure retains binding and wire duty."
msgstr "已释放时返回 SUCCESS；失败保留绑定及线路责任。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Dallas/Maxim CRC8 (reflected polynomial8Ch), initial accumulator0."
msgstr "Dallas/Maxim CRC8（反射多项式 8Ch），累加器初值为 0。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Readable bytes, NULL permitted only when length is zero."
msgstr "[in] 可读字节；仅在长度为零时允许 NULL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "[in] Exact finite byte count."
msgstr "[in] 精确且有限的字节数。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "CRC8; zero for NULL. No mutation, allocation or timing dependence."
msgstr "CRC8；NULL 时返回零。不修改数据、不分配内存，也不依赖时序。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Immutable electrical and monotonic-clock facts, borrowed until stop."
msgstr "不可变的电气与单调时钟事实，借用至 stop 完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid ""
"Exactly one preconfigured open-drain output, writing one releases it, actual "
"input readback and an external pull-up are required. Only one serialized task"
" executor controls this physical bus; no concurrent pin, clock, mode or "
"configuration writer. poll_limit is1..1000000. Standard-speed timing uses "
"fixed conservative slot targets and finite observed jitter windows. This "
"detects overruns; it is not a WCET, electrical rise-time or physical "
"qualification. No IRQ masks or worker."
msgstr ""
"恰好一个预配置的开漏输出；写一表示释放，必须具备实际输入读回和外部上拉。此物理总线仅由一个串行任务执行者控制；不允许并发的引脚、时钟、模式或配置写入者。poll_limit"
" 为 1..1000000。标准速率时序使用固定的保守时隙目标和有限的观察抖动窗口。这可检测超限，但不构成 WCET、电气上升时间或物理资格证明。不屏蔽 "
"IRQ，不创建工作线程。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid "Stable caller-owned wire state, initially zero and never copied."
msgstr "调用方拥有的稳定线路状态，初始为零且绝不复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:97
msgid ""
"Failed release retains this binding/fault, never caller buffers. Opaque "
"GPIO/clock contexts stay live and disjoint through stop/joins. Clock "
"discontinuity is terminal for transactions in this clock epoch."
msgstr ""
"释放失败会保留此绑定/故障，绝不保留调用方缓冲区。不透明 GPIO/时钟上下文须保持存活且互不重叠，直至 "
"stop/汇合完成。时钟不连续对当前时钟纪元的事务是终止性故障。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:103
msgid "ds18b20.h"
msgstr "ds18b20.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "External-VDD DS18B20 identity and cooperative conversion."
msgstr "外部 VDD 供电的 DS18B20 身份与协作式转换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Validate identity, actual supply mode and scratchpad configuration."
msgstr "校验身份、实际供电模式及暂存器配置。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Initial scratchpad temperature, including85C, is never a fresh result."
msgstr "初始暂存器温度，包括 85C，绝不是新转换结果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[inout] Zero/stopped disjoint stable state."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化／已停止、稳定且互不重叠的状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[in] Immutable exact selection, with initialized wire owner."
msgstr "[in] 精确不可变的选择，总线所有者已初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[in] Finite absolute communication budget."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对通信预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED/IO."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED/IO。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Read actual resolution then start one bounded autonomous conversion."
msgstr "读取实际分辨率，再启动一次有界自主转换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid ""
"Max waits are93750/187500/375000/750000us for9/10/11/12 bits. No blocking "
"conversion delay. Command execution may have effects even when a later "
"clock/budget observation fails; this is not cancellation."
msgstr ""
"9/10/11/12 位的最长等待分别为 "
"93750/187500/375000/750000us。不进行阻塞式转换延迟。即使后续时钟/预算观察失败，命令执行仍可能已产生副作用；这不代表取消。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized owner; no current conversion."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化并串行使用的所有者，当前无转换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[in] Finite overall communication/conversion/read budget."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖通信／转换／读取全过程的有限总预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "SUCCESS when issued; otherwise bounded validation/bus/clock error."
msgstr "已发出时返回 SUCCESS；否则返回有界校验/总线/时钟错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "After the real resolution maximum, read/CRC-validate a fresh result."
msgstr "实际分辨率对应的最长转换时间届满后，读取新结果并校验 CRC。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid ""
"Reads use a fresh reset/select, not a stale conversion-poll context. "
"Undefined low bits are cleared; valid85C is not rejected by value. "
"Temperature range is -55..125C. No UTC or product calibration policy."
msgstr ""
"读取使用新的复位/选择，不复用过期的转换轮询上下文。未定义的低位会清零；不会仅因值为有效的 85C 而拒绝。温度范围为 -55..125C。不提供 UTC"
" 或产品校准策略。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[inout] Same serialized state and live bus/clock epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行状态及有效总线／时钟纪元。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[out] Separate signed1/16C output, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[out] 独立的有符号 1/16C 输出，错误时保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid ""
"BUSY before ready without wire activity, SUCCESS once, or a bounded "
"timeout/clock/identity/CRC/configuration error closing admission."
msgstr "尚未就绪时返回 BUSY，且无线路活动；成功仅返回一次 SUCCESS；或返回有界的超时/时钟/身份/CRC/配置错误并关闭操作接纳。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Close only software admission; never reset or release the shared bus."
msgstr "仅关闭软件操作接纳，绝不复位或释放共享总线。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Physical conversion may continue; no physical cancel/off claim."
msgstr "物理转换可能继续；不声称已物理取消或断电。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "[inout] Stable same-executor state, no in-progress call."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者使用的稳定状态，无正在执行的调用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "SUCCESS idempotently, INVALID or BUSY for an overlapping call."
msgstr "幂等返回 SUCCESS；或返回 INVALID；调用重叠时返回 BUSY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Immutable selected sensor identity, not a bus or physical fitting."
msgstr "不可变的选定传感器身份，不代表总线或物理实装。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid ""
"Known ROM requires family28h and CRC8. Skip ROM additionally requires "
"explicit single_device=true, reads/retains its CRC-valid ROM and checks that "
"identity again for subsequent commands. external_vdd must be true and Read "
"Power Supply must confirm it; parasite mode is unsupported. Sensor power and "
"identity remain stable through each conversion."
msgstr ""
"已知 ROM 要求 family28h 和 CRC8。Skip ROM 还要求显式设置 single_device=true，读取/保留其 CRC 有效的"
" ROM，并在后续命令中再次检查该身份。external_vdd 必须为 true，且 Read Power Supply "
"必须予以确认；不支持寄生供电模式。每次转换期间传感器电源和身份须保持稳定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid "Caller-owned serialized device state; zero before first init."
msgstr "调用方拥有的串行化器件状态；首次 init 前须清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:105
msgid ""
"Configuration, bus and clock contexts remain borrowed while open. Conversion "
"is autonomous; software stop/timeout never claims physical cancellation. No "
"task, heap, hidden queue, calibration or retained CPU payload. After software"
" closure and joins, no device reference remains."
msgstr ""
"绑定有效期间持续借用配置、总线和时钟上下文。转换自主进行；软件 stop/timeout 绝不声称已物理取消。不创建任务、堆、隐藏队列、校准或保留的 "
"CPU 载荷。软件关闭并完成汇合后，不再保留器件引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:111
msgid "infrared.h"
msgstr "infrared.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Bounded NEC decoding from copied active-low EXTI edges."
msgstr "对复制的低电平有效 EXTI 边沿进行有界 NEC 解码。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Explicit address policy; no inverse-error fallback is permitted."
msgstr "显式地址策略；不允许反码错误回退。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Strict by default; IRQ sampling is an explicit software reference."
msgstr "默认严格；IRQ 采样是显式软件参考。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Source declarations/flags never attest physical capture integrity."
msgstr "来源声明/标志绝不证明物理捕获完整性。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Bind explicit timing/address policy without hardware access."
msgstr "绑定显式时序/地址策略，不访问硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero or successfully stopped, aligned storage."
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化存储，或已成功停止的存储；必须对齐。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[in] Stable readonly policy, disjoint from owner."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的只读策略，与所有者存储互不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY; rejection leaves both spans unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 BUSY；拒绝时两个缓冲区范围均保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Consume one copied edge through the deterministic NEC state machine."
msgstr "通过确定性 NEC 状态机消费一个已复制的边沿。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"Wrong line, unknown flags/edge and invalid spans reject unchanged. LOSS "
"invalidates frame and repeat eligibility; its report timestamp is not a "
"recovered edge and never advances the source clock history. Accepted "
"COALESCED samples retain their observation time and flags. Equal/backward "
"accepted timestamps latch clock_fault until stop/init. Malformed/truncated "
"frames never publish partial commands. No RC5, NEC2 interpretation, automatic"
" protocol discovery or calibration."
msgstr ""
"错误线路、未知标志／边沿和无效存储区间均被拒绝，状态保持不变。LOSS "
"使当前帧及重复帧资格失效；其报告时间戳不是恢复出的边沿，绝不推进来源时钟历史。接纳的 COALESCED "
"采样保留其观察时间和标志。接纳的时间戳若相等或回退，会锁存 clock_fault，直至 stop/init。畸形或截断帧绝不发布部分命令。不提供 "
"RC5、NEC2 解释、自动协议发现或校准。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[inout] Initialized single consumer in its original epoch."
msgstr "[inout] 原始纪元内已初始化的单消费者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[in] Disjoint copied public edge, borrowed only during call."
msgstr "[in] 已复制的公共边沿，与其他存储互不重叠，仅在调用期间借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"Value SUCCESS only after 32 valid bits and trailer or valid repeat; EMPTY "
"awaits more edges; OVERFLOW rejects LOSS in every policy and COALESCED in "
"STRICT. IRQ_OBSERVATION retains sampled uncertainty. IO rejects malformed "
"waveform/clock, TIMEOUT rejects a stale frame."
msgstr ""
"仅在收到 32 个有效位及尾部，或有效重复帧后返回 SUCCESS；EMPTY 表示等待更多边沿；OVERFLOW 在所有策略下拒绝 LOSS，并在 "
"STRICT 下拒绝 COALESCED。IRQ_OBSERVATION 保留采样不确定性。IO 拒绝畸形波形／时钟，TIMEOUT 拒绝过期帧。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Read at most one edge from a caller-owned public EXTI queue."
msgstr "从调用方拥有的公共 EXTI 队列最多读取一个边沿。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"Caller exclusively drains one physical source. This method does not "
"initialize, stop, attach a wake, recover or otherwise own that source. A "
"failed/inconsistent read invalidates frame and repeat history."
msgstr "调用方独占排空一个物理来源。此方法不初始化、停止、连接唤醒、恢复或以其他方式拥有该来源。读取失败或不一致会使帧及重复帧历史失效。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[inout] Same decoder; callback reentry returns BUSY."
msgstr "[inout] 同一解码器；回调重入返回 BUSY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[in] Stable exact both-edge source in the config clock epoch."
msgstr "[in] config 时钟纪元内稳定且精确的双边沿来源。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Same feed result, EMPTY or exact port error; no callback is retained."
msgstr "与 feed 结果相同，或为 EMPTY、确切端口错误；不保留回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Drop software decode history after the serialized caller joins."
msgstr "串行调用方完成汇合后，清除软件解码历史。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"Drain/rebind the external source before a new clock epoch is supplied to a "
"reinitialized decoder. Stop does not establish hardware quiescence."
msgstr "为重新初始化的解码器提供新时钟纪元前，须先排空/重新绑定外部来源。Stop 不证明硬件静止。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "[inout] Stable storage with no active feed/poll callback."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定存储，无活动 feed/poll 回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/BUSY. No GPIO, EXTI stop or hardware access."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/BUSY。不执行 GPIO、EXTI stop 或硬件访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Inclusive authored microsecond limits, not measured tolerances."
msgstr "显式配置的微秒限值（含边界），不是实测容差。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Immutable complete waveform policy, retained through stop."
msgstr "完整且不可变的波形策略，保留至 stop 完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"All windows are nonzero and at most 20000 us. Zero/one and full/repeat space "
"windows cannot overlap. frame_max_us admits the complete worst permitted "
"32-bit frame plus trailer, at most 1000000 us. Repeat age is bounded by "
"repeat_max_us, at most 5000000 us since the last valid full frame or repeat. "
"Input is already demodulated active-low, both edges, in one stable monotonic "
"microsecond epoch. Carrier, receiver fitting, measured accuracy, remote model"
" and product key mapping are external. source_policy defaults to STRICT "
"(zero). IRQ_OBSERVATION explicitly permits COALESCED observations as a "
"software reference; every result remains SAMPLED_UNCERTAIN even when "
"particular inputs are flag-free."
msgstr ""
"所有时间窗口均须非零，且不超过 20000 us。零/一间隔窗口、完整帧/重复帧间隔窗口分别不得重叠。frame_max_us 须容纳允许的最坏情况下完整"
" 32 位帧及尾部，且不超过 1000000 us。重复帧时效由 repeat_max_us 限制，自上一个有效完整帧或重复帧起不超过 5000000 "
"us。输入已解调、低电平有效，包含双边沿，并处于同一个稳定的单调微秒时钟纪元。载波、接收器实装、实测精度、遥控器型号和产品按键映射由外部负责。source_policy"
" 默认为 STRICT（零）。IRQ_OBSERVATION 明确允许将 COALESCED 观察作为软件参考；即使某些输入未带标志，每个结果仍保持 "
"SAMPLED_UNCERTAIN。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Checked command; timestamp is its final edge or IRQ observation."
msgstr "经检查的命令；时间戳对应其最终边沿或 IRQ 观察。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"quality and preserved source_flags describe source uncertainty, not physical "
"capture proof. Repeat provenance includes its predecessor. NEC inverse checks"
" cannot establish that an IRQ source lost no edges."
msgstr ""
"quality 和保留的 source_flags 描述来源不确定性，不是物理捕获证明。重复帧的来源记录包括其前序帧。NEC 反码检查无法证明 IRQ "
"来源没有丢失边沿。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Value result; frame is meaningful only with SUCCESS."
msgstr "返回结果值；仅在 SUCCESS 时 frame 才有意义。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Caller-owned exact decoder storage, zero before initialization."
msgstr "调用方拥有的精确解码器存储，初始化前须清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid ""
"One serialized task executor. No edge/request/output survives return. Config "
"and any EXTI face/ops/opaque context remain live and disjoint from this "
"owner. Fields are implementation state, not caller controls."
msgstr ""
"单个串行任务执行者。返回后不保留对边沿/请求/输出的引用。配置及所有 EXTI "
"接口/ops/不透明上下文须保持存活，且与此所有者互不重叠。字段属于实现状态，不是调用方控制项。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:117
msgid "Byte transport, TLS and MQTT composition"
msgstr "字节传输、TLS 与 MQTT 装配"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:119
msgid ""
"`byte_stream.h` defines immediate partial reads and copied writes with finite"
" absolute deadlines. SUCCESS reports local byte acceptance, not peer "
"delivery; BUSY with zero bytes requires explicit owner progress. No caller "
"buffer remains borrowed after a stream operation returns. The optional "
"`Nexus::LwIPTCP` client implements this face over the pinned NO_SYS IPv4 "
"stack. Products still own the executor, peer selection, trusted time, entropy"
" and shutdown/reconnect policy."
msgstr ""
"`byte_stream.h` 定义了带有限绝对截止时间的即时部分读取和复制写入。SUCCESS 表示本地字节准入，不表示已交付对端；BUSY "
"且字节数为零时，需要所有者显式推进。字节流操作返回后，不再借用调用者的缓冲区。可选的 `Nexus::LwIPTCP` 客户端在锁定的 NO_SYS "
"IPv4 协议栈之上实现此接口。执行器、对端选择、可信时间、熵源以及停机和重连策略仍由产品负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Consumer"
msgstr "调用者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Selected target and header"
msgstr "选定目标与头文件"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Generic Ethernet adapter caller"
msgstr "通用以太网适配器调用者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "`Nexus::LwIP`, `nexus/network/lwip_adapter.h`"
msgstr "`Nexus::LwIP`, `nexus/network/lwip_adapter.h`"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Nexus types; no supplier headers or profile macros"
msgstr "Nexus 类型；不暴露厂商头文件或配置宏"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Generic TCP byte caller"
msgstr "通用 TCP 字节接口调用者"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "`Nexus::LwIPTCP`, `nexus/network/lwip_tcp.h`"
msgstr "`Nexus::LwIPTCP`, `nexus/network/lwip_tcp.h`"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Opaque client and the existing readonly byte face"
msgstr "不透明客户端与既有只读字节接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Static netif composition"
msgstr "静态 netif 装配"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "`Nexus::LwIPStorage`, `nexus/network/lwip_storage.h`"
msgstr "`Nexus::LwIPStorage`, `nexus/network/lwip_storage.h`"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Exact pinned netif/adapter layout, composition only"
msgstr "锁定版本的精确 netif／适配器布局，仅供装配使用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Static TCP composition"
msgstr "静态 TCP 装配"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "`Nexus::LwIPTCPStorage`, `nexus/network/lwip_tcp_storage.h`"
msgstr "`Nexus::LwIPTCPStorage`, `nexus/network/lwip_tcp_storage.h`"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:113
msgid "Exact pinned PCB/pbuf client layout, composition only"
msgstr "锁定版本的精确 PCB／pbuf 客户端布局，仅供装配使用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:133
msgid ""
"The composition initializes lwIP once and supplies a live network adapter, "
"caller-owned storage and a positive receive-frame budget. All raw stack APIs,"
" callbacks, network service and clients share one serialized NO_SYS executor."
" Call facade data/control outside raw callbacks; nested cross-facade mutation"
" is rejected with BUSY. No socket layer, worker, scheduler, lock, name "
"registry or maximum opaque pool is created. A successful TCP start admits "
"CONNECTING; it does not establish the connection. Its first finite connect "
"deadline cannot be extended. The existing byte face is a stateful handle, not"
" a readiness proof."
msgstr ""
"装配代码仅初始化一次 lwIP，并提供有效的网络适配器、调用者拥有的存储以及正数接收帧预算。全部原始协议栈 API、回调、网络推进和客户端由同一串行 "
"NO_SYS 执行器负责。接口的数据和控制调用必须位于原始回调之外；跨接口的嵌套修改以 BUSY 拒绝。组件不创建 socket "
"层、worker、调度器、锁、名称注册表或最大尺寸不透明对象池。TCP start 成功只表示准入 "
"CONNECTING，不表示连接已经建立。首次有限连接截止时间不能延长。既有字节接口是带状态的句柄，不是就绪证明。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:143
msgid ""
"TCP writes use official copied admission: a positive partial count releases "
"the caller input immediately, while queued data remains bounded stack "
"storage. Later output failure cannot undo that acceptance. Diagnostics "
"continue to report that failure, and subsequent data/service calls fail until"
" explicit abort. RX holds at most one accepted pbuf chain; refused chains "
"stay lwIP-owned. Only consumed bytes receive credit. Buffered bytes precede "
"orderly FIN, and peer half-close still permits writes. A frame budget bounds "
"acquisition, not the total wall time of arbitrary raw callbacks. Each nonzero"
" byte attempt may perform one explicitly budgeted network pass."
msgstr ""
"TCP "
"写入使用官方复制准入：正数部分写入计数表示调用者可立即复用输入，已排队数据仍保存在协议栈的有界存储中。之后的输出失败不能撤销该准入。诊断持续报告该失败，后续数据／推进调用在显式"
" abort 之前仍保持失败。RX 最多持有一条已接受的 pbuf 链；被拒收的链仍归 lwIP 所有。只对实际消费的字节返还接收额度。缓冲数据先于有序 "
"FIN 交付，对端半关闭后仍允许写入。帧预算限制取得的帧数，不限制任意原始回调的总耗时。每次非零字节尝试最多可以执行一轮显式预算的网络推进。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:152
msgid ""
"Official PCB allocation shares the bounded stack pool and its reclamation "
"policy. It may progress pending closes or reclaim TIME_WAIT, LAST_ACK, "
"CLOSING and lower-priority active connections, invoking other clients' error "
"callbacks even if the new start later fails. Local rejection retains no new "
"references for that client; it does not promise a globally unchanged stack."
msgstr ""
"官方 PCB 分配共享有界协议栈池及其回收策略。它可能推进待关闭连接，或回收 TIME_WAIT、LAST_ACK、CLOSING "
"及较低优先级的活动连接；即使新的 start 随后失败，也可能调用其他客户端的错误回调。本地拒绝表示该客户端不保留新的引用，不承诺整个协议栈未发生变化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:158
msgid ""
"After producers join, the owner consumes buffered RX and explicitly "
"progresses and retries close on BUSY under the first finite close deadline. "
"That deadline cannot be extended. Timeout requires explicit abort while "
"storage stays live; abort discards local data and detaches callbacks. "
"Successful close proves this client context's final stack access. The "
"official stack may still own deferred FIN and TIME_WAIT state. Preserve the "
"network adapter, global pools, timers and unchanged clock domain until the "
"product's complete stack shutdown/restart procedure permits withdrawal. "
"Client detachment does not prove global stack shutdown or MAC/PHY drain."
msgstr ""
"生产者完成 join 后，所有者消费缓冲 RX，并在首次有限关闭截止时间内遇到 BUSY 时显式推进和重试 close。该截止时间不能延长。超时后必须显式"
" abort，存储在此期间仍须有效；abort 丢弃本地数据并撤除回调引用。close "
"成功仅证明此客户端上下文已完成最后一次协议栈访问。官方协议栈仍可能保留待后续处理的 FIN 及 TIME_WAIT "
"状态。在产品的完整协议栈停机／重启流程允许撤回之前，网络适配器、全局存储池、定时器和未改变的时钟域都必须保持有效。客户端上下文脱离回调引用不证明全局协议栈停机或"
" MAC／PHY 已排空。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:168
msgid ""
"Ordinary TLS/MQTT consumers include `tls.h` or `client.h` and link "
"`Nexus::TLS` or `Nexus::CoreMQTT`. Their public session types are opaque and "
"expose no supplier headers or profile macros. Only the static composition "
"translation unit selects `Nexus::TLSStorage` with `nexus/tls/storage.h`, or "
"`Nexus::CoreMQTTStorage` with `nexus/mqtt/core_mqtt_storage.h`, to allocate "
"the exact pinned backend layout. Keep explicit storage targets local to "
"composition; fields are implementation state, not business control APIs or "
"binary ABI promises. Products explicitly call `nexus_add_tls()` or "
"`nexus_add_coremqtt()` to create the selected targets."
msgstr ""
"普通 TLS／MQTT 调用者包含 `tls.h` 或 `client.h`，并链接 `Nexus::TLS` 或 "
"`Nexus::CoreMQTT`。公共会话类型是不透明类型，不暴露厂商头文件或配置宏。只有静态装配翻译单元选择 `Nexus::TLSStorage` "
"与 `nexus/tls/storage.h`，或 `Nexus::CoreMQTTStorage` 与 "
"`nexus/mqtt/core_mqtt_storage.h`，以分配锁定后端的精确布局。显式存储目标必须局限于装配代码；字段是实现状态，不是业务控制 "
"API 或二进制 ABI 承诺。产品显式调用 `nexus_add_tls()` 或 `nexus_add_coremqtt()` 创建选定目标。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:177
msgid ""
"The TLS profile is one serialized TLS 1.2 client/PSA domain using ECDHE-ECDSA"
" P-256 and AES-128-GCM/SHA-256. It requires explicit DER trust, trusted UTC "
"and a reviewed entropy-quality assertion. Its 64 KiB caller arena and 512 B "
"TX stage exclude session metadata, transport memory and stack. Join facade "
"users, abort the session, then stop the runtime; failed or BUSY cleanup "
"retains its resources. The MQTT 3.1.1 profile provides clean sessions and "
"QoS0/1; callbacks borrow incoming views only until return. Explicit "
"DISCONNECT and TLS close report local progress and do not replace lower-layer"
" drain or peer acknowledgement. The component contracts detail "
"[network](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/network/README.md), [TLS](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/tls/README.md) and "
"[MQTT](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/mqtt/README.md) ownership and fixed profile limits."
msgstr ""
"TLS 配置是单一串行 TLS 1.2 客户端／PSA 域，使用 ECDHE-ECDSA P-256 和 "
"AES-128-GCM/SHA-256。它要求显式 DER 信任材料、可信 UTC 和经过审查的熵质量声明。调用者提供的 64 KiB 内存区和 512 "
"B TX 暂存区不包含会话元数据、传输存储和栈。先 join 全部接口使用者，再 abort 会话，然后停止 runtime；失败或 BUSY "
"的清理仍保留资源。MQTT 3.1.1 配置提供 clean session 和 QoS0/1；回调仅在返回前借用传入视图。显式 DISCONNECT 和"
" TLS close 表示本地推进，不替代下层排空或对端确认。[网络](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/network/README.md)、[TLS](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/tls/README.md) 和 "
"[MQTT](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/mqtt/README.md) 组件合同详细规定所有权及固定配置限制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:190
msgid ""
"For both Ethernet adapter profiles, successful link output reports frame "
"admission. A failed SETTLED TX outcome remains observable once through "
"`nx_lwip_adapter_service`; until that observation, another link output cannot"
" overwrite or reuse the TX buffer. Observing the error clears only the "
"settled, unborrowed request. It adds no error queue or instance storage and "
"does not reset the MAC, replay a packet or choose a product recovery policy. "
"An ACTIVE or QUARANTINED borrow remains retained. The TCP byte facade keeps "
"its existing connection-failure policy; frame-error observation does not "
"promise recovery."
msgstr ""
"对于两种 Ethernet adapter 配置，link output 成功表示帧已被接纳。失败的 SETTLED TX 结果会保留，并通过 "
"`nx_lwip_adapter_service` 报告一次；在该次观察之前，另一次 link output 不得覆盖或复用 TX "
"缓冲区。观察错误只会清除已经结清且不再被借用的请求。此机制不新增错误队列或实例存储，也不复位 MAC、重放数据包或选择产品恢复策略。ACTIVE 或 "
"QUARANTINED 的借用仍被保留。TCP 字节 facade 保留其既有的连接失败策略；观察到帧错误不承诺恢复。"

