#: docs/reference/api/components.md:293
msgid ""
"FIG-32 is a reference host-test data flow, not a product architecture or MCU "
"network qualification. Solid bidirectional edges carry the same ciphertext "
"over two independent TCP connections: software Ethernet frames between the "
"Nexus client and a test-only lwIP peer, then a host socket between the "
"transparent relay and local Mosquitto. The dashed edge identifies the one TLS"
" session, which terminates at the Nexus TLS client and Mosquitto; the relay "
"does not decrypt or terminate TLS. Each lwIP process owns its own serialized "
"stack and clock. {download}`Editable DOT <../../assets/diagrams/lwip-tcp-tls-"
"mqtt-host.dot>` and the [network contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/network/README.md) and "
"[maintained relay fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/lwip_mqtt_interop/README.md) define this"
" figure's source and lifetime boundaries."
msgstr ""
"FIG-32 描述主机测试的数据流参考，不是产品架构或 MCU 网络资格。双向实线在两条独立 TCP 连接上传送同一密文：Nexus 客户端与仅用于测试的"
" lwIP 对端之间使用软件以太网帧，透明中继与本地 Mosquitto 之间使用主机 socket。虚线标出唯一的 TLS 会话，其端点是 Nexus "
"TLS 客户端和 Mosquitto；中继不解密或终止 TLS。每个 lwIP 进程拥有各自的串行协议栈和时钟。{download}`可编辑 DOT "
"<../../assets/diagrams/lwip-tcp-tls-mqtt-"
"host.dot>`、[网络合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/network/README.md) "
"以及[维护的中继工装](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/lwip_mqtt_interop/README.md) 给出图的源码及生命周期边界。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:305
msgid ""
"The host fixtures exercise actual pinned stack and protocol implementations "
"with software frame ports and controlled services. Direct POSIX TLS/MQTT "
"fixtures and the full lwIP/TCP relay fixture retain their own execution "
"evidence. Neither model Ethernet nor a real host broker proves Board wiring, "
"physical PHY/DMA, MCU entropy quality, measured resource peaks, installed SDK"
" acceptance or HIL."
msgstr ""
"主机工装使用软件帧接口和受控服务，执行实际锁定的协议栈与协议实现。直接 POSIX TLS／MQTT 工装和完整 lwIP／TCP "
"中继工装各自保留执行证据。模型以太网或真实主机 broker 都不证明 板卡接线、物理 PHY／DMA、MCU 熵质量、实测资源峰值、安装版 SDK "
"验收或 HIL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:313
msgid "byte_stream.h"
msgstr "byte_stream.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:315
msgid "Immediate partial byte transport without retained buffers."
msgstr "不保留缓冲区的即时部分字节传输。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:315
msgid "Immutable methods for a serialized nonblocking byte stream."
msgstr "用于串行化非阻塞字节流的只读方法。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:315
msgid ""
"Every call has a finite absolute monotonic deadline in the transport's "
"explicit clock domain. Calls do not wait, create workers or retain "
"input/output buffers after return. An accepted write copies bytes into the "
"transport's own bounded storage; it does not promise peer delivery. SUCCESS "
"writes 1..requested bytes for a nonempty write, or reads 1..requested bytes. "
"SUCCESS with read count zero means orderly EOF. BUSY has count zero and means"
" retry after explicit owner progress. Other results are errors, never "
"alternate encodings of would-block. Zero-byte calls return SUCCESS/count zero"
" without underlying I/O. Output count is disjoint from all buffers and live "
"transport storage. Transport, table and context outlive every consumer and "
"its shutdown."
msgstr ""
"每次调用均使用传输层明确时间域内的有限绝对单调截止时间。调用不等待、不创建工作线程，也不在返回后保留输入/输出缓冲区。已接受的写入将字节复制到传输层自己的有界存储中；不承诺对端收到。非空写入"
" SUCCESS 时接受 1..requested 字节；读取 SUCCESS 时取得 1..requested 字节。读取计数为零的 SUCCESS "
"表示正常 EOF。BUSY 的计数为零，表示所有者显式推进后重试。其他结果均为错误，不能用来变相表示 would-block。零字节调用返回 "
"SUCCESS/计数零，不执行下层 I/O。输出计数与全部缓冲区及有效传输存储互不重叠。传输层、方法表和上下文必须存活至全部使用方及其关闭操作结束。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:315
msgid "Stable readonly face; no factory lookup, allocation or start."
msgstr "稳定只读接口；不查 factory、不分配或启动。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:321
msgid "lwip_adapter.h"
msgstr "lwip_adapter.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Explicit single-owner lwIP Ethernet copying adapter."
msgstr "显式单所有者 lwIP 以太网复制适配器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323 docs/reference/api/components.md:331
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350 docs/reference/api/components.md:369
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377 docs/reference/api/components.md:506
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Backend storage is defined only by the explicit storage header."
msgstr "后端存储仅由显式存储头文件定义。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Attach one caller-owned netif without initializing MAC or PHY."
msgstr "连接调用者拥有的一个 netif，不初始化 MAC 或 PHY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"Task-only, one serialized stack execution owner. Address configuration is "
"static IPv4; the underlying stack is the pinned NO_SYS profile. Storage must "
"be disjoint from configuration, TX bytes and RX views. Failure retains no new"
" hardware borrow. Link starts down; only an explicit external PHY observation"
" may bring it up."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由单一串行协议栈执行所有者调用。地址配置为静态 IPv4；底层协议栈是锁定的 NO_SYS 配置。存储必须与配置、TX 字节和 RX "
"视图互不重叠。失败不保留新的硬件借用。链路初始为 down；只有显式外部 PHY 观测才可将其设为 up。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[inout] Zero-initialized backend storage, not already live."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化且尚未处于有效状态的后端存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[in] Explicit configuration; copied without retaining it."
msgstr "[in] 显式配置；复制内容，不保留其引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Success, invalid inputs, or BUSY for an already attached netif."
msgstr "成功、输入无效，或 netif 已连接时的 BUSY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Progress MAC, bounded complete RX frames and stack timer callbacks."
msgstr "推进 MAC、有界数量的完整 RX 帧以及协议栈定时器回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"Same task owner as every lwIP raw API/callback. Timer callback cost is "
"governed by the fixed stack profile and application callbacks; this is not a "
"hard bound on the entire invocation. The copying profile copies RX bytes "
"before exact release. The explicit loaned-RX profile retains immutable "
"payload tails until its custom-pbuf references end. A failed release retains "
"its token and closes progress; stop retries release without feeding duplicate"
" bytes into the stack. Inline and deferred TX failure remain observable "
"before request reuse; while pending, new link output returns ERR_IF without "
"admitting bytes. Success inline completion remains immediately reusable. "
"Consuming an already-settled failure makes the TX request READY, without "
"automatic reset, replay, adapter close or forced restart. The product chooses"
" provider recovery; an actual unfinished borrow is never revoked."
msgstr ""
"与所有 lwIP raw API／回调共用同一任务 "
"owner。定时器回调开销由固定协议栈配置和应用回调决定；这不构成整个调用的硬性时间上界。复制式配置在精确归还令牌前复制 RX 字节。显式借用式 RX "
"配置保留不可变载荷尾部，直到 custom-pbuf 引用结束。release 失败会保留令牌并关闭后续接收推进；stop 重试 "
"release，不会将重复字节送入协议栈。inline 和延后结清的 TX 失败在请求复用前均保持可观察；尚未观察时，新 link output 返回 "
"ERR_IF，不接纳字节。inline SUCCESS 仍可立即复用。消费已结清的失败会将 TX 请求置为 READY，不会自动复位、重放、关闭 "
"adapter 或强制重启。产品决定 provider 恢复策略；实际尚未结束的借用绝不会被撤销。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[inout] Live storage, including any unfinished loans."
msgstr "[inout] 仍有效且包含所有未结束借用的存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[in] Nonzero maximum acquired frames this invocation."
msgstr "[in] 此次调用最多取得的帧数，必须为正数。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"Success, one pending settled TX failure, or provider/release/state error. A "
"settled TX failure is consumed once before further progress."
msgstr "成功、一个待观察的已结清 TX 失败，或 provider／release／状态错误。已结清的 TX 失败会在继续推进前消费一次。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Apply a proven external PHY fact to the MAC, then the netif."
msgstr "先将经过确认的外部 PHY 事实应用到 MAC，再应用到 netif。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"One task owner. Existing provider quiescence rules still apply. This does not"
" negotiate, reset, power or prove the physical link."
msgstr "由单一任务所有者调用。既有 provider 静止规则仍适用。该操作不协商、不复位、不供电，也不证明物理链路。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[inout] Live, nonclosing adapter storage."
msgstr "[inout] 有效且尚未关闭准入的适配器存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[in] Actual PHY observation, not a software default."
msgstr "[in] 实际 PHY 观测，不是软件默认值。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Underlying MAC admission result; failure preserves netif flags."
msgstr "底层 MAC 准入结果；失败时保留 netif 标志。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Close adapter admission and detach only after actual MAC drain."
msgstr "关闭适配器准入，只有实际 MAC 排空后才脱离连接。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"The product first closes its PCBs, raw callbacks, queues and observers. This "
"stops only the netif/MAC adapter, not the global lwIP stack or all "
"application connections. A timeout or failed drain never revokes TX or RX "
"loans; retry after explicit provider recovery. No automatic reset or replay "
"occurs. Stop is idempotent after successful detachment."
msgstr ""
"产品必须先关闭其 PCB、原始回调、队列及观察者。该操作只停止 netif／MAC 适配器，不停止全局 lwIP "
"协议栈或全部应用连接。超时或排空失败从不撤销 TX／RX 借用；显式恢复 provider 后重试。不自动复位或重放。成功脱离连接后的 stop "
"是幂等操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[inout] Live storage retained on any unfinished withdrawal."
msgstr "[inout] 有效存储；撤回未完成时仍保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Success after detachment; otherwise the actual withdrawal error."
msgstr "成功脱离连接后返回成功，否则返回实际撤回错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Product-supplied monotonic milliseconds for lwIP timers."
msgstr "由产品提供的 lwIP 定时器单调毫秒时钟。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"Task owner only. Supply this symbol once per selected stack profile; its "
"clock source and lifetime must cover every pending stack timer."
msgstr "仅由任务所有者调用。每个选定协议栈配置只提供一次此符号；时钟源及其生命周期必须覆盖全部待处理协议栈定时器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Wrapping milliseconds in the stack's unchanged live time domain."
msgstr "协议栈未改变且仍有效的时间域内，允许自然回绕的毫秒数。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Product-supplied random word; no libc or timestamp fallback."
msgstr "由产品提供的随机字；没有 libc 或时间戳回退。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"Called by the serialized stack owner. Source failure must enter the product's"
" nonreturning fault path; returning a fixed value is allowed only in an "
"explicitly unqualified host test fixture."
msgstr "由串行协议栈所有者调用。源失败必须进入产品的不返回故障路径；仅在显式未资格化的主机测试工装中允许返回固定值。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "A word from the product's admitted random source."
msgstr "来自产品已准入随机源的一个字。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Product-supplied nonreturning stack invariant failure observation."
msgstr "由产品提供的不返回协议栈不变量失败观测。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"Task owner. Never return or release quarantined hardware storage merely "
"because the stack reported an assertion. No default abort is linked."
msgstr "由任务所有者调用。不能仅因为协议栈报告断言就返回或释放隔离中的硬件存储。不链接默认 abort。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "[in] Static diagnostic text, not a retained ownership token."
msgstr "[in] 静态诊断文本，不是保留的所有权 token。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid "Explicit static IPv4 configuration and caller-owned frame storage."
msgstr "显式静态 IPv4 配置及调用者拥有的帧存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:323
msgid ""
"The serialized stack owner initializes lwIP once before attachment. The port,"
" clock, TX buffer and views outlive attachment and all loans. Clock and "
"provider deadlines use the same live monotonic domain. No default worker, "
"lock, PHY, address, DHCP, DNS or heap is provided."
msgstr ""
"串行协议栈所有者在连接之前仅初始化一次 lwIP。接口、时钟、TX 缓冲区和视图的生命周期必须覆盖连接及全部借用。时钟与 provider "
"截止时间使用同一有效单调域。不提供默认 worker、锁、PHY、地址、DHCP、DNS 或堆。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:329
msgid "lwip_loaned_rx.h"
msgstr "lwip_loaned_rx.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "Explicit immutable RX-payload loan profile for lwIP."
msgstr "lwIP 的显式不可变 RX 负载借用配置。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "Exact selected backend slot, defined by its storage target."
msgstr "由其存储目标定义的精确选定后端槽。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "Exact selected custom-pbuf piece, not a packet allocator."
msgstr "精确选定的 custom-pbuf 片段，不是数据包分配器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "Attach the explicitly selected payload-zero-copy RX profile."
msgstr "挂接显式选定的负载零复制 RX 配置。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid ""
"Task-only, same serialized nonreentrant NO_SYS owner as all raw calls. Select"
" only the loaned profile and its storage target in this image. "
"Ethernet/ARP/max IPv4/max TCP headers are copied; immutable payload tails are"
" loaned. This is not whole-frame or TX zero-copy. No VLAN, IPv6, DHCP, DNS, "
"reassembly, worker, heap or physical link is added. MAC payload spans must be"
" disjoint from the adapter, TX/view storage and all selected slot/piece "
"metadata; admission releases invalid loans. Final custom-pbuf frees only mark"
" a slot ready. Subsequent service or stop performs exact provider release. "
"Failed release preserves the token and closes admission. Stop returns BUSY "
"while references remain. Products close PCBs and all raw observers before "
"adapter withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，与所有 raw 调用使用同一个串行、不可重入的 NO_SYS "
"owner。此镜像中只选择借用式配置及其存储目标。Ethernet／ARP／最大 IPv4／最大 TCP 头会被复制；不可变负载尾部被借用。这不是整帧或 "
"TX 零复制。不新增 VLAN、IPv6、DHCP、DNS、重组、worker、堆或物理链路。MAC 负载区间必须与 "
"adapter、TX／视图存储及所有选定槽／片段元数据互不重叠；接纳路径会释放无效借用。custom-pbuf 的最终释放只标记槽已就绪。后续 "
"service 或 stop 执行精确 provider 释放。释放失败会保留令牌并关闭接纳。引用尚存时，stop 返回 BUSY。产品须在 "
"adapter 撤离前关闭 PCB 和所有 raw 观察者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "[inout] Zero-initialized selected backend storage."
msgstr "[inout] 零初始化的选定后端存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "[in] Disjoint stable storage description; copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 互不重叠且稳定的存储描述；成功时复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "Success, invalid configuration, or an already attached owner."
msgstr "成功、配置无效，或已有挂接的 owner。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid "Caller-selected RX loan and fragment metadata, without a hidden pool."
msgstr "调用方选定的 RX 借用和片段元数据，不含隐藏池。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:331
msgid ""
"Slots and pieces are zero-initialized and remain live through final pbuf "
"release, exact MAC release and adapter detachment. Supply at least slot_count"
" * base.rx_capacity pieces. Each slot owns one copied 136-byte writable "
"header prefix. Remaining packet payload references immutable MAC bytes; raw "
"consumers must not write those PBUF_ROM tail bytes. The exact provider "
"descriptor geometry still limits concurrent loans."
msgstr ""
"槽和片段须零初始化，并持续存活至最终 pbuf 释放、精确 MAC 释放和 adapter 解除挂接完成。至少提供 slot_count * "
"base.rx_capacity 个片段。每个槽拥有一个复制的 136 字节可写头部前缀。其余数据包负载引用不可变 MAC 字节；raw "
"消费方不得写入这些 PBUF_ROM 尾部字节。实际 provider 的精确描述符布局仍限制并发借用数。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:337
msgid "lwip_loaned_rx_storage.h"
msgstr "lwip_loaned_rx_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:339
msgid ""
"This selected-profile header belongs only at static composition. Its fields "
"describe retained frame and pbuf storage, not a mutable consumer interface."
msgstr "此选定配置的头文件仅用于静态装配。其字段描述保留中的帧与 pbuf 存储，不是可变的消费方接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:342
msgid "Exact selected RX-loan/custom-pbuf composition storage."
msgstr "精确选定的 RX 借用／custom-pbuf 装配存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:342
msgid "One caller-owned custom-pbuf header with its unique owning slot."
msgstr "一个调用方拥有的 custom-pbuf 头及其唯一归属槽。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:342
msgid "Private backend fields; raw users own only normal pbuf references."
msgstr "私有后端字段；raw 用户只拥有普通 pbuf 引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:342
msgid "One exact RX token shared by all retained pieces of that frame."
msgstr "由该帧所有保留片段共享的一个精确 RX 令牌。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:342
msgid ""
"The union provides eight-byte alignment in the maintained profile. A free "
"callback only decrements references; it never touches hardware. A slot cannot"
" be reused until the provider accepts the exact release. Raw users cannot "
"access a pbuf after returning its final reference."
msgstr ""
"该联合体在维护中的配置下提供八字节对齐。释放回调只减少引用数；它从不访问硬件。只有 provider 接受精确释放后才可复用槽。raw 用户在归还 "
"pbuf 的最后一个引用后不得再访问它。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:348
msgid "lwip_tcp.h"
msgstr "lwip_tcp.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Bounded copied TCP client for one NO_SYS stack."
msgstr "面向单个 NO_SYS 协议栈的有界复制 TCP 客户端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team  Version  1.0.0  Date  2026-11-02  Copyright  Copyright "
"(c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
"作者  Nexus Team  版本  1.0.0  日期  2026-11-02  版权  Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350 docs/reference/api/components.md:361
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506 docs/reference/api/components.md:522
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "1.0.0"
msgstr "1.0.0"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350 docs/reference/api/components.md:361
msgid "2026-11-02"
msgstr "2026-11-02"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350 docs/reference/api/components.md:361
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506 docs/reference/api/components.md:522
#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr "Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus Team"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Admit one asynchronous connect with a copied configuration."
msgstr "使用复制的配置准入一次异步连接。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Initialize lwIP once. SUCCESS never proves ESTABLISHED. Rejection retains no "
"new PCB/pbuf/config reference for this client. An admitted client requires "
"explicit close or abort."
msgstr ""
"调用者先初始化一次 lwIP。SUCCESS 从不表示已达 ESTABLISHED。拒绝时，本客户端不保留新的 PCB、pbuf "
"或配置引用。准入后的客户端必须显式 close 或 abort。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"PCBs share the official stack pool and its reclamation policy. Allocation may"
" progress pending closes and reclaim TIME_WAIT, LAST_ACK, CLOSING or lower-"
"priority active PCBs. This can invoke other connections' error callbacks, "
"even if this start later fails. Local rejection does not promise a globally "
"unchanged stack."
msgstr ""
"PCB 共享官方协议栈的池及其回收策略。分配可能推进待完成的关闭，并回收 TIME_WAIT、LAST_ACK、CLOSING 或较低优先级的活动 "
"PCB。即使本次 start 随后失败，也可能因此调用其他连接的错误回调。局部拒绝并不保证整个协议栈保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[inout] Zeroed exact storage with all former users joined."
msgstr "[inout] 精确布局的零初始化存储；所有先前使用者均已完成 join。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Live adapter, copied IPv4 peer, nonzero port/budget."
msgstr "[in] 有效适配器、复制的 IPv4 对端，以及非零端口和预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] First finite absolute connect deadline."
msgstr "[in] 首个有限的连接绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"SUCCESS admits CONNECTING. BUSY rejects an occupied domain. INVALID rejects "
"configuration; EXHAUSTED/IO report stack admission."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 准入 CONNECTING。操作域已被占用时以 BUSY 拒绝。INVALID 拒绝配置；EXHAUSTED/IO 报告栈准入错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Perform one budgeted network pass and progress this connection."
msgstr "执行一次受预算限制的网络推进，并推进本连接。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"No wait or worker. Fatal errors remain sticky until explicit abort. Expiry "
"does not release PCBs, pbufs or any underlying MAC loan."
msgstr "不等待，也不创建工作线程。致命错误持续保留，直到显式 abort。截止时间到期不会释放 PCB、pbuf 或任何底层 MAC 借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[inout] Live client owned by the serialized task executor."
msgstr "[inout] 有效客户端，由串行任务执行器独占使用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"SUCCESS for progress; BUSY for connecting/congestion/reentry; TIMEOUT for the"
" locked deadline, or an actual provider/stack error."
msgstr ""
"推进时返回 SUCCESS；连接中、拥塞或重入时返回 BUSY；已锁定截止时间到期时返回 TIMEOUT；也可能返回实际 provider／协议栈错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Copy an immediate partial write into bounded stack storage."
msgstr "将本次可立即接受的部分写入复制到有界栈存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Positive acceptance is TCP queue admission, not peer delivery. "
"Delivery/acknowledgement policy belongs to the caller. A later output failure"
" cannot undo an already copied acceptance. Invalid aliased counts are "
"rejected before writing that count."
msgstr ""
"接受正数个字节表示准入 TCP "
"队列，不表示已交付对端。交付与确认策略由调用方负责。后续输出失败无法撤销已经复制的接受结果。计数对象发生非法别名时，在写入该计数前拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[inout] Live serialized task owner, outside raw callbacks."
msgstr "[inout] 有效客户端，由串行任务上下文独占使用，且调用发生在 raw 回调之外。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Stable input for this call; never retained after return."
msgstr "[in] 本次调用期间稳定的输入；返回后绝不保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Requested length; zero needs no clock/provider progress."
msgstr "[in] 请求长度；为零时无需读取时钟或推进 provider。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[out] Disjoint copied count; zero on valid BUSY/error."
msgstr "[out] 与其他存储不重叠的已复制字节计数；有效的 BUSY／错误返回时为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Finite absolute admission deadline in adapter time."
msgstr "[in] 适配器时间域中的有限准入绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"SUCCESS with a positive copied count, BUSY without admission, TIMEOUT before "
"admission, STATE while closing, or a sticky failure."
msgstr ""
"复制正数个字节时返回 SUCCESS；未准入时返回 BUSY；准入前超时返回 TIMEOUT；关闭中返回 STATE；也可能返回持续保留的失败。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Copy partial RX data and credit only bytes actually consumed."
msgstr "复制部分 RX 数据，并仅为实际消耗的字节归还接收额度。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"One accepted pbuf chain is held. Refused chains remain lwIP-owned. Buffered "
"bytes precede FIN; peer half-close still permits writes. TLS independently "
"authenticates close-notify. Invalid aliased counts are rejected before "
"writing that count."
msgstr ""
"最多持有一个已接受的 pbuf 链。被拒绝的链仍由 lwIP 持有。先返回缓冲字节，再报告 FIN；对端半关闭后仍允许写入。TLS 独立认证 close-"
"notify。计数对象发生非法别名时，在写入该计数前拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[inout] Serialized task owner; reads may drain while closing."
msgstr "[inout] 由串行任务上下文独占使用；关闭过程中可通过读取排空数据。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[out] Unretained output disjoint from all known live storage."
msgstr "[out] 返回后不保留的输出，与全部已知有效存储不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Capacity; zero needs no clock/provider progress."
msgstr "[in] 容量；为零时无需读取时钟或推进 provider。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[out] Disjoint count; zero on valid BUSY/error or EOF."
msgstr "[out] 与其他存储不重叠的计数；有效的 BUSY／错误或 EOF 返回时为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Finite absolute attempt deadline in adapter time."
msgstr "[in] 适配器时间域中本次尝试的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"SUCCESS with data, SUCCESS/count zero for orderly TCP EOF, BUSY without data,"
" TIMEOUT, STATE when detached, or sticky failure."
msgstr ""
"有数据时返回 SUCCESS；有序 TCP EOF 返回 SUCCESS 且计数为零；无数据时返回 BUSY；也可能返回 TIMEOUT、脱离后的 "
"STATE 或持续保留的失败。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Close admission and detach after explicit local drain."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在显式局部排空后脱离。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"CONNECTING may close before establishment. Callbacks detach before successful"
" tcp_close; its PCB must never be accessed afterwards. The pinned stack can "
"defer FIN allocation while returning success. FIN/TIME_WAIT belong to the "
"still-live stack/network. This operation does not prove global or PHY drain. "
"Timeout requires explicit abort."
msgstr ""
"CONNECTING 可以在建立连接前关闭。调用 tcp_close 前先解除回调引用；调用成功后绝不能再访问其 "
"PCB。固定版本的协议栈可在返回成功时延后分配 FIN。FIN/TIME_WAIT 属于仍在存续的协议栈／网络域。本操作不证明全局或 PHY "
"已排空。超时后必须显式 abort。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[inout] Producers joined; reads may drain retained RX."
msgstr "[inout] 生产者均已完成 join；可通过读取排空保留的 RX。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] First finite close deadline; never implicitly extended."
msgstr "[in] 首个有限的关闭截止时间；绝不隐式延长。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"SUCCESS detaches this context. BUSY retains held/refused RX, unacknowledged "
"TX or a failed close. TIMEOUT retains all ownership."
msgstr "SUCCESS 使本上下文脱离。BUSY 保留已持有或被拒绝的 RX、未确认的 TX 或失败的关闭状态。TIMEOUT 保留全部所有权责任。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Explicitly discard data, detach callbacks and abort an owned PCB."
msgstr "显式丢弃数据、解除回调引用，并 abort 仍由本客户端持有的 PCB。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"BUSY releases nothing. The error callback already freed its PCB. Product code"
" separately drains the MAC/netif after all clients join."
msgstr "BUSY 不释放任何资源。错误回调已释放其 PCB。全部客户端完成退出后，产品代码另行排空 MAC／netif。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[inout] Exclusive storage after facade users have joined."
msgstr "[inout] 全部接口使用者完成 join 后的独占存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after local cleanup, including a cold client; BUSY while any facade "
"operation/callback executes; INVALID for a null client."
msgstr ""
"局部清理完成后返回 SUCCESS，包括冷态客户端；任何接口操作或回调执行期间返回 BUSY；client 为 NULL 时返回 INVALID。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Return the existing readonly byte face without progressing it."
msgstr "返回已有的只读字节接口，不推进执行。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Readonly query in the same serialized task domain. A face is not connection "
"readiness; its data methods return the actual state."
msgstr "在同一串行任务域中进行只读查询。接口存在不表示连接就绪；其数据方法返回实际状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Storage retained through every facade user."
msgstr "[in] 必须保持存储有效，直到每个接口使用者均结束访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Stable face while initialized, including CONNECTING/FAILED; NULL before "
"admission or after successful close/abort."
msgstr "初始化有效期间返回稳定接口，包括 CONNECTING/FAILED 状态；准入前或成功 close／abort 后返回 NULL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Copy a readonly owner snapshot without progressing the stack."
msgstr "复制只读的所有者状态快照，不推进协议栈。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Use the serialized executor. A snapshot neither admits I/O nor authorizes "
"release. Detached queries never follow old borrowed state."
msgstr "使用串行执行器。快照既不准入 I/O，也不授权释放。脱离后的查询绝不追踪旧的借用状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[in] Live or locally detached storage, still allocated."
msgstr "[in] 有效或已局部脱离、但仍保持分配的存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "[out] Output disjoint from known live control/data."
msgstr "[out] 与已知有效控制／数据存储不重叠的输出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "SUCCESS for the snapshot; INVALID for null or aliased output."
msgstr "成功取得快照时返回 SUCCESS；输出为空或非法别名时返回 INVALID。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "One copied IPv4 peer and an explicit network progress budget."
msgstr "复制的 IPv4 对端，以及显式网络推进预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Network storage and its clock epoch outlive every client. They also outlive "
"detached FIN/TIME_WAIT state in the stack."
msgstr "网络存储及其时钟纪元必须比每个客户端存续更久，也必须覆盖协议栈中脱离上下文后仍存在的 FIN/TIME_WAIT 状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"One serialized NO_SYS executor owns raw APIs and all clients. Call facade "
"data/control outside raw callbacks. Nested mutation across facade instances "
"returns BUSY without recursive progress."
msgstr ""
"一个串行 NO_SYS 执行器拥有 raw API 和全部客户端。接口的数据／控制调用必须位于 raw 回调之外。跨接口实例的嵌套修改返回 "
"BUSY，不递归推进。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid ""
"Nonzero I/O may service at most receive_budget Ethernet frames. No worker, "
"DNS, reconnect policy or instance registry is added."
msgstr "非零 I/O 最多服务 receive_budget 个以太网帧。不新增工作线程、DNS、重连策略或实例注册表。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:350
msgid "Owner snapshot; it grants no permission to mutate a connection."
msgstr "所有者状态快照；不授予修改连接的权限。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:356
msgid "lwip_tcp_storage.h"
msgstr "lwip_tcp_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:358
msgid ""
"This exact-profile header is for static composition. Its fields do not extend"
" the generic client interface."
msgstr "该精确配置头文件仅用于静态装配。其字段不扩展通用客户端接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:361
msgid "Exact pinned TCP client storage; composition only."
msgstr "固定版本的精确 TCP 客户端存储；仅供装配使用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:361
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team   Version  1.0.0   Date  2026-11-02   Copyright  Copyright"
" (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
"作者  Nexus Team   版本  1.0.0   日期  2026-11-02   版权  Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus "
"Team"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:367
msgid "tls.h"
msgstr "tls.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Explicit bounded TLS 1.2 client and crypto-domain lifecycle."
msgstr "显式有界 TLS 1.2 客户端与密码域生命周期。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Source-quality declaration, never inferred from a health check."
msgstr "源质量声明，绝不从健康检查推断。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Initialize one explicit PSA/arena domain, never once per connection."
msgstr "初始化一个显式 PSA/arena 域，而非每次连接都初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"No worker/heap/lock. A second live domain is BUSY. Every library entropy "
"callback is guarded by the shorter operation/entropy deadline."
msgstr "无工作线程、堆或锁。第二个有效域返回 BUSY。每次库熵回调均受操作截止时间与熵截止时间中较早者约束。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Zeroed static backend storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的静态后端存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Configuration copied; referenced resources stay borrowed."
msgstr "[in] 复制配置；被引用资源继续借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Finite absolute initialization deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限绝对初始化截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success, permission for undeclared quality, or actual bounded error."
msgstr "成功；未声明质量时返回权限错误；或实际有界操作错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Stop PSA only after all sessions and outside consumers have joined."
msgstr "仅在全部会话和外部使用方退出后停止 PSA。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"No session cleanup calls this operation implicitly. Product code must not use"
" PSA outside this explicit domain or reset its global allocator."
msgstr "会话清理不会隐式调用此操作。产品代码不得在此显式域外使用 PSA 或重置其全局分配器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Exclusive live domain owner."
msgstr "[inout] 有效域的独占所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "BUSY with a session; success frees PSA then wipes the whole arena."
msgstr "仍有会话时返回 BUSY；成功时先释放 PSA，再擦除整个 arena。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Prepare one client using public Mbed TLS APIs and required peer auth."
msgstr "使用公共 Mbed TLS API 和强制对端认证准备一个客户端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"No raw credential input is retained after return. Port and staging stay "
"borrowed until abort; failures clean partial backend state."
msgstr "返回后不保留原始凭据输入。端口和暂存区继续借用到 abort；失败时清理部分后端状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Explicit trust, hostname, optional client identity/port."
msgstr "[in] 显式信任、主机名和可选客户端身份/端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Finite initialization deadline, including key import."
msgstr "[in] 包括密钥导入的有限初始化截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success, BUSY for the occupied domain, or no-admission failure."
msgstr "成功；域已占用时为 BUSY；或未准入的失败。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Perform one public handshake step under the first locked deadline."
msgstr "在首次锁定的截止时间内执行一次公共握手步骤。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"First step publicly reseeds PSA with a finite guard. Trusted UTC is sampled "
"coherently; loss during a library date check is latched and overrides a "
"successful library result. Renegotiation is disabled."
msgstr ""
"首个步骤通过公共 API 在有限约束下重新播种 PSA。对可信 UTC 取一致快照；库日期检查期间失去可信时间会被锁存，并覆盖库的成功结果。禁用重新协商。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Initialized exclusive client."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的独占客户端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Finite deadline; later calls cannot extend the first."
msgstr "[in] 有限截止时间；后续调用不能延长首次截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success only after verified auth; BUSY for progress/WANT; fatal error."
msgstr "仅认证验证成功后返回成功；推进/WANT 时返回 BUSY；或致命错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Progress the one accepted plaintext staging block without waiting."
msgstr "推进唯一已接受的明文暂存块，不等待。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"WANT retries keep the backend's exact original pointer/length. An expired "
"queued write fails the session; only abort releases its stage."
msgstr "WANT 重试保留后端原始指针和长度。排队写入过期会使会话失败；仅 abort 释放其暂存区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Live serialized owner."
msgstr "[inout] 有效的串行化所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success when no pending bytes; BUSY for WANT; sticky fatal error."
msgstr "无待发字节时成功；WANT 时 BUSY；或锁存的致命错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Copy an immediate partial write into the explicit bounded stage."
msgstr "将即时部分写入复制到显式有界暂存区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"Original input may be reused immediately. Pending stage is never overwritten,"
" replayed or discarded on timeout. Late failures are sticky. An invalid "
"aliased count is rejected before writing that count."
msgstr "原始输入可立即复用。待发暂存区不会被覆盖、重放或在超时后丢弃。后续失败会锁存。无效别名计数在写该计数之前被拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Established serialized client."
msgstr "[inout] 已建立连接的串行化客户端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Immutable input, not retained after return."
msgstr "[in] 只读输入，返回后不保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Requested bytes; zero performs no I/O."
msgstr "[in] 请求字节数；零不执行 I/O。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[out] Disjoint copied count; zero on BUSY/error."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的复制计数；BUSY/错误时为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline retained for accepted bytes."
msgstr "[in] 为已接受字节保留的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success means copied admission, not peer delivery; BUSY or error."
msgstr "成功表示复制准入，不表示对端收到；或 BUSY/错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Try to copy authenticated plaintext without retaining caller output."
msgstr "尝试复制已认证明文，不保留调用方输出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"Raw transport EOF without close-notify is a sticky truncation error. An "
"expired preflight retains session state and creates no new borrow. An invalid"
" aliased count is rejected before writing that count. A pending stage with a "
"later effective deadline returns BUSY without automatic I/O; the owner "
"explicitly services that earlier acceptance."
msgstr ""
"未收到 close-notify 的底层传输 EOF "
"是锁存的截断错误。准入前已过期时保留会话状态，不建立新借用。无效别名计数在写该计数之前被拒绝。待发暂存区的有效截止时间较晚时返回 BUSY，不自动执行 "
"I/O；所有者显式推进先前已接受的写入。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[out] Unretained output disjoint from all live session storage."
msgstr "[out] 不保留的输出，与全部有效会话存储互不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Writable capacity; zero performs no I/O."
msgstr "[in] 可写容量；零不执行 I/O。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[out] Disjoint count; zero on BUSY/error or auth EOF."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的计数；BUSY/错误或认证 EOF 时为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline for this nonblocking attempt."
msgstr "[in] 本次非阻塞尝试的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success/bytes, BUSY, authenticated close-notify EOF, or error."
msgstr "成功/字节数、BUSY、已认证 close-notify EOF 或错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Send close-notify with an explicit first locked deadline."
msgstr "使用首次显式锁定的截止时间发送 close-notify。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"Pending app bytes must first drain. This never closes the underlying "
"transport or proves the peer consumed data. Abort still frees storage."
msgstr "必须先排空待发应用字节。此操作不关闭下层传输，也不证明对端已消费数据。仍需 abort 释放存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Exclusive live client after producers have joined."
msgstr "[inout] 生产者全部退出后的独占有效客户端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline; no implicit extension."
msgstr "[in] 有限绝对截止时间；不隐式延长。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success means local alert accepted, BUSY for WANT, or sticky error."
msgstr "成功表示本地警报已接受；WANT 时为 BUSY；或锁存错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Free synchronous session state and wipe its stage after final access."
msgstr "最终访问结束后释放同步会话状态并擦除其暂存区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"BUSY retains all storage; the outer owner retries after callback join. No "
"network I/O or replay. Underlying transport closure remains external. The "
"pinned builtin synchronous crypto profile retains no callback after return. "
"PSA domain/arena stays live for the next explicit session."
msgstr ""
"BUSY 保留全部存储；外层所有者在回调退出后重试。不执行网络 I/O 或重放。下层传输关闭仍由外部负责。锁定的内置同步密码配置不在返回后保留回调。PSA"
" 域/arena 保持有效，供下一个显式会话使用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "[inout] Exclusive owner, all external facade users joined."
msgstr "[inout] 独占所有者，全部外部接口使用方已退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Success after cleanup (also cold), BUSY if crypto/BIO is executing."
msgstr "清理完成后成功（冷态也成功）；密码/BIO 正在执行时为 BUSY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Return an existing no-borrow byte face; no start or allocation."
msgstr "返回已有、不建立借用的字节接口；不启动或分配。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Copy current owner diagnosis to unretained disjoint output."
msgstr "将当前所有者诊断复制到不保留、互不重叠的输出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Explicit trusted UTC, separate from monotonic operation deadlines."
msgstr "显式可信 UTC，与单调操作截止时间分离。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means trusted Unix seconds. Unknown/untrusted/unavailable time "
"returns an error. Calendar years are 1970..9999 within the selected time_t "
"representation. The product owns authentication and clock policy."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示可信 Unix 秒数。未知、不可信或不可用时间返回错误。日历年份必须处于所选 time_t 表示范围内的 "
"1970..9999。产品负责认证和时钟策略。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "One serialized crypto owner, caller arena and finite entropy source."
msgstr "一个串行化密码所有者、调用方 arena 与有限熵源。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"Arena is max_align_t-aligned and exactly NX_TLS_ARENA_BYTES. All faces and "
"opaque contexts outlive every session. FULL_SOURCE explicitly declares 8 "
"bits/byte to the selected PSA entropy-driver API; software health checks and "
"this enum do not establish physical qualification. The profile disables "
"operating-system entropy and seed fallbacks. Clock advances in one unchanged "
"monotonic domain throughout callbacks."
msgstr ""
"arena 按 max_align_t 对齐，大小恰为 "
"NX_TLS_ARENA_BYTES。全部接口和不透明上下文必须存活至每个会话结束。FULL_SOURCE 向选定的 PSA 熵驱动 API 显式声明 8"
" bits/byte；软件健康检查和此枚举不能建立物理资格。配置禁用操作系统熵与种子回退。时钟必须在回调期间持续推进并保持单一时间域。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Client credentials copied by the backend during initialization."
msgstr "初始化期间由后端复制的客户端凭据。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid ""
"DER only, no implicit files, key discovery or default trust. hostname has "
"hostname_length non-NUL bytes followed by NUL, length 1..253. Mutual-"
"authentication certificate and key are both supplied or absent. TX staging is"
" exactly 512 caller-owned bytes, disjoint from runtime, session, arena and "
"transport state. It stays borrowed until abort. The single serialized "
"executor owns all session and PSA calls."
msgstr ""
"仅 DER；不隐式加载文件、发现密钥或提供默认信任。hostname 包含 hostname_length 个非 NUL 字节，后接 NUL，长度为 "
"1..253。双向认证证书和密钥必须同时提供或同时缺省。TX 暂存区恰为调用方的 512 字节，与运行时、会话、arena "
"和传输状态互不重叠。它继续借用到 abort。单一串行化执行器负责全部会话和 PSA 调用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:369
msgid "Read-only diagnosis; no snapshot grants permission to operate."
msgstr "只读诊断；快照不授予操作许可。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:375
msgid "client.h"
msgstr "client.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Bounded synchronous MQTT 3.1.1 client over explicit streams."
msgstr "基于显式流的有界同步 MQTT 3.1.1 客户端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Product clock shared by all clients and their transports."
msgstr "全部客户端及其传输层共用的产品时钟。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid ""
"Required context-free hook matches upstream's timer API. Never silently "
"change epoch/domain. UINT64_MAX is invalid. No active-instance global "
"registry is used by this adapter."
msgstr "必需的无上下文钩子与上游计时器 API 一致。绝不得静默更换纪元或时间域。UINT64_MAX 无效。此适配器不使用活动实例全局注册表。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Absolute monotonic microseconds in one stable boot/domain"
msgstr "同一稳定启动纪元/时间域内的绝对单调微秒数"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Nonreturning product invariant-failure hook."
msgstr "不返回的产品不变量失败钩子。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Must not reclaim DMA or transport storage on an assertion."
msgstr "不得因断言而回收 DMA 或传输存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Static source location"
msgstr "[in] 静态源码位置"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Source line"
msgstr "[in] 源码行号"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Initialize exact caller storage without opening transport."
msgstr "初始化调用方的准确存储，不打开传输。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid ""
"Task-only, no I/O/heap. All storage and port contexts remain valid and "
"exclusively owned through successful deinit."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，无 I/O 或堆。全部存储与端口上下文必须保持有效、独占，直到 deinit 成功。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[inout] Zero-initialized or deinited metadata"
msgstr "[inout] 已清零或已 deinit 的元数据"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Valid stable ports; values copied, contexts borrowed"
msgstr "[in] 有效稳定端口；复制数值，借用上下文"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[inout] Disjoint network, QoS and control storage"
msgstr "[inout] 互不重叠的网络、QoS 与控制存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, OVERFLOW or EXHAUSTED"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、OVERFLOW 或 EXHAUSTED"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Send clean-session CONNECT and await CONNACK synchronously."
