"Does not connect TCP/TLS. The product provides transport and authentication "
"policy. Failed CONNECT is not replayed."
msgstr "不连接 TCP/TLS。产品提供传输与认证策略。失败 CONNECT 不会被重放。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[inout] Initialized inactive client on a fresh open stream"
msgstr "[inout] 使用全新已打开流、已初始化但未活动的客户端"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Legal MQTT UTF-8 fields, borrowed for this call"
msgstr "[in] 合法 MQTT UTF-8 字段，仅本次调用借用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline and nonzero I/O budget"
msgstr "[in] 有限绝对截止时间及非零 I/O 预算"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "SUCCESS, admission error or sticky session/transport failure"
msgstr "SUCCESS、准入错误或锁存的会话/传输失败"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Publish QoS0/1 with call-scoped topic and payload loans."
msgstr "使用调用期主题与负载借用发布 QoS0/1。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid ""
