#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Call-scoped valid MQTT UTF-8 filter"
msgstr "[in] 调用期合法 MQTT UTF-8 过滤器"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Nonzero bytes, at most UINT16_MAX"
