msgstr "回调视图在返回时失效；需要的数据须在回调内复制。无隐式计时器/任务注册或自动重放。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for incomplete data, or sticky failure"
msgstr "SUCCESS、数据不完整时的 BUSY 或锁存失败"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Send MQTT DISCONNECT without closing the transport."
msgstr "发送 MQTT DISCONNECT，不关闭传输。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "SUCCESS means local admission, not TCP/TLS drain"
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示本地准入，不表示 TCP/TLS 已排空"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "End local borrows after all synchronous calls return."
msgstr "全部同步调用返回后结束本地借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
