msgstr "无 I/O。产品在下一 MQTT 会话之前另行排空/关闭 TCP/TLS；deinit 不能撤回已接受的字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[inout] Inactive initialized client, including failed client"
msgstr "[inout] 未活动的已初始化客户端，包括失败客户端"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for reentry or INVALID"
msgstr "SUCCESS、重入时的 BUSY 或 INVALID"

