msgstr "在同一串行任务上下文检查锁存失败。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "[in] Initialized instance"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "First failure, SUCCESS, or STATE for an inactive instance"
msgstr "首次失败、SUCCESS 或未活动实例的 STATE"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Callback-scoped facts; all pointers expire with callback return."
msgstr "回调期事实；全部指针随回调返回失效。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Explicit finite operation deadline and transport-call allocation."
msgstr "显式有限操作截止时间及传输调用预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Caller-owned ports retained until deinit."
msgstr "借用至 deinit 的调用方端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid ""
"All calls/callbacks use one serialized task context. Event and optional idle "
"callbacks must be bounded and may not reenter this client. Idle may "
"service/wait on lower layers; no worker, lock, scheduler or implicit "
"reconnect is created. Idle SUCCESS/BUSY permit retry; other results fail the "
"session. Event views are not NUL-terminated strings."
msgstr ""
"全部调用和回调使用单一串行任务上下文。事件回调与可选 idle 回调必须有界，不得重入此客户端。idle "
"可在下层推进或等待；不创建工作线程、锁、调度器或隐式重连。idle 返回 SUCCESS/BUSY 允许重试；其他结果使会话失败。事件视图不是 NUL "
"结尾字符串。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Transient CONNECT parameters; this profile always uses clean session."
msgstr "临时 CONNECT 参数；此配置始终使用 clean session。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:377
msgid "Transient publish; QoS1 confirmation is a later PUBACK event."
msgstr "临时发布；QoS1 确认由后续 PUBACK 事件报告。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:381
msgid "TMP117 one-shot sampling contract"
msgstr "TMP117 单次采样合同"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:383
msgid ""
"Select `Nexus::TMP117` for the device protocol and `Nexus::TMP117I2C` for its"
" settled I2C adapter through the firmware target's `LIBRARIES`. These "
"optional CMake targets add no generated device category or competing "
"configuration input. The product supplies an already configured, fixed-"
"address endpoint, a monotonic clock, nonzero clock domain/epoch and the "
"expected existing digital offset. ADD0 wiring, power, bus scheduling and "
"physical recovery remain external. The [I/O ownership "
"architecture](../../design/io-evolution.md) still applies; no sensor worker, "
"heap, address scan or additional owner framework is introduced."
msgstr ""
"在固件目标的 `LIBRARIES` 中选择 `Nexus::TMP117` 器件协议与 `Nexus::TMP117I2C` 已结清 I2C "
"适配器。这些可选 CMake 目标不新增生成式器件类别或另一套配置入口。产品提供已配置的固定地址端点、单调时钟、非零时钟域与 "
"epoch，以及预期的现有数字偏移。ADD0 接线、电源、总线调度和物理恢复由外部负责。[I/O 所有权架构](../../design/io-"
"evolution.md) 继续适用；不引入传感器工作线程、堆、地址扫描或额外的 owner 框架。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:392
msgid ""
"The reviewed device is TI TMP117 with complete identity `0x0117`, using one-"
"shot mode and one conversion with averaging disabled. Initialization checks "
"identity, EEPROM readiness and lock, verifies the existing offset, then "
"requests and reads back shutdown. It preserves unrelated configuration bits. "
"Once shutdown is issued, a failed write or verification retains the same "
"port, configuration and clock as an uncertain uninitialized instance; cleanup"
" uses its own deadline. Earlier failures do not acquire a new binding. "
"`begin` clears stale readiness before requesting one conversion; `poll` reads"
" readiness and then the temperature. Each register read writes the pointer "
"and repeated-START reads two MSB-first bytes. Only the synchronous endpoint "
"transaction is accepted: every return, including errors, releases its "
"descriptors and TX/RX spans. An async-only endpoint cannot be substituted for"
" this settled contract."
msgstr ""
"已审查器件限定为完整标识 `0x0117` 的 TI TMP117，采用单次模式、一次转换并禁用平均。初始化检查标识、EEPROM "
"就绪和锁定状态，核对现有偏移，再请求并读回 shutdown 状态，保留无关配置位。一旦发出 shutdown "
"写入，写入或核验失败即保留相同端口、配置及时钟，将实例标记为未初始化且状态不确定；清理使用独立 deadline。更早的失败不会取得新绑定。`begin`"
" 先清除过期就绪状态再请求一次转换；`poll` 读取就绪状态后再读取温度。每次寄存器读取先写指针，再以重复 START "
"读取两个高字节在前的字节。仅接受同步端点事务：每次返回，包括错误，均结束对描述符和 TX/RX 存储区的使用。不能用仅支持异步的端点替代这一已结清合同。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:405
msgid ""
"A sample is published only on SUCCESS and contains independent numeric "
"values. BUSY and errors leave the complete output unchanged. Signed raw and "
"existing offset values use 1/128 Celsius per LSB. `micro_celsius` rounds to "
"the nearest microdegree, with exact ties away from zero; the full signed "
"format conversion fits `int32_t`. The reviewed output range is -55 to 150 "
"Celsius after the chip's existing offset. POR, saturation and values outside "
"that range return IO. The chip already applies its offset: the driver "
"verifies and reports it without adding it twice, programming calibration or "
"modifying EEPROM."
msgstr ""
"仅 SUCCESS 发布包含独立数值的样本。BUSY 和错误均保持整个输出不变。有符号原始值与现有偏移均以 1/128 摄氏度为一个 "
"LSB。`micro_celsius` 舍入至最近的微摄氏度，恰好位于中点时远离零；完整有符号格式的换算不会超出 "
"`int32_t`。已审查输出范围为芯片应用现有偏移之后的 -55 至 150 摄氏度。POR、饱和及超出该范围的值返回 "
"IO。芯片已经应用偏移：驱动仅核对并报告，不会重复相加、编程校准或修改 EEPROM。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:414
msgid ""
"`observed` reuses `nx_io_timestamp_t` with microsecond rate, explicit domain "
"and epoch, SERVICE_OBSERVATION provenance and unknown physical uncertainty. "
"It is the time of successful register-read completion. The conversion "
"occurred between `conversion_started_at` and `observed.ticks`; neither field "
"is a hardware conversion timestamp. To enforce conservative maximum age, "
"compare the current time against the start bound after validating domain, "
"epoch and rate. A recent register read alone does not prove freshness. Copies"
" outlive device stop without retaining device, transport or sample-buffer "
"references; the consumer must still honor the clock continuity assumptions."
msgstr ""
"`observed` 复用 `nx_io_timestamp_t`，采用微秒速率、显式时钟域与 epoch、SERVICE_OBSERVATION "
"来源，以及未知的物理不确定度。它表示成功读取寄存器的完成时间。转换发生于 `conversion_started_at` 与 "
"`observed.ticks` 之间；两者均非硬件转换时间戳。需要保守限制最大样本年龄时，先校验时钟域、epoch "
"和速率，再将当前时间与转换开始下界比较。最近读取寄存器本身不能证明数据新鲜。样本副本在器件 stop "
"后仍有效，不保留器件、传输或样本缓冲区引用；消费者仍须遵守时钟连续性假设。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:424
msgid ""
"All calls use one serialized task executor and finite absolute deadlines. "
"Poll checks the conversion deadline before and after exchange. A successful "
"not-ready read returns BUSY while retaining conversion metadata. Any "
"transport error, including transport BUSY, terminates sampling and requires "
"explicit resync; a CONFIG read clears readiness, so a subsequent failed "
"temperature read must not be retried as cached zero or as an endless not-"
"ready conversion. A second poll after one successful sample returns STATE. "
"Known overlapping control/output spans are rejected; the caller keeps opaque "
"context and borrowed bus storage disjoint because their extents cannot be "
"inferred by the generic driver."
msgstr ""
"所有调用由一个串行任务执行器执行，并使用有限绝对 deadline。Poll 在交换前后检查转换 deadline。成功读取到未就绪状态时返回 BUSY "
"并保留转换元数据。任何传输错误，包括传输 BUSY，都会结束采样并要求显式重新同步；读取 CONFIG "
"会清除就绪标志，因此随后温度读取失败时，不能将其重试为缓存零值或无限未就绪转换。一次样本成功后再次 poll 返回 "
"STATE。已知控制与输出存储区重叠会被拒绝；由于通用驱动无法推断不透明上下文及借用总线存储的范围，调用者必须保证这些存储不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:434
msgid ""
"`cancel` uses a separate finite cleanup deadline and succeeds only after a "
"shutdown readback. It cannot preempt a synchronous exchange. Failed cleanup "
"retains the binding and external physical-recovery responsibility; a timeout "
"or error never proves physical stop. Retry cancellation or perform external "
"recovery, then explicitly reinitialize a closed instance. Only after calls "
"and outer owner users have joined may `stop` detach the software binding. "
"Stop has no I/O and does not power off the part, release Board resources or "
"erase an unresolved physical-recovery duty. An owner must not enqueue a "
"synchronous stack transaction behind its own executor."
msgstr ""
"`cancel` 使用独立的有限清理 deadline，只有读回 shutdown "
"状态后才成功。它不能抢占正在执行的同步交换。清理失败保留绑定及外部物理恢复责任；timeout "
"或错误从不证明物理停止。应重试取消或执行外部恢复，然后显式重新初始化已经关闭的实例。仅在调用和外层 owner 用户均已 join 后，`stop` "
"才可解除软件绑定。Stop 不执行 I/O，不关闭器件电源，不释放 Board 资源，也不消除尚未解决的物理恢复责任。Owner "
"不能把同步栈事务排到自身执行器之后。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:444
msgid ""
"The protocol follows TI **SNOSD82D**, June 2018 revised September 2022, "
"sections 6.5 and 7.3-7.6 ([official data "
"sheet](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tmp117.pdf)). One-shot conversion "
"takes 13/15.5/17.5 ms minimum/typical/maximum at AVG=00; the caller includes "
"bus and scheduling margin. Power-up readiness requires 1.5 ms and is reported"
" through bus/EEPROM status rather than a hidden sleep. The reviewed Zephyr "
"comparison is `drivers/sensor/ti/tmp11x` at commit "
"`413b789deb391d3a37d06b463288a5fe765ee57e`; no driver source is copied."
msgstr ""
"协议遵循 TI **SNOSD82D**，2018 年 6 月发布、2022 年 9 月修订，第 6.5 和 7.3–7.6 "
"节（[官方数据手册](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tmp117.pdf)）。AVG=00 "
"时单次转换最小、典型、最大耗时分别为 13/15.5/17.5 ms；调用者还需计入总线和调度余量。上电就绪需要 1.5 ms，通过总线及 EEPROM "
"状态报告，不使用隐藏 sleep。审查参考的 Zephyr 实现为提交 "
"`413b789deb391d3a37d06b463288a5fe765ee57e` 的 "
"`drivers/sensor/ti/tmp11x`；未复制驱动源码。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:452
msgid ""
"Software model tests cover signed conversion, rounding, existing offset, "
"readiness, failure cuts, deadlines, cancellation, independent instances and "
"settled generic-owner integration. ARM link probes use the maintained F407 "
"and GD470 empty assemblies with an explicitly unconnected software endpoint. "
"They establish C11 linking and resource cost only. Device accuracy, PCB "
"wiring, I2C waveforms, power-up behavior, real conversion latency and "
"cancellation require physical HIL and remain unexecuted. A station must "
"record the exact device ID, ADD0 address, rail/power-up timing, pull-ups, bus"
" frequency, known temperature reference, offset, clock identity, failure "
"injection and joined shutdown result."
msgstr ""
"软件模型测试覆盖有符号换算、舍入、现有偏移、就绪状态、失败切点、deadline、取消、独立实例及已结清通用 owner 组合。ARM "
"链接探针采用维护中的 F407 与 GD470 空装配，并显式使用未接线的软件端点；仅证明 C11 链接和资源成本。器件精度、PCB 接线、I2C "
"波形、上电行为、真实转换延迟及取消仍需物理 HIL，目前尚未执行。工位必须记录精确器件标识、ADD0 "
"地址、供电与上电时序、上拉、总线频率、已知温度参考、偏移、时钟身份、失败注入及已 join 的停机结果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:464
msgid "tmp117.h"
msgstr "tmp117.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Explicit settled TMP117 one-shot sampling and provenance."
msgstr "显式已结清 TMP117 单次采样与来源信息。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Validate ID 0117h, locked EEPROM, offset and shutdown."
msgstr "校验标识 0117h、EEPROM 锁定、偏移及 shutdown 状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"No scan, reset, sleep, EEPROM write, worker or Board action. Use a separate "
"cleanup deadline to cancel, or retry init on that same binding. A different "
"binding requires joined software stop; external uncertain-state recovery "
"remains the owner's duty. Failed write is not a device reset."
msgstr ""
"不扫描、复位、sleep、写 EEPROM、创建工作线程或执行 Board 动作。使用独立清理 deadline 执行 cancel，或在相同绑定上重试 "
"init。更换绑定需要先 join 并执行软件 stop；外部不确定状态的恢复仍由 owner 负责。写入失败不等同于器件复位。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/stopped or same-binding uncertain storage"
msgstr "[inout] 首次清零、已 stop 或同绑定下状态不确定的存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[in] Copied on success or uncertain shutdown write"
msgstr "[in] 成功时或已调用 shutdown 写入后状态不确定时复制并保留"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[in] Stable explicit facts, not overlapping device"
msgstr "[in] 稳定的显式事实，不得与 device 重叠"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline, shared across accesses"
msgstr "[in] 所有访问共享的有限绝对 deadline"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY for power-up/EEPROM, or exact transport error; unsupported "
"identity, offset mismatch and unlocked EEPROM reject without writes. Pre-"
"write failure keeps no new binding. Once shutdown write is issued, failure "
"retains the same port/config/clock as uncertain and uninitialized."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、上电或 EEPROM 导致的 BUSY，或原始传输错误；不支持的标识、偏移不符及未锁定 EEPROM 均不执行写入即拒绝。调用 "
"shutdown 写入之前失败不保留新绑定。一旦发出 shutdown 写入，失败将保留相同端口、配置及时钟，实例保持未初始化且状态不确定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Begin one fresh conversion with averaging disabled."
msgstr "禁用平均并开始一次新的转换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"Clears stale readiness before OS admission. BUSY retains conversion metadata "
"only, never a stack/caller buffer. Failure after I/O closes sampling until "
"explicit resync."
msgstr "接纳 OS 请求前清除过期就绪状态。BUSY 仅保留转换元数据，从不保留栈或调用者缓冲区。I/O 后失败将关闭采样，直至显式重新同步。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[inout] Initialized nonmeasuring exclusive device"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、未测量的独占器件"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[in] Finite conversion/read deadline in the same clock"
msgstr "[in] 同一时钟中的有限转换与读取 deadline"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, STATE, TIMEOUT or transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、STATE、TIMEOUT 或传输错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Observe readiness and publish one complete fresh sample."
msgstr "观察就绪状态并发布一个完整的新样本。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"Reads CONFIG clear readiness. A later temperature-read failure is terminal "
"and requires resync, never cached zero or endless ready retry. Any transport "
"error, including BUSY, closes sampling until resync; only a successful not-"
"ready read retains the conversion. Repeated poll after success is STATE. "
"Output is disjoint from device, opaque port/clock context storage and "
"borrowed bus storage; only known spans can be checked. POR/saturation and "
"values outside the reviewed range return IO."
msgstr ""
"读取 CONFIG 会清除就绪标志。随后温度读取失败为终止性失败，必须重新同步，不能变为缓存零值或无限就绪重试。任何传输错误，包括 "
"BUSY，均关闭采样直至重新同步；仅成功读取到未就绪状态才保留转换。成功后再次 poll 返回 STATE。输出不得与 "
"device、不透明端口或时钟上下文存储、借用总线存储重叠；只能检查已知范围。POR、饱和及超出已审查范围的值返回 IO。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[inout] Previously begun conversion, same task executor"
msgstr "[inout] 已开始转换的器件，保持同一任务执行器"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[out] Aligned separate output, unchanged on every error"
msgstr "[out] 对齐且独立的输出；每个错误路径均保持不变"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY before ready, STATE or transport/IO"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、未就绪时的 BUSY、STATE 或传输/IO 错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Request and verify shutdown under a separate cleanup budget."
msgstr "使用独立清理预算请求并核验 shutdown 状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"Cannot preempt a synchronous exchange. Cancel failure never proves physical "
"stop; no MCU span survives a port return. Success does not close a bus owner "
"or join its observers."
msgstr "不能抢占同步交换。取消失败从不证明物理停止；端口返回后不存在 MCU 存储借用。成功也不会关闭 bus owner 或 join 其观察者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[inout] Live or uncertain same binding, serialized owner"
msgstr "[inout] 活跃或状态不确定的同一绑定，由串行 owner 使用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[in] Finite cleanup deadline, not an expired sample one"
msgstr "[in] 独立的有限清理 deadline，不复用已过期采样 deadline"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after shutdown observation; other results keep recovery "
"responsibility and may require init resync"
msgstr "仅观察到 shutdown 后返回 SUCCESS；其他结果保留恢复责任，可能需要重新 init 同步"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Drop software binding after calls and outer owners join."
msgstr "调用及外层 owner 均 join 后解除软件绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"No physical I/O. Not power-off, verified cancellation, Board release or "
"erasure of external uncertain-state duty. A caller requiring physical "
"shutdown first completes cancel or external recovery. Callback-time calls do "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"不执行物理 I/O，不等同于断电、核验取消、Board 释放，也不消除外部不确定状态责任。需要物理 shutdown 时，调用者应先完成 cancel "
"或外部恢复。回调期间调用不执行任何动作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "[inout] Quiescent instance with no in-progress call"
msgstr "[inout] 不存在进行中调用的静止实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Synchronous register exchange, settled on every return."
msgstr "每次返回均已结清的同步寄存器交换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"Read writes one register byte then repeated-START reads two bytes; write "
"sends register plus two MSB-first bytes. The serialized task owner keeps "
"context and clock alive through use, uncertain cleanup and joined software "
"stop. Every result releases TX/RX spans, including TIMEOUT/CANCELLED. No "
"asynchronous submit or retained stack span is permitted."
msgstr ""
"读取先写一个寄存器字节，再通过重复 START 读取两个字节；写入发送寄存器及两个高字节在前的字节。串行任务 owner 在使用、不确定状态清理及已 "
"join 的软件 stop 期间保持 context 和 clock 有效。每种结果均释放 TX/RX 存储区，包括 "
"TIMEOUT/CANCELLED。不允许异步 submit 或保留栈存储区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Explicit clock identity and expected existing calibration."
msgstr "显式时钟身份与预期现有校准。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"Nonzero domain/epoch follow nx_io_timestamp_t. The owner changes epoch on "
"discontinuity/reset/rate change. Offset is already applied by the chip; this "
"driver only verifies and reports it, never programs calibration or EEPROM."
msgstr ""
"非零 domain/epoch 遵循 nx_io_timestamp_t。发生不连续、复位或速率变更时，owner 必须变更 "
"epoch。芯片已经应用偏移；本驱动只核对并报告，从不编程校准或 EEPROM。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid "Independent copied sample, published only on SUCCESS."
msgstr "仅 SUCCESS 发布的独立样本副本。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"micro_celsius rounds raw/128 Celsius to nearest microdegree, ties away from "
"zero. raw/offset use 1/128 Celsius per LSB; offset is not added again. "
"Reviewed output is -55..150C. observed is software register-read completion "
"with unknown physical uncertainty, never hardware conversion time. Conversion"
" occurred within [conversion_started_at, observed.ticks] in that same "
"domain/epoch. A consumer can use the lower bound for conservative logical-age"
" checks; recent read completion alone does not establish freshness. All "
"fields are values, with no retained device/payload references. Copies survive"
" stop; clock-domain assumptions still require the caller's "
"continuity/lifetime contract."
msgstr ""
"micro_celsius 将 raw/128 摄氏度舍入至最近微摄氏度，中点远离零。raw/offset 每 LSB 为 1/128 "
"摄氏度，不会再次叠加 offset。已审查输出范围为 -55..150C。observed "
"为软件寄存器读取完成时间，物理不确定度未知，绝非硬件转换时间。转换发生于相同 domain/epoch 的 [conversion_started_at,"
" observed.ticks] 之间。消费者可使用下界执行保守的逻辑年龄检查；最近读取完成本身不能确立新鲜度。所有字段均为值，不保留器件或 "
"payload 引用。副本在 stop 后仍有效；时钟域假设仍依赖调用者的连续性和生命周期合同。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:466
msgid ""
"Task-only single executor, no concurrent/reentrant calls. Uncertain physical "
"state retains the port for explicit cancel/resync; it creates no MCU buffer "
"loan. Fields are implementation state, never permission to reclaim a loan."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务中单一执行器，不允许并发或重入调用。不确定物理状态保留端口以供显式 cancel/resync，不产生 MCU "
"缓冲区借用。字段均为内部状态，不能作为回收借用存储的许可。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:472
msgid "tmp117_i2c.h"
msgstr "tmp117_i2c.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:474
msgid "TMP117 transport over an explicit settled I2C endpoint."
msgstr "基于显式已结清 I2C 端点的 TMP117 传输。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:474
msgid "Bind an existing polling endpoint without I/O or discovery."
msgstr "绑定现有轮询端点，不执行 I/O 或设备发现。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:474
msgid ""
"Actual ADD0 wiring/address 48h..4Bh remains external. An async-only endpoint "
"is rejected. No submit fallback borrows stack descriptors. Exactly one "
"serialized bus executor performs exchanges without nested owner queues."
msgstr ""
"实际 ADD0 接线及地址 48h..4Bh 由外部负责。拒绝仅支持异步的端点；没有借用栈描述符的 submit "
"后备路径。仅一个串行总线执行器执行交换，不嵌套 owner 队列。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:474
msgid "[in] Explicit fixed-address face, alive until stop/join"
msgstr "[in] 显式固定地址接口，保持有效直至 stop/join"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:474
msgid "[in] Same live domain as endpoint transaction deadlines"
msgstr "[in] 与端点事务 deadline 相同的活跃时钟域"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:474
msgid "Settled transport, or an invalid zero port for bad methods"
msgstr "已结清传输；方法无效时返回无效零端口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:480
msgid "bmp280.h"
msgstr "bmp280.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "BMP280 calibration and explicit forced-conversion driver."
msgstr "BMP280 校准与显式强制转换驱动。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Parse the exact 24-byte little-endian calibration block."
msgstr "解析准确的 24 字节小端校准块。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Register block beginning at 0x88"
msgstr "[in] 从 0x88 开始的寄存器块"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Must be exactly 24"
msgstr "[in] 必须恰为 24"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[out] Written only on success"
msgstr "[out] 仅成功时写入"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID for length/zero pressure divisor"
msgstr "SUCCESS；长度错误或压力除数为零时为 INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Compensate one raw sample using checked integer arithmetic."
msgstr "使用经过检查的整数运算补偿一个原始样本。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Parsed calibration"
msgstr "[in] 已解析的校准数据"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Unsigned 20-bit ADC value"
msgstr "[in] 无符号 20 位 ADC 值"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/overflow calibration or IO for disabled ADC "
"sentinel/out-of-datasheet-range physical output"
msgstr "SUCCESS；校准格式错误或溢出时为 INVALID；ADC 禁用哨兵值或物理输出超出数据手册范围时为 IO"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Validate chip ID and load calibration, without scanning."
msgstr "验证芯片 ID 并加载校准，不扫描设备。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid ""
"Task context; failure leaves initialized false and no borrow. Does not soft-"
"reset the part or create a wait loop/task. Retry BUSY explicitly."
msgstr ""
"任务上下文；失败时 initialized 保持 false，且无借用。不软复位器件，也不创建等待循环或任务。BUSY 必须由调用者显式重试。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[out] Zero-initialized unused instance"
msgstr "[out] 零初始化且尚未使用的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Synchronous settled port and live monotonic clock"
msgstr "[in] 调用返回前已结清的同步接口，以及有效的单调时钟"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline for all initialization accesses"
msgstr "[in] 覆盖全部初始化访问的绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for NVM update, or transport/identity error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；NVM 更新期间为 BUSY；也可能返回传输或身份错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Start one forced temperature/pressure conversion."
msgstr "启动一次强制温度／压力转换。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Task-only serialized driver owner; oversampling x1/x1."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的串行驱动所有者；过采样为 x1/x1。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[inout] Initialized non-measuring instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未在测量的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline covering conversion and reads"
msgstr "[in] 覆盖转换与读取的绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, TIMEOUT or transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、TIMEOUT 或传输错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Poll conversion without an implicit worker or blocking delay."
msgstr "轮询转换，不使用隐式执行任务或阻塞延迟。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid ""
"Task-only. Every port call releases temporary buffers before return. BUSY "
"retains device conversion state, never stack or caller buffers. After "
"terminal failure, begin may retry; the external owner chooses policy."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文。每次接口调用在返回前释放临时缓冲。BUSY 保留器件转换状态，不保留栈或调用者缓冲。终止失败后可再次 begin；策略由外部所有者选择。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[inout] Instance with a previously started conversion"
msgstr "[inout] 已启动过转换的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[out] Written only on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] 仅在 SUCCESS 时写入"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY while converting, TIMEOUT or transport error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；转换期间为 BUSY；也可能返回 TIMEOUT 或传输错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Stop software use after all synchronous calls have exited."
msgstr "全部同步调用退出后停止软件使用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid ""
"Does not power off or reset a physical part. Sensor-internal conversion can "
"finish without accessing MCU storage. No MCU borrow remains."
msgstr "不为物理器件断电或复位。传感器内部转换可在不访问 MCU 存储的情况下完成。不再存在 MCU 借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "[inout] Quiesced driver instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已静默的驱动实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Synchronous settled SPI transaction port."
msgstr "同步、已结清的 SPI 事务端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid ""
"exchange always releases every TX/RX buffer before returning, including "
"TIMEOUT/error. One CS interval covers all bytes; mode 0 or 3, 8-bit words, "
"<=10 MHz. Caller serializes this device and its bus owner. Driver stack "
"transactions never cross asynchronous borrowing boundaries."
msgstr ""
"exchange 始终在返回前释放全部 TX/RX 缓冲，包括 TIMEOUT 或错误路径。一个 CS 区间覆盖全部字节；采用模式 0 或 3、8 "
"位字、频率不超过 10 MHz。调用者串行使用该器件及其总线所有者。驱动的栈上事务不会跨越异步借用边界。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Register calibration, owned by one device instance."
msgstr "由一个设备实例拥有的寄存器校准数据。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Output is valid only on successful conversion/compensation."
msgstr "仅成功转换／补偿时输出有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:482
msgid "Explicit device context, no Board pins or automatic sampling task."
msgstr "显式设备上下文，不含 Board 引脚或自动采样任务。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:488
msgid "bmp280_spi.h"
msgstr "bmp280_spi.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:490
msgid "Optional BMP280 adapter over a fixed SPI endpoint."
msgstr "固定 SPI 端点上的可选 BMP280 适配器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:490
msgid "Bind a real polling SPI endpoint as settled transport."
msgstr "绑定真实轮询 SPI 端点作为能结清的传输端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:490
msgid "[in] Fixed endpoint kept alive throughout device use"
msgstr "[in] 在器件使用期间始终保持有效的固定端点"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:490
msgid "[in] Same monotonic domain as IO transfer deadlines"
msgstr "[in] 与 I/O 传输截止时间相同的单调时钟域"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:490
msgid "Narrow transport; no global discovery or CS selection"
msgstr "窄传输接口；不进行全局发现或 CS 选择"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:496
msgid "bus_owner.h"
msgstr "bus_owner.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Explicit bounded multi-producer, single-executor adapter."
msgstr "显式、有界的多生产者、单执行者适配器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Initialize unused owner/slot storage."
msgstr "初始化尚未使用的 owner／slot 存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Startup context; no task, worker, timer or heap is created."
msgstr "启动上下文；不创建任务、工作线程、定时器或堆。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[out] Unused caller-owned adapter storage"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用且由调用者拥有的适配器存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Exact queue capacity, no maximum pool"
msgstr "[in] 精确队列容量，不使用最大容量池"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Number of slots, greater than zero"
msgstr "[in] 槽数量，必须大于零"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Live short exclusion port"
msgstr "[in] 保持有效的短临界区接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Single real execution port"
msgstr "[in] 单个真实执行接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Same monotonic domain as request deadlines"
msgstr "[in] 与请求截止时间相同的单调时钟域"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Optional static executor notification, or NULL"
msgstr "[in] 可选的静态执行者通知，或 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498 docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID"
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Establish the chain's unique admission."
msgstr "建立请求链唯一的准入判定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Task multi-producer context. Free-slot admission and FIFO insertion use "
"constant metadata work under the guard. An exhausted epoch permanently "
"retires its slot. Deadline includes queue residence. Caller must not modify "
"request, operation or buffers after admission. A notification error after "
"admission cannot change SUCCESS to rejection; executor must recheck/pump "
"periodically."
msgstr ""
"任务中的多生产者上下文。空槽准入和 FIFO 入队在保护域内只执行常量规模的元数据操作。epoch "
"耗尽的槽永久退役。截止时间包含排队驻留。准入后调用者不得修改请求、操作或缓冲。准入后的通知错误不能将 SUCCESS "
"改为拒绝；执行者必须定期重新检查并推进。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[inout] Live accepting adapter"
msgstr "[inout] 有效且接受准入的适配器"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[inout] Prepared READY storage, retained until SETTLED"
msgstr "[inout] 已准备为 READY 的存储，持续保留至 SETTLED"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Executor-specific descriptor and payload storage"
msgstr "[in] 特定执行者使用的描述符及载荷存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Optional static caller wake port, or NULL"
msgstr "[in] 可选的静态调用者唤醒接口，或 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[out] Stable cancellation identity, valid on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] 稳定的取消身份，在 SUCCESS 时有效"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection retains zero references"
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝时不保留任何引用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Submit cancellation through stable adapter storage."
msgstr "通过稳定适配器存储提交取消。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Task multi-producer context. No request pointer is accepted. Queued "
"cancellation settles without starting. Active cancellation drains "
"cooperatively; an irreversible operation may already have transferred data."
msgstr "任务中的多生产者上下文。不接受请求指针。排队中的取消在不启动操作的情况下结清。活动操作的取消通过协作排空推进；不可逆操作可能已经传输了数据。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[inout] Live adapter"
msgstr "[inout] 有效的适配器"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[in] Previously accepted slot/epoch"
msgstr "[in] 先前接受的槽及 epoch"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "SUCCESS when marked, STATE for stale/released identity"
msgstr "标记成功时为 SUCCESS；身份过期或已释放时为 STATE"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Advance at most one bounded execution step."
msgstr "至多推进一个有界执行步骤。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Task/explicit loop only. Consumers never service through wait. Keep calling "
"during stop until idle; no callback creates a worker."
msgstr "仅限任务或显式循环。消费者不得通过等待操作执行服务。停止期间持续调用至空闲；回调不会创建工作线程。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "[inout] Live adapter, called by its unique executor"
msgstr "[inout] 有效的适配器，由其唯一执行者调用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"SUCCESS for progress/idle, BUSY for provider wait/contention, or provider "
"error while retaining ownership for continued recovery"
msgstr "取得进展或空闲时为 SUCCESS；等待提供者或存在争用时为 BUSY；也可能返回提供者错误，同时保留所有权以继续恢复"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Close admission and request every accepted operation to stop."
msgstr "关闭准入，并请求每个已接受操作停止。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Task context. Executor must keep servicing/draining while producers "
"wait/join. Stop is not settlement or storage reclamation."
msgstr "任务上下文。生产者等待或汇合期间，执行者必须持续服务并排空。停止不表示已结清，也不表示可以回收存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Test whether execution and completion publication have exited."
msgstr "检查执行及完成发布是否都已退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Join producers and any wake publishers before reclaiming owner, slots, guard "
"or notifications. No future submit/cancel is permitted."
msgstr "回收所有者、槽、保护接口或通知存储前，必须等待生产者和所有唤醒发布者退出。此后不得再次 submit 或 cancel。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "True if no queue/active/service publisher remains"
msgstr "队列、活动操作和服务发布者均不存在时为 true"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Explicit bounded metadata exclusion port."
msgstr "显式、有界元数据排斥端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Task producer calls only. enter/leave must serialize all producers and the "
"executor. Never hold this guard over start/service/cancel, waiting, payload "
"copies or notification callbacks. State restores incoming interrupt mask when"
" an architecture guard is used. Port storage stays live."
msgstr ""
"仅由任务生产者调用。enter/leave 必须串行化全部生产者与执行者。不得在 "
"start/service/cancel、等待、载荷复制或通知回调期间持有该保护。使用架构保护时，状态会恢复进入时的中断屏蔽。接口存储必须保持有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "One real execution owner, injected without OS dependency."
msgstr "真实且唯一的执行所有者，注入时不依赖 OS。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"start SUCCESS borrows operation until service SUCCESS. BUSY or any start "
"error retains zero operation references/hardware effects; an error after "
"partial start must instead accept and report through service. service SUCCESS"
" proves all hardware/IRQ/deferred accesses stopped, writes final "
"result/count, and releases the operation. BUSY still borrows. Other service "
"errors retain ownership and require continued recovery/service. cancel "
"requests drain; it never by itself releases operation. Callbacks run only in "
"the externally scheduled executor, outside adapter metadata guard."
msgstr ""
"start 返回 SUCCESS 后开始借用 operation，直到 service 返回 SUCCESS。BUSY 或任何 start "
"错误都必须不保留 operation 引用／硬件效果；部分启动后发生的错误必须改为接受操作，再通过 service 报告。service 返回 "
"SUCCESS 必须证明全部硬件／IRQ／延后访问已停止，写入最终 result/count，并释放 operation。BUSY 仍保留借用。其他 "
"service 错误保留所有权，并要求继续恢复／service。cancel 请求排空，绝不单独释放 "
"operation。回调只在外部调度的执行者中运行，且必须位于适配器元数据临界区之外。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"terminal_authority selects providers that observe deadlines and latch their "
"first terminal hardware fact themselves. Their final result survives late "
"cancellation/publication. Other executors use adapter deadline/cancellation "
"results. Queued deadlines always belong to the adapter."
msgstr ""
"terminal_authority "
"选择自行观察截止时间并锁存首个终止硬件事实的提供者。其最终结果不会被晚到的取消或发布覆盖。其他执行者使用适配器的截止时间和取消结果。排队请求的截止时间始终由适配器负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Stable control identity; never dereference a stale request pointer."
msgstr "稳定控制身份；绝不解引用过期请求指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid ""
"Exact caller-owned slot, linked in either the free or FIFO chain; initialize "
"only with owner init."
msgstr "调用者拥有的准确槽，连接在空闲链或 FIFO 链中；只能通过 owner init 初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:498
msgid "Explicit adapter state; external application supplies all storage."
msgstr "显式适配器状态；全部存储由外部应用供给。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:504
msgid "clock_domain.h"
msgstr "clock_domain.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Explicit clock consumers and epoch-bound drain control."
msgstr "显式时钟消费者与绑定 epoch 的排空控制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506 docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team   Version  1.0.0   Date  2026-10-11   Copyright  Copyright"
" (c) 2026 Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
"作者  Nexus Team   版本  1.0.0   日期  2026-10-11   版权  Copyright (c) 2026 Nexus "
"Team"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506 docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "2026-10-11"
msgstr "2026-10-11"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Opaque provider, statically supplied by its privileged owner."
msgstr "不透明提供者，由其特权所有者静态供给。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "One stable caller-owned consumer token."
msgstr "一个稳定、调用者拥有的消费者 token。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"Zero-initialize before first acquisition. On SUCCESS the provider borrows "
"this exact object; do not copy, mutate or reclaim it until release succeeds. "
"Internal fields are not application controls. A release is the provider's "
"final access, not proof that a peripheral has stopped. Release only after "
"that consumer's IRQ, DMA and observer drain."
msgstr ""
"首次取得前必须零初始化。SUCCESS "
"后提供者借用该精确对象；释放成功前不得复制、修改或回收。内部字段不是应用控制项。释放是提供者的最终访问，不证明外设已停止。只有该消费者的 IRQ、DMA "
"和观测者均已排空后才释放。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Only shallow sleep preserves the established clock/time domain."
msgstr "仅浅睡眠保持既有时钟／时间域。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Acquire one admitted clock consumer without waiting."
msgstr "无等待地取得一个允许准入的时钟消费者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"Privileged Thread or configurable IRQ only; same CPU, saved-mask metadata "
"guard. NMI/HardFault/SMP excluded. Capacity bounds token/alias scans. Token "
"remains borrowed until successful release, even while admission is closed."
msgstr ""
"仅限特权 Thread 或可配置 IRQ；同一 CPU，以保存并恢复屏蔽状态的保护执行元数据操作。不支持 NMI、HardFault 或 "
"SMP。容量限制令牌和别名扫描。即使准入已关闭，令牌仍持续借用至释放成功。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY for closed admission, EXHAUSTED for budget, or "
"INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT with no retained token or effects"
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；准入关闭时为 BUSY；预算耗尽时为 EXHAUSTED；或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT，此时不保留令牌或效果"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Remove the exact retained token after consumer drain."
msgstr "消费者排空后移除准确保留的 token。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"Same contexts as acquire. Copied tokens cannot release the original. There is"
" no callback or last access after SUCCESS."
msgstr "上下文与 acquire 相同。复制的令牌不能释放原令牌。SUCCESS 后不存在回调或最后一次访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT without removing a borrow"
msgstr "SUCCESS；或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT，此时不移除借用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Close admission and return the current epoch control."
msgstr "关闭准入并返回当前 epoch 控制身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged Thread only. No waiting, cancellation, clock writes or "
"implicit consumer shutdown. Idempotent in the same closed epoch; output must "
"not alias live storage."
msgstr "仅限串行的特权 Thread。不等待、不取消、不写时钟，也不隐式关闭消费者。在同一关闭 epoch 内幂等；输出不得与活动存储重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Validate closed admission and zero retained consumers."
msgstr "验证准入已关闭且保留消费者为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"Same CPU privileged Thread. This certifies only explicitly enrolled "
"consumers. It does not authorize PLL reprogramming, suspend kernel Tick or "
"change the Core deadline domain."
msgstr ""
"同一 CPU 上的特权 Thread。该证明仅涵盖显式登记的消费者。不授权重新配置 PLL、暂停内核 Tick 或改变 Core 截止时间域。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY while consumers remain, STATE for stale/open control, INVALID "
"or CONTEXT; no state changes"
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；消费者仍存在时为 BUSY；控制身份过期或处于开放状态时为 STATE；也可能为 INVALID 或 CONTEXT，均不改变状态"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Reopen a drained domain under a new admission epoch."
msgstr "在新的准入 epoch 下重新开放已排空的时钟域。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged Thread. Does not restart the clock or reinterpret "
"existing deadlines. Actual cold clock changes additionally require all "
"Tick/time providers stopped and a new explicit deadline domain; this API "
"performs neither."
msgstr ""
"串行的特权 Thread。不重启时钟，也不重新解释现有截止时间。真正的冷态时钟变更还要求停止全部 Tick/时间提供者，并显式建立新的截止时间域；本 "
"API 不执行这两项操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE, EXHAUSTED or CONTEXT without changes"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE、EXHAUSTED 或 CONTEXT，不产生变更"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid "Epoch-bound close control and quiescence evidence."
msgstr "绑定 epoch 的关闭控制与静止证据。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:506
msgid ""
"A value copy is allowed. This is not an authorization token or proof about "
"unregistered consumers. Domain storage lives longer than every copy. A "
"successful reopen invalidates all prior controls without resetting the epoch."
msgstr ""
"允许按值复制。该值不是授权令牌，也不能证明未登记消费者的状态。时钟域存储的寿命必须长于每份副本。成功重新开放会使全部旧控制身份失效，但不重置 epoch。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:512
msgid "dp83848.h"
msgstr "dp83848.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Explicit DP83848 identity, reset and observed link mechanism."
msgstr "显式 DP83848 身份、复位与链路观察机制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Read exact supported identity; mismatch never becomes a default PHY."
msgstr "读取准确支持的身份；不匹配时绝不改用默认 PHY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[inout] Explicit MDIO face, address and expected supported model."
msgstr "[inout] 显式的 MDIO 接口、地址及预期支持的型号。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[in] Finite absolute MDIO clock deadline."
msgstr "[in] MDIO 时钟域中的有限绝对截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Success, UNSUPPORTED for identity mismatch, or MDIO error."
msgstr "成功；身份不符时为 UNSUPPORTED；或 MDIO 错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Bounded BMCR soft reset and observed self-clearing acknowledgement."
msgstr "有界 BMCR 软件复位，并观察自清除确认。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid ""
"Task-only finite absolute deadline; reset restraps the device and clears "
"configured truth. This is not a GPIO, power or strap proof."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，使用有限绝对截止时间；复位会重新采样器件 strap，并清除已配置事实。这不证明 GPIO、电源或 strap 正确。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[inout] Proved identity and caller-owned component state."
msgstr "[inout] 已证明的身份及调用者拥有的组件状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Success after real reset acknowledgement, or state/MDIO error."
msgstr "真实复位得到确认后成功；否则返回状态或 MDIO 错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Start explicit negotiation or fixed mode, never wait for fake link."
msgstr "启动显式协商或固定模式，不等待伪造链路。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid ""
"Task-only; identity must be proved. SUCCESS means registers configured, not "
"autonegotiation complete. Failures retain configured=false."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文；必须已证明身份。SUCCESS 表示寄存器已配置，不表示自协商已完成。失败时 configured 保持 false。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[inout] Proved identity, kept live through operations."
msgstr "[inout] 已证明的身份，操作期间持续保持有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[in] Explicit fixed mode or negotiation advertisement."
msgstr "[in] 显式的固定模式或协商通告。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Success means configured registers; otherwise no configured truth."
msgstr "成功表示寄存器已配置；其他结果不建立已配置事实。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Observe latch-low BMSR twice and DP83848 PHYSTS speed/duplex truth."
msgstr "对锁存低电平 BMSR 读取两次，并观察 DP83848 PHYSTS 的真实速率／双工状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid ""
"Task-only; output changes only on SUCCESS. up requires actual link and "
"complete autonegotiation when selected. Protocol or remote fault does not "
"invent speed/link. MAC application remains an external action."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文；只在 SUCCESS 时改变输出。up 要求真实链路有效，且选用自协商时必须完成自协商。协议或远端故障不能虚构速率或链路状态。向 MAC "
"应用该状态仍是外部动作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[inout] Probed and configured caller-owned component."
msgstr "[inout] 已探测并配置、由调用者拥有的组件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "[out] Observed value, separate from component storage."
msgstr "[out] 观察值，必须与组件存储分离。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Success copies observed link; other results preserve output."
msgstr "成功时复制观察到的链路；其他结果保持输出不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "External policy explicitly selects autonegotiation or fixed mode."
msgstr "外部策略显式选择自动协商或固定模式。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid "Caller-owned PHY state; no board address, reset GPIO or worker default."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 PHY 状态；不提供默认板级地址、reset GPIO 或执行任务。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:514
msgid ""
"expected_id selects TI or NS model, ignoring revision nibble only. One task "
"owner serializes this component and the shared MDIO port."
msgstr "expected_id 选择 TI 或 NS 型号，仅忽略修订号的四位字段。由一个任务所有者串行使用该组件及共享 MDIO 接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:520
msgid "file_flash.h"
msgstr "file_flash.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "Native persistent file Flash model with fault injection."
msgstr "支持故障注入的 Native 持久文件 Flash 模型。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid ""
"Author  Nexus Team   Version  1.0.0   Date  2026-10-09  Copyright  Copyright "
