#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "2026-10-09"
msgstr "2026-10-09"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "Open an exclusively locked persistent host Flash model."
msgstr "打开使用独占锁的持久主机 Flash 模型。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid ""
"Task-only POSIX model. Does not qualify MCU Flash or actual power loss; "
"existing file size mismatch is rejected without truncation."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的 POSIX 模型。不为 MCU Flash 或真实掉电建立资格；现有文件大小不匹配时拒绝，不截断文件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[out] Unused caller-owned storage"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用且由调用者拥有的存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[in] Regular-file path; symlink traversal rejected"
msgstr "[in] 普通文件路径；拒绝符号链接遍历"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[in] Exact persistent byte size"
msgstr "[in] 精确的持久字节数"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[in] Uniform erase block bytes"
msgstr "[in] 均匀擦除块的字节数"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[in] Aligned program bytes, 1..256"
msgstr "[in] 对齐的编程字节数，范围 1..256"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "OK or INVALID/IO; failed open retains no file descriptor"
msgstr "OK 或 INVALID/IO；打开失败时不保留文件描述符"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "Close the host file after all store users have quiesced."
msgstr "全部存储使用者静止后关闭主机文件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "No future port calls are permitted until explicit reopen."
msgstr "显式重新打开前不得再次调用接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[inout] Open serialized model"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开且串行使用的模型"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "Set an explicit model interruption boundary."
msgstr "设置显式模型中断边界。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "Zero simulates power-off until explicitly cleared."
msgstr "零表示模拟断电，直到显式清除。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid "[inout] Serialized open model"
msgstr "[inout] 串行使用的已打开模型"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:522
msgid ""
"[in] Programmed/erased bytes and sync attempts permitted; negative disables"
msgstr "[in] 允许编程或擦除的字节数及同步尝试次数；负值表示禁用限制"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:528
msgid "flash_storage.h"
msgstr "flash_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "Explicit physical Flash-region adapter without global registry."
msgstr "显式物理 Flash 区域适配器，不使用全局登记表。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "Bind an explicit writable uniform-erase physical region."
msgstr "绑定显式可写、擦除粒度统一的物理区域。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid ""
"Task-only, serialized caller. No region is reserved by the platform. Mixed "
"sector geometries require another explicit storage adapter; this one rejects "
"them. IO pulse settlement guarantees sync durability; no caller buffer "
"survives a port call. Physical power-loss remains unqualified. The caller "
"must honor geometry.program_flags when using this port directly: ECC units "
"require actual erase provenance, not an all-0xff read. nx_storage_save erases"
" its inactive bank and writes each distinct full program unit at most once "
"before its next erase, including its separate final commit marker. This "
"adapter does not track hidden program-pulse history."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由调用者串行使用。平台不保留任何区域。混合扇区几何需要另一个显式存储适配器，本适配器会拒绝。I/O "
"脉冲结清保证同步持久化；接口调用返回后不保留任何调用者缓冲。物理掉电仍未取得资格。直接使用该接口时，调用者必须遵守 "
"geometry.program_flags：ECC 单元需要真实擦除来源证明，不能凭全 0xff 读取推断。nx_storage_save 擦除非活动 "
"bank，在下次擦除前对每个不同的完整编程单元最多写入一次，包括独立的最终提交标记。本适配器不跟踪隐藏的编程脉冲历史。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "[out] Unused caller storage kept through all store calls"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用的调用者存储，在全部存储调用期间保持有效"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "[in] Externally selected writable physical region"
msgstr "[in] 由外部选定的可写物理区域"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "[in] Absolute whole-transaction deadline for mutations"
msgstr "[in] 覆盖完整修改事务的绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "[out] Narrow synchronous persistent port, valid on SUCCESS"
msgstr "[out] 窄同步持久化接口，在 SUCCESS 时有效"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED geometry error"
msgstr "SUCCESS；或 INVALID/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED 几何错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "Set the next transaction's one absolute mutation deadline."
msgstr "设置下一事务唯一的绝对修改截止时间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid ""
"Caller serializes and sets this before open/save/recovery. Per-pulse timeouts"
" cannot preempt hardware pulses; IO settles before return."
msgstr "调用者必须串行使用，并在 open/save/recovery 前设置该值。逐脉冲超时不能抢占硬件脉冲；I/O 在返回前结清。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "[inout] Bound adapter with no active store operation"
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定且无活动存储操作的适配器"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline in nx_time_now_us domain"
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 域中的绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:530
msgid "Caller-owned adapter, no dynamic binding or global token lookup."
msgstr "调用者拥有的适配器，不使用动态绑定或全局 token 查找。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:536
msgid "log.h"
msgstr "log.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Instance-local synchronous bounded log sink."
msgstr "实例内同步、有界日志接收端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Structured severity, with filtering before touching a sink."
msgstr "结构化严重级别；在访问接收端前完成过滤。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Initialize an unused logger before exposing it to tasks."
msgstr "向任务暴露日志对象之前初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[out] Unused caller storage"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用的调用者存储"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Required bounded synchronous sink"
msgstr "[in] 必需的有界同步输出端"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Minimum accepted severity"
msgstr "[in] 接受的最低严重级别"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Write caller bytes, with no implicit allocation/formatting."
msgstr "写入调用者字节，不进行隐式分配／格式化。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid ""
"Task multi-producer entry with nonblocking serialization. M0/M0+ use CPU-"
"local saved-PRIMASK metadata exclusion and require privileged callers on one "
"CPU. Sink calls run after restoring the incoming mask. This does not make "
"NMI/HardFault or cross-security-domain writers valid. IRQ use is prohibited. "
"Drop/retry policy remains with the external caller."
msgstr ""
"任务中的多生产者入口，使用非阻塞串行化。M0/M0+ 使用 CPU 本地保存并恢复 PRIMASK 的元数据临界区，要求调用者在同一 CPU "
"上具有特权。恢复进入时的屏蔽状态后才调用输出端。这不允许 NMI/HardFault 或跨安全域写入者使用。禁止 IRQ "
"调用。丢弃或重试策略由外部调用者负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[inout] Live instance"
msgstr "[inout] 有效的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Message severity"
msgstr "[in] 消息严重级别"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Message bytes, borrowed only during this call"
msgstr "[in] 消息字节，仅在本次调用期间借用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Byte count; zero permits NULL"
msgstr "[in] 字节数；为零时允许 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline understood by sink"
msgstr "[in] 输出端理解的绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid ""
"SUCCESS for filtered/sent bytes, BUSY for concurrent/recursive writes, STATE "
"after stop, otherwise sink error"
msgstr "被过滤或已发送的字节返回 SUCCESS；并发或递归写入返回 BUSY；停止后为 STATE；其他情况返回输出端错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Flush an explicit sink without creating a background worker."
msgstr "刷新显式接收端，不创建后台执行任务。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Same task/privilege/CPU domain as write."
msgstr "与 write 相同的任务、权限和 CPU 域。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[in] Absolute sink deadline"
msgstr "[in] 输出端的绝对截止时间"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE, UNSUPPORTED or sink error"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE、UNSUPPORTED 或输出端错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Reject new writes and test whether the sink has exited."
msgstr "拒绝新写入并检查接收端是否已退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid ""
"Task context. A stop caller may retry; no active sink call is forcibly "
"cancelled. Join publishers before reclaiming logger/sink storage."
msgstr "任务上下文。停止调用者可以重试；不会强行取消活动的输出端调用。回收日志器或输出端存储前必须等待发布者退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "[inout] Live instance; external users must eventually join"
msgstr "[inout] 有效实例；外部使用者最终必须退出并完成汇合"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "SUCCESS when no sink call is active, BUSY while draining"
msgstr "没有活动的输出端调用时为 SUCCESS；排空期间为 BUSY"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Synchronous caller-injected sink."
msgstr "调用者注入的同步接收端。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid ""
"write/flush release every byte buffer before returning even on timeout/error;"
" asynchronous/DMA sinks require their own settled adapter. Calls are bounded "
"by absolute monotonic deadlines, in task context. No sink discovery, "
"allocation, formatting, worker or global error handler exists."
msgstr ""
"write/flush 即使超时或出错，也在返回前释放每个字节缓冲；异步或 DMA "
"输出端需要自行提供已结清的适配器。调用位于任务上下文，并受绝对单调截止时间约束。不存在输出端发现、分配、格式化、工作线程或全局错误处理器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:538
msgid "Logger storage belongs to its caller; shared immutable port is copied."
msgstr "日志存储属于调用者；共享不可变端口在初始化时复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:544
msgid "modbus_rtu.h"
msgstr "modbus_rtu.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Bounded Modbus RTU core and explicit RS485 ports."
msgstr "有界 Modbus RTU 核心与显式 RS485 端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Compute standard Modbus CRC16 over caller bytes."
msgstr "对调用者字节计算标准 Modbus CRC16。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Input, NULL only when length is zero"
msgstr "[in] 输入，仅长度为零时允许 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Byte count"
msgstr "[in] 字节数"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "CRC16; zero for invalid NULL input with nonzero length"
msgstr "CRC16；非零长度配合无效 NULL 输入时返回零"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Initialize an unused or fully quiesced protocol instance."
msgstr "初始化尚未使用或完全静止的协议实例。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid ""
"Task-only; configuration is copied, contexts stay live. First "
"direction(false) failure is reported; no worker or UART is created. "
"Reinitializing a faulted TX borrow is prohibited; stop/recover it first."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文；配置被复制，各 context 保持有效。报告首次 direction(false) 失败；不创建工作线程或 "
"UART。禁止重新初始化仍持有故障 TX 借用的实例，必须先 stop/recover。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[out] Caller-owned storage, no existing transport borrow"
msgstr "[out] 调用者拥有的存储，不存在先前的传输借用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Explicit register/RS485 ports and finite budgets"
msgstr "[in] 显式的寄存器及 RS485 接口，以及有限预算"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "True when initialized into RX silence acquisition"
msgstr "初始化成功进入 RX 静默判定阶段时为 true"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Feed an externally timestamped UART byte."
msgstr "输入外部添加时间戳的 UART 字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid ""
"Task-only. IRQ queues are external, bounded and explicit; queue overflow must"
" call rx_error. No live UART discovery or ISR callback."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文。IRQ 队列在外部显式提供且容量有界；队列溢出时必须调用 rx_error。不进行活动 UART 发现，也没有 ISR 回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[inout] Initialized instance, serialized by caller"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的实例，由调用者串行使用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Wire byte"
msgstr "[in] 线上字节"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Capture timestamp in port monotonic domain"
msgstr "[in] 接口单调时钟域中的捕获时间戳"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "True if byte joined the frame, false for discard/error"
msgstr "字节并入帧时为 true；丢弃或出错时为 false"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Service RTU silence and bounded synchronous RS485 response."
msgstr "推进 RTU 静默间隔与有界同步 RS485 响应。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid ""
"Task-only, explicit external scheduling. RS485 drain must observe the final "
"stop bit. Failed abort retains TX bytes and asserted DE in LINK_FAULTED; keep"
" instance/port alive until successful recover or stop."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由外部显式调度。RS485 排空必须观察最终停止位。中止失败时，LINK_FAULTED 保留 TX 字节并保持 DE 置位；直到 "
"recover 或 stop 成功前，必须保持实例及接口有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[inout] Initialized instance, single execution owner"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且具有单一执行所有者的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Snapshot in the same monotonic domain"
msgstr "[in] 同一单调时钟域中的快照"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "True for successful progress, false for clock/transport error"
msgstr "取得进展时为 true；时钟或传输错误时为 false"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Discard an errored or overrun receive frame."
msgstr "丢弃发生错误或溢出的接收帧。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Task-only. Does not discard a retained faulted TX borrow."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文。不丢弃仍保留的故障 TX 借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且串行使用的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[in] Error timestamp in port's monotonic domain"
msgstr "[in] 接口单调时钟域中的错误时间戳"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Settle retained TX then restore receive silence acquisition."
msgstr "结清保留的 TX，再恢复接收静默判定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Explicit task maintenance action, no fabricated recovery."
msgstr "显式的任务维护动作，不虚构恢复。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized instance with live ports"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且串行使用的实例，各接口保持有效"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "True only after actual port abort/drain and receive direction"
msgstr "只有实际完成接口中止和排空，并切换到接收方向后才为 true"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "Settle the port before reclaiming protocol storage."
msgstr "回收协议存储之前先使端口结清。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid ""
"Stop future feed/poll users first. No future use except explicit "
"initialization is allowed after successful stop."
msgstr "必须先停止将来可能调用 feed/poll 的使用者。成功停止后，除显式初始化外不得再次使用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid "[inout] Initialized, exclusively owned instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且独占拥有的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:546
msgid ""
"True when no transport borrow remains and instance is stopped; false "
"preserves fault state, TX bytes and all port lifetime obligations"
msgstr "传输借用全部结束且实例已停止时为 true；false 保留故障状态、TX 字节及全部接口生命周期责任"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:552
msgid "owner_observer.h"
msgstr "owner_observer.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Explicit owner progress diagnostics without default state."
msgstr "显式 owner 推进诊断，不含默认状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Bind an initialized exact owner without creating work."
msgstr "绑定已初始化的准确 owner，不创建工作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero/detached sidecar, distinct from owner."
msgstr "[inout] 新的零初始化或已分离附属状态，与所有者分开存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "[inout] Initialized stable owner, no concurrent lifecycle."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的稳定所有者，不存在并发生命周期操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE, no service or borrow on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；拒绝时不执行服务，也不建立借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Execute exactly one real service step and copy diagnostics."
msgstr "准确执行一次真实 service 步骤并复制诊断。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid ""
"Clock reversal never blocks drain or rewrites its result. Snapshot uses the "
"existing guard outside hardware service. No callback, slot scan or worker "
"occurs under that guard. Quarantine and elapsed deadlines never release a "
"loan. Output also excludes accepted descriptors and payloads. Only the "
"owner/slot control spans are checked here."
msgstr ""
"时钟倒退不会阻止排空或重写结果。快照在硬件服务之外使用现有保护。该保护内不执行回调、槽扫描或工作线程。隔离状态和已到期截止时间都不会释放借用。输出还必须避开已接受的描述符及载荷。这里只检查所有者和槽控制对象的存储区间。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "[inout] Bound sidecar on the unique executor."
msgstr "[inout] 由唯一执行者使用的已绑定附属状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "[in] Monotonic timestamp, independent of service result."
msgstr "[in] 单调时间戳，与服务结果独立。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "[out] Distinct stable output, no retained references."
msgstr "[out] 独立且稳定的输出，不保留引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Actual service result; invalid bindings reject beforehand."
msgstr "实际服务结果；无效绑定在执行前拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Drop only the observation binding, no owner/loan teardown."
msgstr "仅撤销观察绑定，不拆除 owner 或借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "[inout] Caller-serialized sidecar, no remaining readers."
msgstr "[inout] 由调用者串行使用的附属状态，不再存在读取者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Copied service facts without request, payload or slot references."
msgstr "已复制的 service 事实，不含 request、payload 或 slot 引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid "Opt-in caller sidecar; no pointer added to default owner."
msgstr "调用者显式选择的附加状态；不向默认 owner 增加指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:554
msgid ""
"Exact owner, slots and guard remain live until detach and all observer calls "
"exit. The same unique owner executor calls this wrapper; producer calls "
"retain the owner guard. Never reinitialize/replace the bound owner underneath"
" it."
msgstr ""
"精确的所有者、槽和保护接口必须保持有效，直到分离完成且全部观测者调用退出。同一唯一所有者执行者调用该包装接口；生产者调用继续使用所有者保护。不得在绑定期间重新初始化或替换底层所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:560
msgid "settings.h"
msgstr "settings.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Bounded key/value staging over durable whole-blob storage."
msgstr "在持久化整块存储上提供有界 key/value 暂存。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Load one exact schema or stage an empty, uncommitted image."
msgstr "加载精确 schema，或暂存空的未提交镜像。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Synchronous task-only scan. Missing blob stages an empty image, without "
"reading defaults or writing Flash. Different schema/format is UNSUPPORTED and"
" never rewritten. Truncated, duplicate or unordered keys are CORRUPT. A "
"failed load never becomes an empty writable store; the instance stays closed."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文同步扫描。缺少 blob 时暂存空镜像，不读取默认值或写 Flash。不同 schema/format 返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED，绝不重写。截断、重复或无序 key 返回 CORRUPT。加载失败不能变成空的可写存储；实例保持关闭。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[out] Unused or closed instance, exclusively owned"
msgstr "[out] 未使用或已关闭的独占实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"[inout] Open durable store; no other mutating client while this settings "
"instance is open"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开的持久化存储；Settings 打开期间不得有其他变更性客户端"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[in] Product-defined schema identity, including zero"
msgstr "[in] 产品定义的 schema 身份，允许零"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"[inout] Caller buffer, disjoint from both instances and the storage "
"workspace; borrowed until close or a failed commit"
msgstr "[inout] 调用者 buffer，与两个实例及 storage workspace 独立；借用至 close 或失败的 commit"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[in] At least HEADER_SIZE and at most UINT32_MAX"
msgstr "[in] 至少 HEADER_SIZE，至多 UINT32_MAX"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[in] Nonzero upper bound on staged entries"
msgstr "[in] 暂存条目数量的非零上限"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "OK, INVALID, NO_SPACE, CORRUPT, UNSUPPORTED or port error"
msgstr "OK、INVALID、NO_SPACE、CORRUPT、UNSUPPORTED 或 port 错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Copy a staged value without exposing internal storage."
msgstr "复制暂存值，不暴露内部存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous copy; no pointer is retained. Missing key reports size "
"zero. NO_SPACE leaves output untouched and reports required bytes. No "
"underlying Flash operation occurs."
msgstr "仅任务上下文同步复制，不保留指针。缺 key 时报告长度零。NO_SPACE 保持输出不变并报告所需字节数。不执行底层 Flash 操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[in] Open instance, serialized with all mutation"
msgstr "[in] 已打开实例，与全部变更操作串行化"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[in] Exact product-assigned identifier"
msgstr "[in] 精确的产品分配标识"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[out] Disjoint destination, or NULL to query size only"
msgstr "[out] 独立目标，或以 NULL 只查询长度"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"[inout] Capacity on input, required/value bytes on output; disjoint from "
"metadata, staging image and output"
msgstr "[inout] 输入为容量，输出为所需或实际值字节数；与元数据、暂存镜像及 output 独立"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "OK, NOT_FOUND, NO_SPACE or INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NOT_FOUND、NO_SPACE 或 INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Insert or replace one copied value in bounded RAM staging."
msgstr "在有界 RAM 暂存中插入或替换复制的值。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Task-only, bounded by image capacity and entry limit. Failed admission "
"changes neither entries nor dirty state. A changed value marks staging dirty "
"without touching Flash; an identical value preserves both image and the "
"previous dirty state."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文，由镜像容量和条目上限约束。准入失败不改变条目或 dirty 状态。值变化使暂存变脏，不写 Flash；值相同时保留镜像和原 dirty "
"状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562 docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[inout] Open exclusively owned instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开且独占拥有的实例"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"[in] Input disjoint from instance and staging image; NULL only for an empty "
"value, borrowed during this call"
msgstr "[in] 输入与实例及暂存镜像独立；仅空值允许 NULL，调用期间借用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[in] Value byte count, at most UINT32_MAX"
msgstr "[in] 值字节数，至多 UINT32_MAX"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "OK, NO_SPACE or INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NO_SPACE 或 INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Remove a staged key without writing Flash."
msgstr "移除暂存 key，不写 Flash。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous operation. Missing keys have no effects. Success "
"compacts staging and marks it dirty."
msgstr "仅任务上下文同步操作。缺 key 时无影响。成功时压紧暂存并标记 dirty。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "OK, NOT_FOUND or INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NOT_FOUND 或 INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Commit the complete staged snapshot through durable Storage."
msgstr "通过持久化 Storage 提交完整暂存快照。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Task-only settled call; underlying Flash may stall execution. Clean staging "
"does not write. Successful save clears dirty. A mutating I/O failure closes "
"the instance and preserves the dirty flag for diagnosis, but retains no "
"staging borrow. Reopen Storage, then Settings to determine the surviving "
"commit; failure may occur after a new marker became durable. Retrying a "
"failed commit without recovery is rejected."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文同步完成调用；底层 Flash 可能暂停执行。干净暂存不写入，保存成功清除 dirty。变更性 I/O 失败会关闭实例并保留 dirty "
"供诊断，不再借用暂存。先重新打开 Storage，再打开 Settings 以确定保留的提交；失败可能发生在新 marker "
"已持久化之后。不恢复就重试失败 commit 会被拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "OK or underlying storage error"
msgstr "OK 或底层 storage 错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Release settings metadata without committing staged values."
msgstr "释放 Settings 元数据，不提交暂存值。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Task-only, serialized after all calls. No I/O or retained references remain. "
"Underlying Storage stays open; its scratch lifetime remains governed by the "
"Storage contract."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文，在全部调用之后串行化。不执行 I/O，也无保留引用。底层 Storage 保持打开；其 scratch 生命周期仍由 Storage "
"合同决定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "[inout] Quiesced instance, or NULL"
msgstr "[inout] 已静默的实例，或 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid "Caller-owned settings metadata and bounded staging image."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 Settings 元数据与有界暂存镜像。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:562
msgid ""
"Task-only; serialize all operations and the underlying storage. No heap, "
"workers or global key registry. Keys are product-assigned uint32 identifiers;"
" values are byte strings, including empty strings. The format is little-"
"endian, not authenticated. Products own defaults, schema migration, "
"authorization, durability frequency and Flash reservations. Only commit "
"writes storage; close discards staged changes."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文；全部操作及底层存储须串行化。无 heap、worker 或全局 key 注册表。Key 为产品分配的 uint32 "
"标识，值为字节串，允许空串。格式为 little-endian，不提供认证。产品拥有默认值、schema 迁移、授权、持久化频率和 Flash 预留。只有"
" commit 写存储；close 丢弃暂存变更。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:568
msgid "spi_async_owner.h"
msgstr "spi_async_owner.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid "Optional finite async SPI executor for one explicit bus."
msgstr "一个显式总线的可选有限异步 SPI 执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid "Bind one async-capable bus to an explicit owner executor."
msgstr "将具备异步能力的总线绑定到显式 owner 执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid ""
"Startup/task context. Operations use nx_spi_owner_operation_t endpoints on "
"this bus only; membership is checked before admission. No polling fallback is"
" selected. Controller and executor remain live through drain, control "
"acknowledgement and observer exit. QUARANTINED retains both buffer loans. "
"Hardware stop and IRQ/notification destruction are explicit external steps "
"after owner shutdown, not part of this bind."
msgstr ""
"启动或任务上下文。操作仅使用本总线上的 nx_spi_owner_operation_t "
"端点；准入前检查成员关系。不选择轮询回退。控制器和执行者必须保持有效，直到排空、控制确认及观测者退出全部完成。QUARANTINED "
"保留两项缓冲借用。所有者关闭后，硬件停止及 IRQ/通知销毁仍是外部显式步骤，不属于此次绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid "[out] Fresh storage with no previous outstanding loans."
msgstr "[out] 新存储，不存在先前尚未结束的借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid ""
"[in] Initialized controller exclusively owned by this executor; direct "
"clients and other owners must quiesce."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且由该执行者独占拥有的控制器；直接客户端和其他所有者必须静默。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid "Valid executor port, or a zero port for incomplete methods."
msgstr "有效的执行接口；方法不完整时返回全零接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid "Exact async storage independent of the polling adapter."
msgstr "独立于轮询适配器的准确异步存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:570
msgid ""
"inner is a private publication object. Its borrow must end before the outer "
"owner publishes SETTLED. No queue, payload copy, allocation or hidden worker "
"is created."
msgstr "inner 是私有发布对象。外层所有者发布 SETTLED 前，必须先结束其借用。不创建队列、不复制载荷，也不分配或创建隐藏工作线程。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:576
msgid "spi_owner.h"
msgstr "spi_owner.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "Explicit polling SPI executor for the bounded owner adapter."
msgstr "有界 owner 适配器的显式轮询 SPI 执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "Bind an explicit synchronous SPI execution adapter."
msgstr "绑定显式同步 SPI 执行适配器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid ""
"start executes a real CPU-active polling transaction and releases all IO "
"buffers before returning. Owner service later publishes its caller-owned "
"request. Polling cannot be preempted by another task's cancel; once the "
"polling call returns, its result is final despite later cancellation or "
"publication delay. Do not claim IRQ/DMA mode or low-CPU asynchronous hardware"
" execution. Endpoints must prove their controller identity before any wire "
"effect; distinct chip selects on this controller remain valid. The controller"
" and executor outlive owner shutdown and all observers."
msgstr ""
"start 执行真实的 CPU 主动轮询事务，并在返回前释放全部 I/O 缓冲。所有者的 service 随后才发布调用者拥有的请求。另一任务的 "
"cancel 不能抢占轮询；轮询调用返回后，即使取消或发布延迟随后到来，其结果仍为最终结果。不得宣称 IRQ/DMA 模式或低 CPU "
"占用的异步硬件执行。产生任何线上效果前，端点必须证明其控制器身份；同一控制器上的不同片选仍然有效。控制器和执行者的寿命必须覆盖所有者关闭及全部观测者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "[out] Fresh storage with no outstanding operation"
msgstr "[out] 新存储，不存在尚未结束的操作"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "[in] Controller exclusively serviced by this owner"
msgstr "[in] 仅由该所有者服务的控制器"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "Port for nx_bus_owner_init, or a zero port for invalid input"
msgstr "供 nx_bus_owner_init 使用的接口；输入无效时为全零接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "Caller-owned SPI transaction descriptor, borrowed until SETTLED."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 SPI 事务描述符，借用保持到 SETTLED。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:578
msgid "Exact polling executor storage; no payload copy or queue."
msgstr "准确轮询执行者存储，不复制载荷或设置队列。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:586
msgid "storage.h"
msgstr "storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Two-bank durable blob storage over an explicit narrow port."
msgstr "使用显式窄端口的双 bank 持久 blob 存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Storage errors expose retry/reopen/recovery decisions."
msgstr "存储错误显式暴露重试／重开／恢复决策。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Open/recover two externally supplied uniform erase banks."
msgstr "打开／恢复两个外部供给、擦除粒度统一的 bank。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid ""
"Task-only bounded scan over both bank payloads. Workspace remains borrowed by"
" the instance through every subsequent load/save call."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，对两个 bank 的载荷执行有界扫描。工作区由实例持续借用，覆盖此后每次 load/save 调用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[out] Unused or quiesced instance, no concurrent calls"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用或已静默的实例，不存在并发调用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Persistent settled port, may be storage's existing port"
msgstr "[in] 返回前已结清的持久化接口，可以是存储对象原有的接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Erase-aligned start within port region"
msgstr "[in] 接口区域内按擦除粒度对齐的起点"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Each bank's erase-aligned byte size"
msgstr "[in] 每个 bank 按擦除粒度对齐的字节数"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Caller buffer, disjoint from instance/payload"
msgstr "[in] 调用者缓冲，与实例及载荷不重叠"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] At least max(32, port.program_size)"
msgstr "[in] 至少为 max(32, port.program_size)"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid ""
"OK for recovered/empty store, CORRUPT for ambiguous or only invalid committed"
" generations, IO/INVALID for port/geometry failures"
msgstr "恢复成功或存储为空时为 OK；代次有歧义，或仅存在无效的已提交代次时为 CORRUPT；接口或几何错误时为 IO/INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Load and validate the latest committed whole blob."
msgstr "加载并验证最新提交的完整 blob。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid ""
"Output bytes valid only on OK; failure may partially write output. No "
"destination pointer is retained after returning."
msgstr "只有 OK 时输出字节才有效；失败时可能已部分写入输出。返回后不保留目标指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[inout] Open instance, exclusively owned for this call"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开的实例，本次调用期间独占拥有"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[out] Destination; NULL requests only required size"
msgstr "[out] 目标；NULL 表示只查询所需大小"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[inout] Input capacity, output payload/required bytes"
msgstr "[inout] 输入为容量，输出为载荷字节数或所需字节数"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "OK, NOT_FOUND, NO_SPACE, CORRUPT or IO/INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NOT_FOUND、NO_SPACE、CORRUPT 或 IO/INVALID"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Commit a complete blob to the inactive bank."
msgstr "将完整 blob 提交到非活动 bank。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid ""
"Marker is programmed last after sync. Failed mutation keeps the previous bank"
" and requires reopen; ambiguous marker failure can mean the new blob "
"committed. Product owns migration/authentication/recovery policy."
msgstr ""
"同步后最后编程提交标记。修改失败时保留先前的 bank，并要求重新打开；标记失败有歧义时，新 blob 可能已经提交。迁移、认证及恢复策略由产品负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Payload disjoint from workspace, borrowed during call"
msgstr "[in] 与工作区不重叠的载荷，仅调用期间借用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Payload bytes; zero permits NULL"
msgstr "[in] 载荷字节数；为零时允许 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "OK, NO_SPACE, INVALID or underlying port error"
msgstr "OK、NO_SPACE、INVALID 或底层接口错误"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Query usable blob capacity without touching hardware."
msgstr "查询可用 blob 容量，不访问硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "[in] Geometry-established instance, or NULL"
msgstr "[in] 已建立几何信息的实例，或 NULL"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Payload bytes per bank, or zero for invalid geometry"
msgstr "每个 bank 的载荷字节数；几何无效时为零"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Synchronous settled persistent Flash port."
msgstr "同步且已结清的持久 Flash 端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid ""
"Task-only; caller serializes every operation. Offsets are byte-relative to "
"the supplied region. program changes only 1 to 0 in complete aligned program "
"units; erase uses complete uniform erase units. sync makes earlier successful"
" writes durable. Errors can change a subset of addressed units, but never "
"retain caller buffers after returning. RAM is a model, not a persistent "
"implementation. Product owns the region/layout and power policy."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文；调用者串行使用全部操作。偏移以所提供区域的起点为基准，单位为字节。program 只在完整且对齐的编程单元内将 1 改为 0；erase "
"使用完整且均匀的擦除单元。sync 使先前成功的写入持久化。错误可能改变所寻址单元的一部分，但返回后绝不保留调用者缓冲。RAM "
"是模型，不是持久化实现。区域、布局及电源策略由产品负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid "Instance metadata with caller-sized workspace."
msgstr "实例元数据与调用者确定容量的工作区。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:588
msgid ""
"Two independently erasable banks commit whole blobs. No heap, global "
"registry, maximum pool or default product reservation. Wire format v1 is "
"explicit little-endian and CRC-protected, not authenticated. Keep instance, "
"port context and workspace alive through close/quiescence. A mutating I/O "
"error invalidates opened; reopen to establish which commit actually survived."
msgstr ""
"两个可独立擦除的 bank 提交完整 blob。不使用堆、全局注册表、最大容量池或默认产品预留。线上格式 v1 显式采用小端和 CRC "
"保护，不提供认证。实例、接口 context 和工作区必须保持有效，直到关闭并静默。修改性 I/O 错误会使 opened "
"失效；需要重新打开，才能确定哪个提交实际保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:594
msgid "uart_owner.h"
msgstr "uart_owner.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "Explicit IRQ UART executor with private provider settlement."
msgstr "显式 IRQ UART 执行者与私有提供者请求结清。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "Bind a UART controller to one explicit service executor."
msgstr "将 UART 控制器绑定到一个显式 service 执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid ""
"Startup/task context. Controller and executor remain alive through owner "
"stop/drain and external observer quiescence. Direct UART users must not share"
" this controller. Queued time belongs to the bus owner; after start the "
"UART's first terminal TC/error/cancel/deadline fact is authoritative. cancel "
"observes provider completion/deadline before asking it to abort. Failed drain"
" keeps both requests QUARANTINED; service must continue during recovery. "
"Outer SETTLED never precedes inner acquire-observed SETTLED and pointer "
"detach. The application separately stops hardware and RX consumers only after"
" all owner operations and controls quiesce."
msgstr ""
"启动或任务上下文。控制器和执行者保持有效，直到所有者停止、排空及外部观测者静默。直接 UART "
"使用者不得共享该控制器。排队时间由总线所有者负责；启动后，以 UART 首次观察到的终止 TC、错误、取消或截止时间事实为准。cancel "
"先观察提供者完成或截止时间，再请求中止。排空失败时，两个请求均保持 QUARANTINED；恢复期间必须持续 service。外层 SETTLED "
"绝不能早于以 acquire 语义观察到的内层 SETTLED 及指针分离。只有全部所有者操作和控制均静默后，应用才分别停止硬件及 RX 消费者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "[inout] Unused caller-owned storage, no concurrent calls"
msgstr "[inout] 尚未使用且由调用者拥有的存储，不存在并发调用"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "[inout] Initialized UART exclusively owned by this executor"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且由该执行者独占拥有的 UART"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "Port for nx_bus_owner_init, or an invalid zero port for NULL"
msgstr "供 nx_bus_owner_init 使用的接口；NULL 输入时为无效的全零接口"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "Caller-owned TX payload descriptor borrowed until outer SETTLED."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 TX 载荷描述符，借用保持到外层 SETTLED。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid "One executor's exact private provider request."
msgstr "一个执行者准确且私有的提供者请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:596
msgid ""
"inner is a separate publication object, not another outer queue or caller "
"admission. Only this executor accesses it; producers retain their outer "
"request and payload until the bus owner publishes outer SETTLED. No buffer "
"copy, heap, worker or pool. Never pass inner to application observers."
msgstr ""
"inner 是独立的发布对象，不是另一个外层队列或调用者准入。只有该执行者访问 inner；总线所有者发布外层 SETTLED "
"前，生产者持续保留外层请求及载荷。不复制缓冲，不使用堆、工作线程或池。绝不将 inner 交给应用观测者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:602
msgid "usb_acm.h"
msgstr "usb_acm.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Optional caller-owned CDC ACM control subset."
msgstr "由调用者拥有存储的可选 CDC ACM 控制子集。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Bind one explicit communication interface and initial state."
msgstr "绑定一个显式通信接口及初始状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"Same privileged unmasked serialized task as USBControl; no ISR, callback or "
"second-task reentry. The external dispatcher gives this adapter exclusive EP0"
" use while active. Interface descriptors, class capabilities and "
"configuration readiness are external; initialization does not validate class "
"bytes."
msgstr ""
"与 USBControl 使用同一个串行执行的特权 Task，进入时 IRQ 未屏蔽；不允许 ISR、callback 或第二个 Task "
"重入。外部分派器在适配器活动期间将 EP0 使用权独占交给它。接口描述符、类能力和配置就绪状态由外部负责；初始化不校验类描述符字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[inout] Naturally aligned zero-initialized caller storage."
msgstr "[inout] 自然对齐、零初始化的调用者存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"[in] Immutable selected USB profile with a guarded SETUP rejection port, "
"disjoint from acm."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的选定 USB profile，包含按 epoch 防护的 SETUP 拒绝端口，且不与 acm 重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Exact externally described ACM interface."
msgstr "[in] 与外部描述准确对应的 ACM 接口。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Disjoint naturally aligned initial software intent."
msgstr "[in] 不重叠、自然对齐的初始软件意图。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or CONTEXT; no hardware is started."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 CONTEXT；不启动硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Dispatch the current software-published SETUP to the subset."
msgstr "将当前已由软件发布的 SETUP 分派到此子集。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"Exact class/interface direction, wIndex, wValue and wLength are checked. "
"GET_LINE_CODING returns seven committed bytes. SET_LINE_CODING receives "
"exactly seven bytes but waits for explicit approval. Control-line/break "
"requests wait before starting STATUS. Invalid/unknown dispatch deliberately "
"has the documented STALL effect, but retains no new loan. Route "
"standard/other-class requests externally before calling."
msgstr ""
"严格校验 class/interface 的方向、wIndex、wValue 和 wLength。GET_LINE_CODING "
"返回七个已提交的字节。SET_LINE_CODING 接收恰好七字节，但等待显式审批。control-line/break 请求等待审批后才启动 "
"STATUS。非法或未知请求的分派按合同显式执行 STALL，但不新增借用。调用前须由外部先路由标准请求及其他类请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[inout] Bound inactive adapter; no other EP0 packet user."
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定且非活动的适配器；没有其他 EP0 packet 使用者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Exact nonzero published SETUP identity."
msgstr "[in] 准确的、非零的已发布 SETUP 身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"[in] One independent absolute deadline for all stages and external approval; "
"NEVER permits an indefinite wait."
msgstr "[in] 所有阶段及外部审批共用一个独立的绝对 deadline；NEVER 允许无限等待。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"SUCCESS accepts the operation; BUSY/STATE/TIMEOUT reject without a new loan. "
"Unknown requests return UNSUPPORTED and malformed fields INVALID after "
"guarded STALL succeeds; otherwise the guarded rejection error is returned."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示接受操作；BUSY/STATE/TIMEOUT 表示拒绝且不新增借用。按 epoch 防护的 STALL 成功后，未知请求返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED，字段格式错误返回 INVALID；否则返回防护拒绝操作的实际错误。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Advance USBControl once and fold only acquired completion."
msgstr "推进 USBControl 一步，仅归并已 acquire 观察到的完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"At most one underlying USBControl step, with its one service, one state read "
"and one packet action bounds. No loop drains a transaction. Continue after "
"cancel/supersession/timeouts. OUT0 quarantine still needs explicit external "
"device-owner stop, then further steps. Never auto-stop the controller. Only "
"approved outer acquire SUCCESS commits intent: it proves the matching STATUS "
"packet's real ACK. A later SETUP/reset, closing or failed state read cannot "
"revoke an ACK already acquired by the packetizer. Supersession before ACK "
"aborts and drains without commit. Resetting class state after a completed "
"command is separate external owner policy. Software epoch checks do not "
"promise atomicity with uncollected physical SETUP packets."
msgstr ""
"最多推进一次底层 USBControl，遵守其一次 service、一次 state 读取及一次 packet "
"动作的上限。不在循环中排空整笔事务。取消、替换或超时后仍须继续推进。OUT0 隔离仍需外部 device owner 显式 stop，然后继续 "
"step。不得自动停止 controller。只有已批准的 outer 经 acquire 观察到 SUCCESS 才提交意图：它证明对应 STATUS "
"包已获真实 ACK。后来的 SETUP/reset、closing 或 state 读取失败不能撤销 packetizer 已 acquire 观察到的 "
"ACK。ACK 前的替换会中止并排空，不提交。命令完成后重置类状态属于外部 owner 的独立策略。软件 epoch 检查不保证与尚未由 IRQ "
"采集的物理 SETUP 包原子同步。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[inout] Same executor; keep all storage while active."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者；活动期间保留全部存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Progress/provider result; an error never revokes a loan."
msgstr "推进／provider 结果；错误绝不撤销借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Copy staged intent for external validation/authorization."
msgstr "复制暂存的意图，供外部校验及授权。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"Wire format allows nonzero rate, stop bits 0..2, parity 0..4 and data bits "
"5/6/7/8/16. External hardware/policy may support fewer values. This value may"
" become stale; approve rechecks the software epoch. Inspecting is not "
"approval."
msgstr ""
"线上格式允许非零 rate、stop bits 为 0..2、parity 为 0..4，以及 data bits 为 "
"5/6/7/8/16。外部硬件或策略可只支持其中一部分值。该值可能已过时；approve 会重新核对软件 epoch。检查不等于批准。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Same task; SET_LINE_CODING must be DATA_READY."
msgstr "[in] 同一 Task；SET_LINE_CODING 必须处于 DATA_READY。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"[out] Disjoint naturally aligned value output; unchanged on rejection. No "
"pointer into the borrowed payload escapes."
msgstr "[out] 不重叠、自然对齐的值输出；拒绝时保持不变。不向外提供指向被借用 payload 的指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, STATE, INVALID or CONTEXT. INVALID on a malformed or short line-"
"coding DATA stage; owner can reject explicitly."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、STATE、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。线编码 DATA 阶段格式错误或短于要求时返回 INVALID；owner 可显式拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Authorize staged intent before STATUS, or reject this epoch."
msgstr "在 STATUS 前授权暂存意图，或拒绝此 epoch。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"Approval must not apply UART/physical lines. After a newer committed_epoch "
"appears, the external owner applies the copied intent and owns application "
"failures/recovery. No callback runs here. SEND_BREAK records 0 (stop), 0xffff"
" (indefinite), or a finite millisecond intent, without timer, automatic "
"expiry or assertion that physical break occurred."
msgstr ""
"审批不得应用 UART 参数或物理线路。出现更新的 committed_epoch 后，由外部 owner "
"应用复制出的意图，并负责应用失败及恢复。此处不运行 callback。SEND_BREAK 记录 "
"0（停止）、0xffff（无限期）或有限毫秒时长的意图，不创建计时器、不自动到期，也不声称物理 break 已发生。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[inout] Same active adapter and serialized task executor."
msgstr "[inout] 同一个活动适配器及串行 Task 执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Exact operation identity."
msgstr "[in] 准确的操作身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] True authorizes only; false requests guarded STALL."
msgstr "[in] true 仅授权；false 请求按 epoch 防护的 STALL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"SUCCESS changes authorization; other results retain live loans and do not "
"authorize a change. Malformed line coding cannot be approved; false is still "
"allowed at DATA_READY."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 改变授权；其他结果保留活动借用且不授权变更。格式错误的线编码不能获批；在 DATA_READY 仍允许传入 false 拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Cancel one active identity, preserving all admitted storage."
msgstr "取消一个活动身份，保留全部已准入存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[inout] Same executor, retained through actual drain."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者，保留至实际排空。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Exact active identity."
msgstr "[in] 准确的活动身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"SUCCESS requests drain or discards unadmitted zero-data intent; STATE for "
"stale identity. Cancellation only requests drain. A matching STATUS ACK "
"acquired before or during cancellation still wins at the packetizer; step "
"commits the approved original epoch on acquire outer SUCCESS without later "
"epoch revocation."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 请求排空，或丢弃尚未准入的零数据意图；身份过期返回 STATE。取消仅请求排空。在取消前或取消期间 acquire 到的匹配 STATUS"
" ACK 仍由 packetizer 优先处理；step 在 acquire 返回 outer SUCCESS 时提交已批准的原 epoch 意图，后续 "
"epoch 不撤销该提交。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Copy current software intent and the last observed outcome."
msgstr "复制当前软件意图及最近观察到的结果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"A committed_epoch update is a software notification, not an event queue or "
"physical apply acknowledgement. Poll after each step before dispatching the "
"next operation if every committed change must be consumed. GET never changes "
"it."
msgstr ""
"committed_epoch 的更新是软件通知，不是事件队列或物理应用确认。若必须消费每次已提交的变更，应在每次 step "
"后、分派下一操作前轮询。GET 不改变它。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "[in] Same executor; this does not refresh device state."
msgstr "[in] 同一执行者；不刷新 device state。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"[out] Disjoint naturally aligned value output, unchanged on error. result is "
"the adapter outcome, wire_result the outer transport outcome (STATE if no "
"outer was admitted)."
msgstr ""
"[out] 不重叠、自然对齐的值输出，错误时保持不变。result 是适配器结果，wire_result 是 outer 传输结果（未准入 outer "
"时为 STATE）。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or CONTEXT; no loan is released."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 CONTEXT；不返还借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "CDC wire values, not a claim that a UART supports every value."
msgstr "CDC 线上取值，不表示 UART 支持每个值。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Last acknowledged software intent; physical application is external."
msgstr "最近已获 ACK 的软件意图；物理应用由外部负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Value copy for external authorization, never a mutable DATA view."
msgstr "供外部授权的值副本，绝不是可修改的 DATA 视图。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid "Fixed caller storage; fields are private while bound."
msgstr "固定的调用者存储；绑定期间字段为私有。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:604
msgid ""
"Metadata require natural C alignment and nonwrapping extents; wire bytes "
"require only byte alignment. Bind once from zero initialization. Never "
"zero/rebind to revoke a loan. The profile, faces and this complete context "
"outlive every packet/outer loan and separate observer. No dynamic allocation,"
" per-instance operation table, worker or default instance exists. Provider "
"faces retain shared readonly ops."
msgstr ""
"元数据须满足其 C 类型的自然对齐，地址范围不得回绕；wire bytes "
"只需字节对齐。由零初始化存储绑定一次。不得通过清零或重新绑定撤销借用。profile、face 及此完整 context 的生命周期须覆盖每个 "
"packet/outer 借用与独立 observer。不使用动态分配、逐实例方法表、worker 或默认实例。provider face 仍共享只读 "
"ops。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:610
msgid "usb_control.h"
msgstr "usb_control.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Caller-owned single-executor EP0 packetizer."
msgstr "由调用者拥有的单执行者 EP0 分包器。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Bind zero-initialized caller storage to a stable validated ROM profile."
msgstr "将调用者零初始化的存储绑定到稳定且已校验的 ROM profile。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Every function except preparation uses one serialized privileged task "
"executor with IRQ masks clear. No callback, second task or ISR may reenter. "
"The owner gives this adapter exclusive EP0 packet use; it retains external "
"event-ring and explicit device recovery policy. No controller/endpoint reset "
"invalidates a loan. A successful bind owns no provider references until "
"begin."
msgstr ""
"除准备函数外，所有函数都由同一个串行化特权 Task 执行者调用，且进入时 IRQ masks 必须 clear。callback、第二个 Task 或 "
"ISR 均不得重入。owner 授予该适配器 EP0 包的独占使用权，仍负责外部 event-ring 管理及显式 device "
"恢复策略。controller／endpoint reset 均不能使借用失效。绑定成功后，在 begin 前不持有 provider 引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Zero-initialized storage, disjoint from the profile."
msgstr "[inout] 已零初始化、且与 profile 不重叠的存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Immutable facts and faces outliving every adapter loan."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的事实与接口面，其生命周期覆盖每一项 adapter 借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success or rejection; no hardware, task or allocation is created."
msgstr "成功或拒绝；不启动硬件，不创建 Task，也不分配内存。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Prepare a reply without borrowing or reading immutable IN bytes."
msgstr "准备回复，不建立借用，也不读取不可变的 IN 字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Task-only preparation; bytes stay alive until the admitted outer acquire "
"SETTLED. A short full-MPS reply emits an acknowledged DATA ZLP."
msgstr ""
"仅限 Task 的准备操作；字节必须保持有效，直到以 acquire 语义观察到已准入 outer 的 SETTLED。短于请求且恰好落在 MPS "
"边界的回复会发出须获 ACK 的 DATA ZLP。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化为 READY，或已消费 SETTLED 结果的存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Immutable external descriptor/reply; NULL only if empty."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的外部 descriptor／reply；仅长度为空时允许 NULL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Available bytes; reply is clipped to SETUP wLength."
msgstr "[in] 可用字节数；回复截断至 SETUP wLength。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Nonzero SETUP identity."
msgstr "[in] 非零 SETUP 身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Absolute independent monotonic deadline for all stages."
msgstr "[in] 覆盖所有阶段的独立绝对单调 deadline。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains no references."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不保留任何引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Prepare caller storage for OUT DATA requiring explicit approval."
msgstr "为需要显式审批的 OUT DATA 准备调用者存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Task-only. Accepted bytes remain borrowed through STATUS or actual drain. "
"DATA_READY grants only the documented const inspection view."
msgstr ""
"仅限 Task。已接受的字节持续被借用，直至 STATUS 完成或实际排空结束。DATA_READY 仅授予文档规定的 const 检查视图。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed request."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未被借用的请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[out] Stable writable payload, no early writes at preparation."
msgstr "[out] 稳定的可写 payload；准备期间不提前写入。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Must cover matching SETUP wLength at admission."
msgstr "[in] 准入时必须覆盖匹配 SETUP 的 wLength。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Absolute independent deadline, including policy delay."
msgstr "[in] 独立的绝对 deadline，包含策略处理延迟。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; no loan before successful begin."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；begin 成功前不建立借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Prepare only the zero-data request's status-IN reply."
msgstr "仅准备零数据请求的 status-IN 回复。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Task-only. External standard-request policy must stage SET_ADDRESS itself and"
" inspect authoritative address/closing state after wire ACK."
msgstr "仅限 Task。外部标准请求策略必须自行暂存 SET_ADDRESS，并在线上 ACK 后检查权威 address／closing 状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Nonzero matching SETUP identity."
msgstr "[in] 非零且匹配的 SETUP 身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Absolute independent deadline."
msgstr "[in] 独立的绝对 deadline。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; no transfer is started."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；不启动传输。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Admit one explicit reply to the current authoritative SETUP epoch."
msgstr "为当前权威 SETUP epoch 准入一个显式回复。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"No packet is submitted by admission. Payload, request, profile and adapter "
"remain alive until acquire-observed outer SETTLED. Never call "
"prepare/reinitialize to revoke a loan. Epochs do not repeat. Products stage "
"SET_ADDRESS explicitly; transport success means wire ACK only."
msgstr ""
"准入本身不提交包。payload、request、profile 和 adapter 必须保持有效，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 outer "
"SETTLED。绝不能通过调用 prepare／重新初始化撤销借用。epoch 不重复。产品显式暂存 SET_ADDRESS；传输成功仅表示线上 ACK。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Bound single-executor adapter; no other live reply."
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定的单执行者 adapter；不存在其他活动回复。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"[inout] READY metadata and disjoint payload. OUT capacity must cover wLength;"
" IN sends min(length,wLength), including required ZLP."
msgstr ""
"[inout] READY 元数据及与其不重叠的 payload。OUT 容量必须覆盖 wLength；IN 发送 "
"min(length,wLength)，包含必要的 ZLP。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; every failure retains no request or payload."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；任何失败均不保留 request 或 payload。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Make one bounded progress step, at most one poll and one packet action."
msgstr "推进一个有界步骤，至多进行一次 poll 和一次 packet 动作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"No queue or worker. All packet deadlines use the outer independent absolute "
"monotonic deadline. Poll while borrowed, even after cancel, reset, SETUP "
"supersession or device stop. Cancel/drain/quarantine retain descriptor bytes "
"and outer context. OUT0 quarantine exposes NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP; only the "
"external controller owner may authorize stop. This adapter never stops the "
"shared controller automatically. One SETTLED packet is folded before "
"observing newer controller epochs."
msgstr ""
"不使用队列或 worker。所有 packet deadline 均使用 outer 独立的绝对单调 deadline。借用期间须持续 "
"poll，即使已发生 cancel、reset、SETUP 替代或 device stop。cancel／drain／quarantine 均保留 "
"descriptor 字节与 outer context。OUT0 quarantine 暴露 NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP；仅外部 "
"controller owner 能授权 stop。该 adapter 绝不会自动停止共享 controller。在观察更新的 controller "
"epoch 前，先折叠一个已 SETTLED 的 packet。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Same serialized executor and lifetime as begin."
msgstr "[inout] 同一个串行化执行者；沿用 begin 的生命周期要求。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success or provider error; an error never revokes accepted storage."
msgstr "成功或 provider 错误；错误绝不撤销已接受的存储借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Request cancellation without revoking the old packet or outer loan."
msgstr "请求取消，但不撤销旧 packet 或 outer 借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"An already acquired STATUS ACK wins. The next step issues at most one packet "
"cancel; continue polling and retain quarantine until actual source "
"withdrawal. OUT0 recovery may need explicit device-owner stop."
msgstr ""
"已以 acquire 语义获取的 STATUS ACK 优先。下一步至多发出一次 packet cancel；须继续 poll，并保留 "
"quarantine，直到实际撤回源。OUT0 恢复可能需要 device owner 显式执行 stop。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Same serialized privileged task executor."
msgstr "[inout] 同一个串行化特权 Task 执行者。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] Exact active outer request, kept alive until SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活动 outer request，保持有效直至 SETTLED。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Exact active SETUP identity; no cross-task raw pointer use."
msgstr "[in] 精确的活动 SETUP 身份；不得跨 Task 使用原始指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success requests drain; STATE rejects stale identity without effects."
msgstr "成功时请求排空；STATE 无效果地拒绝过期身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Inspect completed OUT DATA before the external policy approves STATUS."
msgstr "在外部策略批准 STATUS 前检查已完成的 OUT DATA。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"The view expires at the next same-owner adapter call. No mutation, free, "
"cross-task access or implicit status acknowledgement is allowed."
msgstr "视图在同一 owner 下一次调用 adapter 时失效。不得修改、释放或跨 Task 访问，也不隐含 status 确认。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] DATA_READY with no provider packet references."
msgstr "[in] 处于 DATA_READY，且不存在 provider packet 引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[out] Disjoint value output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 不重叠的值输出；拒绝时保持原值。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success grants a const inspection view only; outer borrow continues."
msgstr "成功仅授予 const 检查视图；outer 借用继续。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Approve OUT policy before STATUS IN, or reject with a bounded STALL."
msgstr "在 STATUS IN 前批准 OUT 策略，或以有界 STALL 拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Bytes, class dispatch, configuration readiness and recovery policy are "
"external. No CDC/HID stack is supplied. A guarded decision excludes an "
"already software-published replacement SETUP. Physical bus packets not yet "
"collected by IRQ are outside that software epoch boundary. Cancellation "
"drains before the outer loan ends."
msgstr ""
"字节、class 分派、configuration 就绪条件及恢复策略由外部负责。不提供 CDC／HID 栈。guard 保护的决定排除已由软件发布的替代"
" SETUP；尚未被 IRQ 采集的物理总线包不属于该软件 epoch 边界。取消须先排空，再结束 outer 借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[inout] DATA_READY same-owner adapter."
msgstr "[inout] 处于 DATA_READY、由同一 owner 管理的 adapter。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Exact active SETUP epoch, checked against fresh state."
msgstr "[in] 精确的活动 SETUP epoch，须根据新获取的状态检查。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] True permits status; false stalls the old transaction."
msgstr "[in] true 允许 status；false 对旧事务执行 STALL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success changes policy only; the next step performs packet/STALL."
msgstr "成功仅改变策略；下一次 step 才执行 packet／STALL。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Copy the last acquired authoritative state and adapter phase."
msgstr "复制最近一次已获取的权威状态及 adapter 阶段。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Call step to refresh controller state. Wire success does not imply "
"address/configuration readiness. Snapshots never release a loan."
msgstr ""
"调用 step 刷新 controller 状态。线上成功不表示 address／configuration 已就绪。snapshot 绝不释放借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "[in] Same single task executor; no provider operation occurs."
msgstr "[in] 同一个单 Task 执行者；不执行 provider 操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Success, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid "Adapter-private fields, caller-owned and fixed capacity."
msgstr "由调用者拥有、容量固定的 adapter 私有字段。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:612
msgid ""
"Public context/request/output metadata require natural C alignment and "
"nonwrapping extents. Misalignment is INVALID before typed access. Pointers "
"still require documented readable/writable storage: numeric checks cannot "
"validate arbitrary address maps or opaque private provider contexts."
msgstr ""
"公共 context／request／output 元数据须按 C 类型自然对齐，且存储范围不得回绕。在 typed 访问前，未对齐地址即被判定为 "
"INVALID。指针仍必须指向文档规定的可读／可写存储：数值检查无法验证任意地址映射或不透明的 provider 私有 context。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:618
msgid "usb_descriptors.h"
msgstr "usb_descriptors.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:620
msgid "Bounded descriptor views; product bytes stay external."
msgstr "有界描述符视图；产品描述符字节仍由外部提供。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:620
msgid "Validate complete device, configuration or string descriptor bytes."
msgstr "校验完整的 device、configuration 或 string 描述符字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:620
msgid ""
"Configuration views require alternate zero, endpoint plans matching selected "
"bulk or interrupt IN ports, consistent totals and unique interface numbers. "
"Interrupt bInterval is a nonzero linear count of full-speed 1 ms frames in "
"external descriptor bytes. Bulk bInterval is not interpreted; no polling is "
"scheduled. Class-specific subordinate bytes are bounds-checked but not "
"decoded. Class dispatch, VID/PID, strings, policy, CDC/HID and descriptor "
"lookup remain external. Success is structural validation, not enumeration or "
"physical qualification. To send bytes, preserve their lifetime through the "
"control adapter's acquire-observed outer SETTLED. The view struct requires "
"natural C alignment; rejection is not an arbitrary address probe. Descriptor "
"bytes need only byte alignment and remain externally readable."
msgstr ""
"configuration 视图要求 alternate zero、与选定 bulk 或 interrupt IN 端口匹配的 endpoint "
"计划、一致的总长度及唯一的 interface 编号。interrupt bInterval 是外部 descriptor 字节中 full-speed "
"1 ms frame 的非零线性计数。bulk bInterval 不作解析，也不调度轮询。class-specific "
"从属字节仅检查边界，不作解码。class 分派、VID/PID、字符串、策略、CDC/HID 及 descriptor "
"查找仍由外部负责。成功仅表示结构校验通过，不表示枚举或物理资格。发送字节时，必须保持其有效，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 control "
"adapter 的 outer SETTLED。view 结构体须按 C 类型自然对齐；拒绝机制不能用于探测任意地址。descriptor 字节仅需 "
"byte alignment，且须保持外部可读。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:620
msgid "[in] Immutable exact selected FS endpoint facts."
msgstr "[in] 选定 FS endpoint 的不可变精确事实。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:620
msgid "[in] Complete external descriptor; never copied/retained."
msgstr "[in] 完整的外部 descriptor；绝不复制或保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:620
msgid "Success, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED, with no hardware or output effects."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED；不产生硬件或输出效果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:626
msgid "user_io_broker.h"
msgstr "user_io_broker.h"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Narrow kernel-invoked user GPIO message contract."
msgstr "由内核调用的窄接口用户 GPIO 消息合同。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Broker and persistent kernel call storage stay provider private."
msgstr "broker 与持久内核调用存储保持提供者私有。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Only scalar GPIO operations are admitted by this message ABI."
msgstr "此消息 ABI 仅允许标量 GPIO 操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Execute one scalar GPIO message through a trusted gateway."
msgstr "通过可信网关执行一个标量 GPIO 消息。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid ""
"Kernel-invoked privileged Thread with incoming masks clear, one serialized "
"broker executor. Principal comes from the configured trusted kernel identity "
"port. Pin both validated memory ranges before any GPIO call; snapshot input "
"once, copy an initialized reply. Kernel call storage is zero-initialized "
"outside user RAM and must outlive retained pins. No OS SVC/MPU/TZ wiring or "
"user privilege elevation is provided by this component."
msgstr ""
"由内核调用的特权 Thread，进入时屏蔽状态必须清除，只有一个串行 broker 执行者。principal 来自配置的可信内核身份接口。在调用任何 "
"GPIO 前，必须固定两个已经验证的内存区间；输入只快照一次，复制已初始化的回复。内核调用存储在用户 RAM "
"外零初始化，其寿命必须覆盖保留的固定区间。该组件不提供 OS SVC/MPU/TZ 接线，也不提升用户权限。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid ""
"REJECTED has accepted=false, no pin/effect. ACCEPTED may already be detached "
"or retain cleanup after a failure."
msgstr ""
"REJECTED 表示 accepted=false，不保留固定区间，也不产生效果。ACCEPTED 可能已经分离，也可能在失败后继续保留清理责任。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Retry retained cleanup without reading users or replaying IO."
msgstr "重试保留的清理，不读取用户存储或重放 I/O。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid ""
"Same privileged serialized kernel owner, incoming masks clear. Successful "
"unpin follows actual provider/observer drain; a failed unpin keeps memory, "
"call slot and identity retained. Does not imply that a previously performed "
"GPIO write can be reversed."
msgstr ""
"同一特权串行内核所有者，进入时屏蔽状态必须清除。只有实际排空提供者和观测者后才能成功解除固定；解除固定失败时，内存、调用槽及身份继续保留。这不表示可以逆转先前已执行的"
" GPIO 写入。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Untrusted copied message; identity never comes from users."
msgstr "来自不可信方的已复制消息；身份绝不取自用户输入。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid ""
"No arbitrary port, MMIO, callback, slot or principal pointer. reserved words "
"must be zero. WRITE has read_mask=0 and disjoint set/reset masks. READ has "
"zero set/reset masks and a positive authorized read_mask. Caller keeps "
"storage immutable until the gateway completes or retains its pin."
msgstr ""
"不接受任意接口、MMIO、回调、槽或 principal 指针。reserved 字必须为零。WRITE 要求 read_mask=0，且 "
"set/reset 掩码不重叠。READ 要求 set/reset 掩码为零，并使用非零且已授权的 "
"read_mask。网关完成前，或固定区间仍保留期间，调用者必须保持存储不可变。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Fully initialized copied result; value is zero for errors/WRITE."
msgstr "完整初始化的复制结果；错误或 WRITE 时 value 为零。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid "Distinguish admission, cleanup retention and possible effect."
msgstr "区分准入、保留清理责任与可能发生的效果。"

#: docs/reference/api/components.md:628
msgid ""
"accepted means at least one memory pin was acquired. On retained=true the "
"exact kernel call slot and user address space remain borrowed. "
"device_effect_possible is set before a WRITE provider call; an error cannot "
"authorize replay. result describes admission/device execution; cleanup_result"
" separately describes the most recent release attempt. This is software "
"responsibility, not physical pin evidence."
msgstr ""
"accepted 表示至少成功固定了一个内存区间。retained=true "
"时，精确的内核调用槽及用户地址空间继续被借用。device_effect_possible 在调用 WRITE "
"提供者前置位；出错不能授权重放。result 描述准入及器件执行结果；cleanup_result "
"独立描述最近一次释放尝试。这是软件责任，不是物理引脚证据。"
